(2823014, 394432, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty setting.  It seems a touch underexposed, probably due to the time of day or weather conditions.  With advanced editing and some basic adjustments (levels, curves) I think you could enrich the overall quality of this image by just playing around.  Hope this is helpful. ;~D</td>', 'Pretty setting.  It seems a touch underexposed, probably due to the time of day or weather conditions.  With advanced editing and some basic adjustments (levels, curves) I think you could enrich the overall quality of this image by just playing around.  Hope this is helpful. ;~D', '2006-09-11 09:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823016, 392060, 58728, '<td valign="top">Weird tree!  Kind of looks like it''s got alien feet or something.</td>', 'Weird tree!  Kind of looks like it''s got alien feet or something.', '2006-09-11 09:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823017, 394247, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I''m not sure if it would be better with out the person or not. 7</td>', 'Very nice shot. I''m not sure if it would be better with out the person or not. 7', '2006-09-11 09:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823019, 393861, 58728, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2006-09-11 09:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823020, 392042, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this but the overall feel of it is rather flat. Sometimes black and white conversions do that when there isn''t enough contrast to begin with. If you study it, you''ll see mostly shadows (black) and midtones (gray) but hardly any highlights( white). Hope this is helpful. ;~D</td>', 'I like the idea of this but the overall feel of it is rather flat. Sometimes black and white conversions do that when there isn''t enough contrast to begin with. If you study it, you''ll see mostly shadows (black) and midtones (gray) but hardly any highlights( white). Hope this is helpful. ;~D', '2006-09-11 09:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823023, 394304, 58728, '<td valign="top">i like it alot.  I like the choice of a green background.</td>', 'i like it alot.  I like the choice of a green background.', '2006-09-11 09:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823025, 393861, 23484, '<td valign="top">Super colors.  They blend so smoothly. 7</td>', 'Super colors.  They blend so smoothly. 7', '2006-09-11 09:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823028, 394312, 58728, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective here.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the perspective here.  Nice shot.', '2006-09-11 09:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
