(2823033, 391222, 23484, '<td valign="top">It certainly is an interesting tree.</td>', 'It certainly is an interesting tree.', '2006-09-11 09:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823038, 394492, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think more color would have been nice.</td>', 'Nice shot but I think more color would have been nice.', '2006-09-11 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823044, 394232, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  ;) I like it.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  ;) I like it.', '2006-09-11 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823045, 393912, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this. Nice and clear with a true feel to it.  I wonder if you played around with some adjustments, if it wouldn''t heighten the tonal quality a bit. Hmmm - just thinking out loud.</td>', 'I like the idea of this. Nice and clear with a true feel to it.  I wonder if you played around with some adjustments, if it wouldn''t heighten the tonal quality a bit. Hmmm - just thinking out loud.', '2006-09-11 09:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823048, 391026, 58728, '<td valign="top">WOW.  This is fantastic.  10.</td>', 'WOW.  This is fantastic.  10.', '2006-09-11 10:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823052, 394063, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the windmill slightly out of focus.  I think it seems a touch overexposed. If it were done at a different time of day, the overal color range might be more intense.  You might''ve been able to fix that with an adjustment of curves and some burn here and there. Overall, nice but could use a little tweaking to my eye. 7</td>', 'I like the composition and the windmill slightly out of focus.  I think it seems a touch overexposed. If it were done at a different time of day, the overal color range might be more intense.  You might''ve been able to fix that with an adjustment of curves and some burn here and there. Overall, nice but could use a little tweaking to my eye. 7', '2006-09-11 10:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823053, 394215, 32345, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I personnally don''t like the borders at the top and bottom (just my humble opinion)</td>', 'Nice picture but I personnally don''t like the borders at the top and bottom (just my humble opinion)', '2006-09-11 10:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823054, 393635, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and color.</td>', 'Nice composition, and color.', '2006-09-11 10:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823055, 394490, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and setting of this tree.  I feel like I''m missing a bit of richness as far as the colors go. It''s amazing what just a bit of adjusting in levels and curves can do. Even contrast and saturation adjustments could give this the POW it deserves.</td>', 'I really like the composition and setting of this tree.  I feel like I''m missing a bit of richness as far as the colors go. It''s amazing what just a bit of adjusting in levels and curves can do. Even contrast and saturation adjustments could give this the POW it deserves.', '2006-09-11 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823060, 392899, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of wide frames, but in this instance, it diminishes the overall quality of the view of this image, to my eye since there is actually no true black in the photo. I love that you centered the tree. I like how you used the sky as the largest part of the image as well.</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of wide frames, but in this instance, it diminishes the overall quality of the view of this image, to my eye since there is actually no true black in the photo. I love that you centered the tree. I like how you used the sky as the largest part of the image as well.', '2006-09-11 10:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823061, 393861, 32345, '<td valign="top">Looks nice, but it just seems a bit too dark.</td>', 'Looks nice, but it just seems a bit too dark.', '2006-09-11 10:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823063, 393972, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL funny title.  With the blanched out cars, what if you did this in high key black and white? Hmmm just a thought.</td>', 'ROFL funny title.  With the blanched out cars, what if you did this in high key black and white? Hmmm just a thought.', '2006-09-11 10:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823064, 392899, 58728, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  10.</td>', 'Lovely.  10.', '2006-09-11 10:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823067, 394181, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the ground up perspective. Seems slightly underexposed, probably due to the time of day.</td>', 'I like the ground up perspective. Seems slightly underexposed, probably due to the time of day.', '2006-09-11 10:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823070, 394181, 58728, '<td valign="top">I love the little pieces of grass that stand out.  Gives the picture a creative twist.  :)</td>', 'I love the little pieces of grass that stand out.  Gives the picture a creative twist.  :)', '2006-09-11 10:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823071, 392964, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition with the girl running down the hill. I wonder if the pastel pallette couldn''t use a smidge of deepening? Maybe that''s just my taste. 7</td>', 'Lovely composition with the girl running down the hill. I wonder if the pastel pallette couldn''t use a smidge of deepening? Maybe that''s just my taste. 7', '2006-09-11 10:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
