(2823098, 394253, 15711, '<td valign="top">The house lights add a nice touch of interest. I think I''d crop out the right side up to the tree''s foliage and clone out the lighting of the right building, as it isn''t a major element and doesn''t really add to the shot. It would help off center the tree and not have the eye go back and forth from one building to the other. 6</td>', 'The house lights add a nice touch of interest. I think I''d crop out the right side up to the tree''s foliage and clone out the lighting of the right building, as it isn''t a major element and doesn''t really add to the shot. It would help off center the tree and not have the eye go back and forth from one building to the other. 6', '2006-09-11 10:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823100, 394088, 32345, '<td valign="top">Post processing used doesn''t work for me. Just my opinion, sorry.</td>', 'Post processing used doesn''t work for me. Just my opinion, sorry.', '2006-09-11 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823102, 393905, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever and rather abstract interpretation. I like it.  Quite an eye to find and capture that particular palm.</td>', 'Clever and rather abstract interpretation. I like it.  Quite an eye to find and capture that particular palm.', '2006-09-11 10:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823103, 392964, 15358, '<td valign="top">a nice shot,  lacking clarity.</td>', 'a nice shot,  lacking clarity.', '2006-09-11 10:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823105, 394506, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a Germaine feel to it.  I like the softness and the single saturation of green works.  I even like the centering of the subject.  Interesting and nice. 7</td>', 'This has a Germaine feel to it.  I like the softness and the single saturation of green works.  I even like the centering of the subject.  Interesting and nice. 7', '2006-09-11 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
