(2823259, 393656, 49930, '<td valign="top">Love the use of a model here - adds more interest to the single tree theme. I also like the way you cant see her face (doesn''t take away from the main subject). Nice exposure - the B&amp;W adds drama to the scene. A little bit of dodging &amp; burning done to the tree ? A lovely shot - best of luck.</td>', 'Love the use of a model here - adds more interest to the single tree theme. I also like the way you cant see her face (doesn''t take away from the main subject). Nice exposure - the B&W adds drama to the scene. A little bit of dodging & burning done to the tree ? A lovely shot - best of luck.', '2006-09-11 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
