(2823269, 394385, 49930, '<td valign="top">Nice brokh - but the pink I find a little distracting. A nice clean shot. The green could have been a little more saturated - just to give the bonsai a little more zap.</td>', 'Nice brokh - but the pink I find a little distracting. A nice clean shot. The green could have been a little more saturated - just to give the bonsai a little more zap.', '2006-09-11 10:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823275, 393415, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really love the composition here. What I don''t like is where you erased or enhanced only parts of the background. I would have prefered to see it all one shade (either all white or all off white). As it is, it just looks like a sloppy editing job. Still, I would imagine this will do well.</td>', 'I really love the composition here. What I don''t like is where you erased or enhanced only parts of the background. I would have prefered to see it all one shade (either all white or all off white). As it is, it just looks like a sloppy editing job. Still, I would imagine this will do well.', '2006-09-11 11:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823283, 394438, 49930, '<td valign="top">Love the sky in this. Beautiful colours. But the dark foreground takes away a little from it. Maybe cropped a little closer to the base of the tree on the bottom might help.</td>', 'Love the sky in this. Beautiful colours. But the dark foreground takes away a little from it. Maybe cropped a little closer to the base of the tree on the bottom might help.', '2006-09-11 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823290, 392421, 49930, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this I love. I think you have captured a great image with the the two curves (of the hills) and the single palm. Great shot.</td>', 'The simplicity of this I love. I think you have captured a great image with the the two curves (of the hills) and the single palm. Great shot.', '2006-09-11 11:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
