(2823495, 394322, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the model''s face, as well as the pose. Unfortunately it seems like she is the main subject, rather than the tree.  It might have been better to place her in an outside environment rather than having the white background.</td>', 'I like the expression on the model''s face, as well as the pose. Unfortunately it seems like she is the main subject, rather than the tree.  It might have been better to place her in an outside environment rather than having the white background.', '2006-09-11 12:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
