(2823556, 393112, 51538, '<td valign="top">What a fine combination of intricate details and simple form.  Lovely light.  Your photo captures the feeling very well. 9.</td>', 'What a fine combination of intricate details and simple form.  Lovely light.  Your photo captures the feeling very well. 9.', '2006-09-11 12:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823561, 394506, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. Looks kind of digital, dreamy, and simple. Nice.</td>', 'Cool effect. Looks kind of digital, dreamy, and simple. Nice.', '2006-09-11 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823562, 392824, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp, colorful, well composed image.</td>', 'Nice sharp, colorful, well composed image.', '2006-09-11 12:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823563, 394145, 51538, '<td valign="top">Single trees are not so easy to find (especially in a large city where I am).  I can understand a search for a candidate is hard.  The colours are nice and subtle on this image.</td>', 'Single trees are not so easy to find (especially in a large city where I am).  I can understand a search for a candidate is hard.  The colours are nice and subtle on this image.', '2006-09-11 12:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823565, 393443, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s one way to solve the hard-to-find aspect of this challenge.  Ball is on the large size, I think. ;-)</td>', 'That''s one way to solve the hard-to-find aspect of this challenge.  Ball is on the large size, I think. ;-)', '2006-09-11 12:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823567, 394154, 51538, '<td valign="top">Your tree specimen exhibits a nicely intricate form.  Colours are rather wonderful as well.  Perhaps a bit on the noisy side?</td>', 'Your tree specimen exhibits a nicely intricate form.  Colours are rather wonderful as well.  Perhaps a bit on the noisy side?', '2006-09-11 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823569, 393818, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous framing. I love how it''s framed at the top and bottom, and the tree trunk makes the frame feel balanced left-to-right. Awesome.</td>', 'Fabulous framing. I love how it''s framed at the top and bottom, and the tree trunk makes the frame feel balanced left-to-right. Awesome.', '2006-09-11 12:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823570, 393971, 51538, '<td valign="top">Finding a tree, single, without background trees is something I agonized over and eventually decided not to enter the challenge.  You have a nice lot of good specimens there to choose from.</td>', 'Finding a tree, single, without background trees is something I agonized over and eventually decided not to enter the challenge.  You have a nice lot of good specimens there to choose from.', '2006-09-11 12:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823575, 392322, 51538, '<td valign="top">INteresting moss there too.  I imagine this is New Zealand or other Southern Hemisphere location.  Nice to see Spring as I come into Autumn.</td>', 'INteresting moss there too.  I imagine this is New Zealand or other Southern Hemisphere location.  Nice to see Spring as I come into Autumn.', '2006-09-11 12:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823577, 394014, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. Nice composition, nice clean image, but I think it has less challenge-meeting potential since there is not "a single tree" that appears to be the main subject.</td>', 'Cool effect. Nice composition, nice clean image, but I think it has less challenge-meeting potential since there is not "a single tree" that appears to be the main subject.', '2006-09-11 12:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823582, 394185, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely fiery sky and lonely pine tree.  Those three bits of something or other in the foreground could be gone, I think.</td>', 'Lovely fiery sky and lonely pine tree.  Those three bits of something or other in the foreground could be gone, I think.', '2006-09-11 12:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823585, 393597, 51538, '<td valign="top">A stereotypical Christmas treee awaiting the fait of the one Hans Christian Andersen told about.</td>', 'A stereotypical Christmas treee awaiting the fait of the one Hans Christian Andersen told about.', '2006-09-11 12:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823587, 393905, 45754, '<td valign="top">I like the mood here and the arrows pointing to the single tree :o)</td>', 'I like the mood here and the arrows pointing to the single tree :o)', '2006-09-11 12:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823588, 392824, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and cleanly rendered.  Good work.</td>', 'Nicely composed and cleanly rendered.  Good work.', '2006-09-11 12:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823590, 394227, 51538, '<td valign="top">Looks like the water meadows around Oxford in England... Reminds me of places.  As such, I love this early morning walk image. 9.</td>', 'Looks like the water meadows around Oxford in England... Reminds me of places.  As such, I love this early morning walk image. 9.', '2006-09-11 12:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823591, 394229, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment.  It all work well together and I find it entertaining. 8.</td>', 'Nice treatment.  It all work well together and I find it entertaining. 8.', '2006-09-11 12:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823598, 394079, 51538, '<td valign="top">Trees take a time to grow (unlike, say, weeds).  I always feel sorrow when I see one come down due to wind or vandalism...  But then again, the recycling that goes on on the forest floor is nourishment for a future generation of trees.</td>', 'Trees take a time to grow (unlike, say, weeds).  I always feel sorrow when I see one come down due to wind or vandalism...  But then again, the recycling that goes on on the forest floor is nourishment for a future generation of trees.', '2006-09-11 12:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823600, 393787, 51538, '<td valign="top">You have a myriad of subtle colours in your photo.  The dry end-of-summer grass is lovely.  8.</td>', 'You have a myriad of subtle colours in your photo.  The dry end-of-summer grass is lovely.  8.', '2006-09-11 12:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823601, 394374, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia tone.  Works wonders for this photo.</td>', 'Nice sepia tone.  Works wonders for this photo.', '2006-09-11 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823602, 393806, 22748, '<td valign="top">Creative! This had me looking for a "This photo has been validated" message. :) I really like what you''ve done. The composition is good, you appear to have deliberately chosen what you wanted to appear in the image and how to communicate that to the viewer. Really a work of art.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would change is that the tree foliage looks too bright (and appears to be illuminated from THIS side of the tree) since the moon is on the other side of the tree. This side should be quite a bit darker to make it look more consistent.<br/> <br/>My final words, though: this is a work of art. Nice work.</td>', 'Creative! This had me looking for a "This photo has been validated" message. :) I really like what you''ve done. The composition is good, you appear to have deliberately chosen what you wanted to appear in the image and how to communicate that to the viewer. Really a work of art. The only thing I would change is that the tree foliage looks too bright (and appears to be illuminated from THIS side of the tree) since the moon is on the other side of the tree. This side should be quite a bit darker to make it look more consistent. My final words, though: this is a work of art. Nice work.', '2006-09-11 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823606, 394476, 51538, '<td valign="top">The sort of image I think I have seen before a few times - but slightly different.The bright foreground does help to emphasize the blues in the background.  I like the overall effect. 8.</td>', 'The sort of image I think I have seen before a few times - but slightly different.The bright foreground does help to emphasize the blues in the background.  I like the overall effect. 8.', '2006-09-11 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823607, 394399, 51538, '<td valign="top">Cow incognito with tree.  There is a very dry sense of humour at work here somewhere ;-)</td>', 'Cow incognito with tree.  There is a very dry sense of humour at work here somewhere ;-)', '2006-09-11 12:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823609, 394245, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice smell I can sense.</td>', 'Nice smell I can sense.', '2006-09-11 12:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823613, 394215, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely coloured tone there.  Looks like a part of England or Wales in which there are remnants of old earthworks from past centuries.  Very nice work. 9.</td>', 'Lovely coloured tone there.  Looks like a part of England or Wales in which there are remnants of old earthworks from past centuries.  Very nice work. 9.', '2006-09-11 12:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823614, 393018, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fantastic B&amp;W image. The contrasty feel is really great. The high contrast just goes great with the scraggly, jaggy shape of the tree, which looks like a bolt of lightning.</td>', 'Fantastic B&W image. The contrasty feel is really great. The high contrast just goes great with the scraggly, jaggy shape of the tree, which looks like a bolt of lightning.', '2006-09-11 12:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823615, 392613, 51538, '<td valign="top">A fiery impressionistic scene there.  One can sense movement in the sky too. 8.</td>', 'A fiery impressionistic scene there.  One can sense movement in the sky too. 8.', '2006-09-11 12:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823621, 391007, 51538, '<td valign="top">Birch trees are, IMO, some of the most beautiful.  Yours is no exception. 7.</td>', 'Birch trees are, IMO, some of the most beautiful.  Yours is no exception. 7.', '2006-09-11 12:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823626, 394218, 51538, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of bonsai as a way out of my tree-less NYC situation.  You make bonsai look sinsister.  After all, it''s only the gentle torture over many, many years of a living organism, the gentle amputation of its feeling tendrils, the imprisoning in accomodation far too small for it..... ;-) 8.</td>', 'I was thinking of bonsai as a way out of my tree-less NYC situation.  You make bonsai look sinsister.  After all, it''s only the gentle torture over many, many years of a living organism, the gentle amputation of its feeling tendrils, the imprisoning in accomodation far too small for it..... ;-) 8.', '2006-09-11 12:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823628, 394377, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene which invites the viewer to come and explore.  I like the b/w treatment. 7.</td>', 'Pretty scene which invites the viewer to come and explore.  I like the b/w treatment. 7.', '2006-09-11 12:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823629, 393952, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but not so interesting to look at. I think it might have been more successful if you had colored all the leaves on the tree and dropped the color from the rest of the foliage. The truck merges with the background beacuse it''s desaturated. A more limited depth of field to blur the background might have made this less busy....after noting the unusual color of the tree, I''m left pondering why the building says "City of Refuge" and why there''s a refuse bin in the foreground. I also find the tower poking over the building a distraction. Perhaps a different angle of view would have improved the composition?</td>', 'Interesting idea but not so interesting to look at. I think it might have been more successful if you had colored all the leaves on the tree and dropped the color from the rest of the foliage. The truck merges with the background beacuse it''s desaturated. A more limited depth of field to blur the background might have made this less busy....after noting the unusual color of the tree, I''m left pondering why the building says "City of Refuge" and why there''s a refuse bin in the foreground. I also find the tower poking over the building a distraction. Perhaps a different angle of view would have improved the composition?', '2006-09-11 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823631, 393059, 51538, '<td valign="top">Surely Yorkshire above the dales.  Nice clean air there and the limestone foreground adds great textural interest. 8.</td>', 'Surely Yorkshire above the dales.  Nice clean air there and the limestone foreground adds great textural interest. 8.', '2006-09-11 12:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823636, 393240, 51538, '<td valign="top">Trees sometimes have that habit - they grow where one least expects them to.  Usually, it is the Strangler Fig vine which parasitizes the tree - but you have capture something which is the other way about.</td>', 'Trees sometimes have that habit - they grow where one least expects them to.  Usually, it is the Strangler Fig vine which parasitizes the tree - but you have capture something which is the other way about.', '2006-09-11 12:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823639, 392464, 16488, '<td valign="top">This image is overexposed for no apparent good reason. Colors are off. Fringing is apparent. I''m afraid the technical issues ruin any message you may have had to convey.</td>', 'This image is overexposed for no apparent good reason. Colors are off. Fringing is apparent. I''m afraid the technical issues ruin any message you may have had to convey.', '2006-09-11 12:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823643, 391026, 22748, '<td valign="top">This has a great dramatic feel. Something about the contrasty look. The bright highlights of the breaking wave and the cloud highlights contrasting with the overall darker tones.</td>', 'This has a great dramatic feel. Something about the contrasty look. The bright highlights of the breaking wave and the cloud highlights contrasting with the overall darker tones.', '2006-09-11 12:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823646, 394193, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely orange.  Anatomical hills.  Perfect tree.  If I was you, I would be out there a lot of times capturing this scene in all sorts of light and weather.  It''s a commercial image.  But I think that in this case, a closer view would have been better.  Crop the bottom fifth and then use the lower right hand quarter.  I''d even buy a longer lens to capture this scene... ;-)</td>', 'Lovely orange.  Anatomical hills.  Perfect tree.  If I was you, I would be out there a lot of times capturing this scene in all sorts of light and weather.  It''s a commercial image.  But I think that in this case, a closer view would have been better.  Crop the bottom fifth and then use the lower right hand quarter.  I''d even buy a longer lens to capture this scene... ;-)', '2006-09-11 12:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823647, 394412, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Great simple composition, fantastic color, and the stars are so cool. The silhoutting is great. I love it.</td>', 'Awesome. Great simple composition, fantastic color, and the stars are so cool. The silhoutting is great. I love it.', '2006-09-11 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823651, 392473, 51538, '<td valign="top">Grand view, lush green, wonderful shadows. 9.</td>', 'Grand view, lush green, wonderful shadows. 9.', '2006-09-11 12:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823652, 394248, 16488, '<td valign="top">The lighting helps the subject stand out from the background. I think, however, that is not enough to make me interested in the subject. The dark horizontal horizon divides the trees at an awkward place. The foliage on the trees seems grainy/pixelated. The sky is blown out. Technicals can really make or break an image!</td>', 'The lighting helps the subject stand out from the background. I think, however, that is not enough to make me interested in the subject. The dark horizontal horizon divides the trees at an awkward place. The foliage on the trees seems grainy/pixelated. The sky is blown out. Technicals can really make or break an image!', '2006-09-11 12:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823654, 394168, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like this intimate view of the tree and bit of grass.  The path leading into the distance is nicely suggestive. 8.</td>', 'I like this intimate view of the tree and bit of grass.  The path leading into the distance is nicely suggestive. 8.', '2006-09-11 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823658, 394379, 51538, '<td valign="top">No trees excluded and since you made this one so outrageously bright, I think it works well even if it is plastic and metal.</td>', 'No trees excluded and since you made this one so outrageously bright, I think it works well even if it is plastic and metal.', '2006-09-11 12:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823661, 394025, 22748, '<td valign="top">LOL on the title. :) <br/>Nice clouds.</td>', 'LOL on the title. :) Nice clouds.', '2006-09-11 12:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823662, 393973, 51538, '<td valign="top">Wonderful trees supportive of so much in the way of insect life.  Your photo caputres the oak-ness of this oak.</td>', 'Wonderful trees supportive of so much in the way of insect life.  Your photo caputres the oak-ness of this oak.', '2006-09-11 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823663, 391007, 22748, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you made the sharply defined blue lines, but it''s cool.</td>', 'I don''t know how you made the sharply defined blue lines, but it''s cool.', '2006-09-11 12:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823665, 394334, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely backlit leaves.  Widowmaker in terms of its hanging potential?</td>', 'Nicely backlit leaves.  Widowmaker in terms of its hanging potential?', '2006-09-11 12:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823667, 390692, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s a peaceful location.  Nourishing a grand oak tree would indeed be my last wish.</td>', 'That''s a peaceful location.  Nourishing a grand oak tree would indeed be my last wish.', '2006-09-11 12:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823668, 393147, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the separation of the subject from the background. There are interesting patterns and texture here. I wish the tree were sharper, it seems rather fuzzy....out of focus? pixelated?</td>', 'I like the composition and the separation of the subject from the background. There are interesting patterns and texture here. I wish the tree were sharper, it seems rather fuzzy....out of focus? pixelated?', '2006-09-11 12:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823670, 390850, 60329, '<td valign="top">The challenge seemed to be to have a "single tree" as the main focus of the shot and I don''t see this as qualifying. Still nice.</td>', 'The challenge seemed to be to have a "single tree" as the main focus of the shot and I don''t see this as qualifying. Still nice.', '2006-09-11 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823671, 394456, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting zoom effect.  I wonder if it might have worked better with the central focus on the tree itself?</td>', 'Interesting zoom effect.  I wonder if it might have worked better with the central focus on the tree itself?', '2006-09-11 12:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823679, 394312, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting gulley erosion there.  Bespeaks of a heavy rainfall at times.  The tree is a little owerawed by the greater picture.</td>', 'Interesting gulley erosion there.  Bespeaks of a heavy rainfall at times.  The tree is a little owerawed by the greater picture.', '2006-09-11 13:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823681, 392899, 22748, '<td valign="top">Love this image. I like the border, although I''m sure you''ll get comments saying the opposite, so I wanted to say that. The simple composition, open spaces, simple color scheme, all very nice.</td>', 'Love this image. I like the border, although I''m sure you''ll get comments saying the opposite, so I wanted to say that. The simple composition, open spaces, simple color scheme, all very nice.', '2006-09-11 13:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823684, 394129, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and very interesting tree specimen.  Great timing and nice focus. 8.</td>', 'Lovely colours and very interesting tree specimen.  Great timing and nice focus. 8.', '2006-09-11 13:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823688, 393701, 51538, '<td valign="top">The sky is huge and too lovely to lose.  You did use the rule of thirds there I think! ;-)  Nice work.</td>', 'The sky is huge and too lovely to lose.  You did use the rule of thirds there I think! ;-)  Nice work.', '2006-09-11 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823692, 392578, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems crisp and in focus in this image.</td>', 'Nothing seems crisp and in focus in this image.', '2006-09-11 13:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823694, 393737, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice colours within.  The waves in the grain are interesting.</td>', 'Nice colours within.  The waves in the grain are interesting.', '2006-09-11 13:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823698, 394411, 51538, '<td valign="top">Overall, this is a nice effect.  I think there is some noise which could be treated to make this even better and the lens flare might be worth cloning out too.</td>', 'Overall, this is a nice effect.  I think there is some noise which could be treated to make this even better and the lens flare might be worth cloning out too.', '2006-09-11 13:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823699, 393861, 22748, '<td valign="top">A little too dark... I can''t make out much.</td>', 'A little too dark... I can''t make out much.', '2006-09-11 13:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823700, 392790, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s dynamic and unnatural.  Unusual but viewable.  My eye avoids the tree for some reason though.</td>', 'It''s dynamic and unnatural.  Unusual but viewable.  My eye avoids the tree for some reason though.', '2006-09-11 13:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823704, 394248, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely outstanding tree.  You picked a great moment of light to take this photo.</td>', 'Nicely outstanding tree.  You picked a great moment of light to take this photo.', '2006-09-11 13:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823707, 394304, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well done.  That looks like a little cedar tree - perhaps a Northern White Cedar.  Nicely composed.  Perhaps a slightly lusher specimen of this evergreeen would have been even better.  The background green, IMO, is a bit on the strong side.</td>', 'Well done.  That looks like a little cedar tree - perhaps a Northern White Cedar.  Nicely composed.  Perhaps a slightly lusher specimen of this evergreeen would have been even better.  The background green, IMO, is a bit on the strong side.', '2006-09-11 13:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823708, 394503, 16488, '<td valign="top">High key is interesting but the foggy area on the trunk and the too blown-out branches in the upper right corner keep me from wanting to stay with this image and explore its detail.</td>', 'High key is interesting but the foggy area on the trunk and the too blown-out branches in the upper right corner keep me from wanting to stay with this image and explore its detail.', '2006-09-11 13:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823710, 394316, 51538, '<td valign="top">There''s not much space so they tend to get tall fast and bushy at the top.  Your photo tells a story common in nature.</td>', 'There''s not much space so they tend to get tall fast and bushy at the top.  Your photo tells a story common in nature.', '2006-09-11 13:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823712, 394019, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is an interesting photo.  The shadows impart a certain feeling appropriate for the scene - but they also exclude the viewer from penetrating the view.</td>', 'That is an interesting photo.  The shadows impart a certain feeling appropriate for the scene - but they also exclude the viewer from penetrating the view.', '2006-09-11 13:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823713, 394144, 51538, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the sky does not cooperate.  I think a little deeper blue would have helped.  But then again, what do I know ;-)  It has a feeling of paucity about the photo.</td>', 'Sometimes the sky does not cooperate.  I think a little deeper blue would have helped.  But then again, what do I know ;-)  It has a feeling of paucity about the photo.', '2006-09-11 13:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823715, 393573, 51538, '<td valign="top">Center is OK with me.  Colours are lovely.  Tree shape very nice.  It''s a deadly simple image, verging on almost too simple.  But I like the overall effect. 8.</td>', 'Center is OK with me.  Colours are lovely.  Tree shape very nice.  It''s a deadly simple image, verging on almost too simple.  But I like the overall effect. 8.', '2006-09-11 13:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823718, 394062, 51538, '<td valign="top">The intricate details of roots when they are exposed in paths etc are wonderful.  A good photo of the roots can imply a whole vast tree without showing a leaf.  I wish there was more light (and therefore more detail) in your photo.</td>', 'The intricate details of roots when they are exposed in paths etc are wonderful.  A good photo of the roots can imply a whole vast tree without showing a leaf.  I wish there was more light (and therefore more detail) in your photo.', '2006-09-11 13:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823720, 393712, 51538, '<td valign="top">The sky is dramatic and I imagine it was changing fast.  If a little more light was present, the silhouette would have been that much better.</td>', 'The sky is dramatic and I imagine it was changing fast.  If a little more light was present, the silhouette would have been that much better.', '2006-09-11 13:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823723, 394164, 51538, '<td valign="top">Maybe, maybe not?  Does something about this fir tree imply a snowy winter is coming?  I like the lush green needles.  Your depth of field is pretty decent.</td>', 'Maybe, maybe not?  Does something about this fir tree imply a snowy winter is coming?  I like the lush green needles.  Your depth of field is pretty decent.', '2006-09-11 13:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823726, 393790, 51538, '<td valign="top">The leaves are a rich lovely colour.  I wish there was more form visible to enjoy.</td>', 'The leaves are a rich lovely colour.  I wish there was more form visible to enjoy.', '2006-09-11 13:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823728, 394222, 51538, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, refreshing image.  Nice focus and depth of field.  Lovely lush green pine too. 9.</td>', 'Wonderful, refreshing image.  Nice focus and depth of field.  Lovely lush green pine too. 9.', '2006-09-11 13:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823729, 393018, 51538, '<td valign="top">Bifurcating into eternity.  Nice b/w photo.</td>', 'Bifurcating into eternity.  Nice b/w photo.', '2006-09-11 13:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823731, 391670, 51538, '<td valign="top">Love the lush vegetables as a general setting for this fine willow? tree.  Overall, a nice image and a location worth revisiting, IMO.</td>', 'Love the lush vegetables as a general setting for this fine willow? tree.  Overall, a nice image and a location worth revisiting, IMO.', '2006-09-11 13:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823735, 392042, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice steely water there.  I would have cheated and cloned out the half tree on the right.</td>', 'Nice steely water there.  I would have cheated and cloned out the half tree on the right.', '2006-09-11 13:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823736, 394289, 51538, '<td valign="top">Trees growing low to the ground and branching early are a favourite in Japanese gardens and it is easy to understand why.</td>', 'Trees growing low to the ground and branching early are a favourite in Japanese gardens and it is easy to understand why.', '2006-09-11 13:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823739, 394434, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely isolated image, in situ.  Well photographed.</td>', 'Nicely isolated image, in situ.  Well photographed.', '2006-09-11 13:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823740, 394001, 16488, '<td valign="top">Light is very important in creating a successful image. The light here is in the sky and is very washed out. The subject is in shadow and merges with everything around it making it difficult to see. A different angle of view or different light would have helped make the little tree stand out better as the subject.</td>', 'Light is very important in creating a successful image. The light here is in the sky and is very washed out. The subject is in shadow and merges with everything around it making it difficult to see. A different angle of view or different light would have helped make the little tree stand out better as the subject.', '2006-09-11 13:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823743, 394336, 51538, '<td valign="top">This is quite an exciting photo.  The near and far perspective works very well. 8.</td>', 'This is quite an exciting photo.  The near and far perspective works very well. 8.', '2006-09-11 13:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823746, 392464, 51538, '<td valign="top">INteresting tree.  Wish the flare as not in the lower right corner though.</td>', 'INteresting tree.  Wish the flare as not in the lower right corner though.', '2006-09-11 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823749, 392930, 16488, '<td valign="top">The subject is interesting against the sky but centering it in the image makes it very static to look at.</td>', 'The subject is interesting against the sky but centering it in the image makes it very static to look at.', '2006-09-11 13:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823752, 393861, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple to the point of almost nothing.  But for that probably better.  Less is more in this case.  Nice work. 8.</td>', 'Simple to the point of almost nothing.  But for that probably better.  Less is more in this case.  Nice work. 8.', '2006-09-11 13:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823755, 393973, 16488, '<td valign="top">The angle of view is nice because the branches spread out to fill the frame. Unfortunately, the blown out highlights, overexposed trunk and pixelated details hurt the pleasure of viewing it.</td>', 'The angle of view is nice because the branches spread out to fill the frame. Unfortunately, the blown out highlights, overexposed trunk and pixelated details hurt the pleasure of viewing it.', '2006-09-11 13:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823757, 392874, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wish the tree were in focus and the lighting not flat. The people add nothing to the composition....should have let them walk out of the frame, perhaps.</td>', 'Wish the tree were in focus and the lighting not flat. The people add nothing to the composition....should have let them walk out of the frame, perhaps.', '2006-09-11 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823759, 393415, 51538, '<td valign="top">Indeed it is and there are a good few years growth there.  The symbiotic activity between bacteria, fungus and roots takes a while to develop.  I hope you transpanted this specimen carefully.  It''s a nice botanical photo, providing you know the names (scientific names that is) of the tree and the visible fungus.</td>', 'Indeed it is and there are a good few years growth there.  The symbiotic activity between bacteria, fungus and roots takes a while to develop.  I hope you transpanted this specimen carefully.  It''s a nice botanical photo, providing you know the names (scientific names that is) of the tree and the visible fungus.', '2006-09-11 13:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823762, 392140, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely blue.  Reminds me of Outback fires and the smoke.  Pleaant sense of desolation applies here.</td>', 'Nicely blue.  Reminds me of Outback fires and the smoke.  Pleaant sense of desolation applies here.', '2006-09-11 13:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823766, 394519, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty tree.  Nice composition.  But I am a purist.  I simply hate plastic in a woody, leafy environment.  Even though plastic does make nice boats... ;-)</td>', 'Pretty tree.  Nice composition.  But I am a purist.  I simply hate plastic in a woody, leafy environment.  Even though plastic does make nice boats... ;-)', '2006-09-11 13:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823767, 392421, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and your title concurs.</td>', 'Nice composition and your title concurs.', '2006-09-11 13:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823768, 394026, 51538, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pine tree there.  The corn stalks make a nice setting too.</td>', 'Beautiful pine tree there.  The corn stalks make a nice setting too.', '2006-09-11 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823769, 394019, 16488, '<td valign="top">This subject had potential but the image is dark and the tree merges with the background. Burning of the sky and lighter graves is evident...better to get the exposure right in camera whenever possible.</td>', 'This subject had potential but the image is dark and the tree merges with the background. Burning of the sky and lighter graves is evident...better to get the exposure right in camera whenever possible.', '2006-09-11 13:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823772, 394184, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well done - not an easy challenge for us town mice.  The green of the leaves lifts this photo.</td>', 'Well done - not an easy challenge for us town mice.  The green of the leaves lifts this photo.', '2006-09-11 13:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823774, 393227, 16488, '<td valign="top">Zoom technique just doesn''t work for me in this image...it throbs but why?</td>', 'Zoom technique just doesn''t work for me in this image...it throbs but why?', '2006-09-11 13:27:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2823776, 393971, 16488, '<td valign="top">Seems overexposed. Title doesn''t convince me...."stately"?</td>', 'Seems overexposed. Title doesn''t convince me...."stately"?', '2006-09-11 13:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823783, 391071, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and, though not an age-old pure bonsai specimen, a good shaped "tree."  I think that ou could have positioned the tree out of its underlying tray in a position with a slightly better, more lush and gently lit background.  Also remove that out of place grey pebble because, nice as it is and single as it is, it is unnatural for the art of bonsai.  My 0.02c which is worth nothing really. ;-)</td>', 'Nice idea and, though not an age-old pure bonsai specimen, a good shaped "tree."  I think that ou could have positioned the tree out of its underlying tray in a position with a slightly better, more lush and gently lit background.  Also remove that out of place grey pebble because, nice as it is and single as it is, it is unnatural for the art of bonsai.  My 0.02c which is worth nothing really. ;-)', '2006-09-11 13:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823784, 394088, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the inversion but the composition doesn''t help me enjoy the subject....too much tree trunk, too little of the leaves which are the most interesting part of the image.</td>', 'I like the inversion but the composition doesn''t help me enjoy the subject....too much tree trunk, too little of the leaves which are the most interesting part of the image.', '2006-09-11 13:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823788, 394503, 51538, '<td valign="top">That pine is lime green!  Never seen one like that in my life.  The positioning of the tree in your photo is rather good.  I would just prefer no lens flare and deeper colours.</td>', 'That pine is lime green!  Never seen one like that in my life.  The positioning of the tree in your photo is rather good.  I would just prefer no lens flare and deeper colours.', '2006-09-11 13:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823790, 394211, 51538, '<td valign="top">Everything is utterly 3D there.  It''s like Henri Rousseau''s paintings.  Simple forms with shady and light sides.  I love it! 8.</td>', 'Everything is utterly 3D there.  It''s like Henri Rousseau''s paintings.  Simple forms with shady and light sides.  I love it! 8.', '2006-09-11 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823794, 394510, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very busy composition. Lighting with the blownout higlights hurts rather than helps.</td>', 'Very busy composition. Lighting with the blownout higlights hurts rather than helps.', '2006-09-11 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823796, 393624, 51538, '<td valign="top">The tree is an excuse for a nice photo of the sky... If you have zoomed in on the tree, perhaps there would have been better justification!  It is a dramatic sky though.</td>', 'The tree is an excuse for a nice photo of the sky... If you have zoomed in on the tree, perhaps there would have been better justification!  It is a dramatic sky though.', '2006-09-11 13:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823799, 393952, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice tree, am not averse to the poisonous colouring either.  But am not a fan of the lettering on the building.</td>', 'Nice tree, am not averse to the poisonous colouring either.  But am not a fan of the lettering on the building.', '2006-09-11 13:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823800, 394077, 16488, '<td valign="top">The colors are pretty. I like the silhouette. The sun, however, is falling out of the image....a different composition would be more pleasing.</td>', 'The colors are pretty. I like the silhouette. The sun, however, is falling out of the image....a different composition would be more pleasing.', '2006-09-11 13:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823804, 394516, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wish the red of the tree "popped"...as is, the image is flat (without depth).</td>', 'Wish the red of the tree "popped"...as is, the image is flat (without depth).', '2006-09-11 13:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823807, 394009, 16488, '<td valign="top">Busy composition with cars and building, etc. Fuzzy and unsharp, the lights in the tree are difficult to appreciate.</td>', 'Busy composition with cars and building, etc. Fuzzy and unsharp, the lights in the tree are difficult to appreciate.', '2006-09-11 13:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823811, 394144, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The isolation of the tree along the fence line is pleasing. The reds and yellows seem to be oversaturated, however.</td>', 'I like the composition. The isolation of the tree along the fence line is pleasing. The reds and yellows seem to be oversaturated, however.', '2006-09-11 13:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823813, 391472, 16488, '<td valign="top">This lacks the crispness of focus that would make this more pleasing to view.</td>', 'This lacks the crispness of focus that would make this more pleasing to view.', '2006-09-11 13:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823821, 393712, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I wish the background was in-focus though.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I wish the background was in-focus though.', '2006-09-11 13:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823825, 392874, 23484, '<td valign="top">Good picture but everything seems to be too green.</td>', 'Good picture but everything seems to be too green.', '2006-09-11 13:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823827, 394517, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice place to spend those hot summer days. Good job.</td>', 'Nice place to spend those hot summer days. Good job.', '2006-09-11 13:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823830, 393880, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love this foggy shot.  Too bad you couldn''t get those other trees out of the picture.</td>', 'I love this foggy shot.  Too bad you couldn''t get those other trees out of the picture.', '2006-09-11 13:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823831, 394373, 23484, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to hazy however it was composed well.</td>', 'This shot seems to hazy however it was composed well.', '2006-09-11 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823835, 394470, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting bokeh off in the distance.</td>', 'Interesting bokeh off in the distance.', '2006-09-11 13:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823836, 394209, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.', '2006-09-11 13:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823838, 394155, 51538, '<td valign="top">Upstanding and colourful.  I like the rooftop silhouettes on the right side.</td>', 'Upstanding and colourful.  I like the rooftop silhouettes on the right side.', '2006-09-11 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823841, 394458, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I would love to have seen this in color.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I would love to have seen this in color.', '2006-09-11 13:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823846, 394470, 16488, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of so much foliage on the bottom and so little on the top makes this "tree" picture seem upside down.</td>', 'The inclusion of so much foliage on the bottom and so little on the top makes this "tree" picture seem upside down.', '2006-09-11 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823848, 394494, 23484, '<td valign="top">Background seems way to busy.</td>', 'Background seems way to busy.', '2006-09-11 13:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823849, 393224, 51538, '<td valign="top">Your photo tells a story.  The forces that bring such grand trees to their knees, though long gone, still linger in such images.</td>', 'Your photo tells a story.  The forces that bring such grand trees to their knees, though long gone, still linger in such images.', '2006-09-11 13:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823853, 394209, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s a heavy sky there.  The dark background makes the silhouetted tree with haloes from shaprening? stand out.  It''s an interesting effect but not one for a lasting image.</td>', 'That''s a heavy sky there.  The dark background makes the silhouetted tree with haloes from shaprening? stand out.  It''s an interesting effect but not one for a lasting image.', '2006-09-11 13:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823854, 394336, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I think the tree should have been in focus.</td>', 'Nice picture but I think the tree should have been in focus.', '2006-09-11 13:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823856, 394515, 51538, '<td valign="top">A druid?  The idea and location work well.</td>', 'A druid?  The idea and location work well.', '2006-09-11 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823857, 394376, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice fresh-air location.  Breezy too.</td>', 'That''s a nice fresh-air location.  Breezy too.', '2006-09-11 13:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823861, 393616, 51538, '<td valign="top">Did you know that "Everlasting Bamboo" is in fact a plant from the lily family - not a bamboo at all?  Now trees come in all shapes and sizes but bamboo is more of a grass-like genus, I think.</td>', 'Did you know that "Everlasting Bamboo" is in fact a plant from the lily family - not a bamboo at all?  Now trees come in all shapes and sizes but bamboo is more of a grass-like genus, I think.', '2006-09-11 13:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823864, 394275, 51538, '<td valign="top">Trees lend themselves to being photographed as silhouettes especially at sunrise and subset.  I wonder if this one would have been better photographed in early morning light?  The lens flare is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Trees lend themselves to being photographed as silhouettes especially at sunrise and subset.  I wonder if this one would have been better photographed in early morning light?  The lens flare is a bit distracting.', '2006-09-11 13:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823866, 394410, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is a grand old tree and a nice view point you have there too.</td>', 'That is a grand old tree and a nice view point you have there too.', '2006-09-11 13:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823871, 393227, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s an agressive effect but does work well.  It''s hard to say now, of course, but if that was a wheat field then the image might have been pretty nice without so much zoom.</td>', 'It''s an agressive effect but does work well.  It''s hard to say now, of course, but if that was a wheat field then the image might have been pretty nice without so much zoom.', '2006-09-11 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823872, 394316, 16488, '<td valign="top">The line of the predominant trunk leads my eye directly to....dead branches and a blown out sky. :(</td>', 'The line of the predominant trunk leads my eye directly to....dead branches and a blown out sky. :(', '2006-09-11 13:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823875, 394247, 51538, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine Peru as being a location for this photo.  But who am I to say.  The person adds a lot to the image. 9.</td>', 'I can only imagine Peru as being a location for this photo.  But who am I to say.  The person adds a lot to the image. 9.', '2006-09-11 13:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823877, 394534, 51538, '<td valign="top">Ficus by the looks of it.  37 years is indeed young.  The silhouette and colours are interesting. 7.</td>', 'Ficus by the looks of it.  37 years is indeed young.  The silhouette and colours are interesting. 7.', '2006-09-11 14:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823878, 394317, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the highlights are blown out. Focus on the postman could have been sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea but the highlights are blown out. Focus on the postman could have been sharper.', '2006-09-11 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
