(2823990, 390692, 16488, '<td valign="top">The composition is generally pleasing but the lighting is rough. With the cemetary it wouldn''t work well as a silhouette...at least much would be lost. So I think it needed to have a bit more emphasis on the subjet with a lighting to better define it. As is, it is rather flat (without depth). Postprocessing could have helped this image really stand out.</td>', 'The composition is generally pleasing but the lighting is rough. With the cemetary it wouldn''t work well as a silhouette...at least much would be lost. So I think it needed to have a bit more emphasis on the subjet with a lighting to better define it. As is, it is rather flat (without depth). Postprocessing could have helped this image really stand out.', '2006-09-11 14:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2823993, 394334, 16488, '<td valign="top">The branch to which your title points is, in my opinion, a very minor part of the image. The lighting is pleasing, the composition not quite there for me.</td>', 'The branch to which your title points is, in my opinion, a very minor part of the image. The lighting is pleasing, the composition not quite there for me.', '2006-09-11 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
