(2824013, 394457, 16488, '<td valign="top">This would be better if the tree did not merge with the foliage behind. Mid-day light contributes to the flattness of the image. Centered subjects can work, but I don''t see it working here. Different angle of view, different time of day, both could make this worthy subject much better.</td>', 'This would be better if the tree did not merge with the foliage behind. Mid-day light contributes to the flattness of the image. Centered subjects can work, but I don''t see it working here. Different angle of view, different time of day, both could make this worthy subject much better.', '2006-09-11 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824020, 394451, 16488, '<td valign="top">Clever idea but the dominance of the flare of the sun make this image more about the sun than the tree.</td>', 'Clever idea but the dominance of the flare of the sun make this image more about the sun than the tree.', '2006-09-11 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
