(2824029, 391457, 2764, '<td valign="top">Simple and very effective - I can''t tell you, though, why I like this soooo much better than all the fives I just gave to the other pics.</td>', 'Simple and very effective - I can''t tell you, though, why I like this soooo much better than all the fives I just gave to the other pics.', '2006-09-11 14:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
