(2824386, 394322, 60779, '<td valign="top">I like the pose - body and arms/hands, with the tree. The only thing I dont'' like is the background. In the upper half(especially left arm/shoulder and face/hair) of her body, which is lighter than lower half the white background isn''t pleasing to my eye. 7 - for comp/tecnique/orginality.</td>', 'I like the pose - body and arms/hands, with the tree. The only thing I dont'' like is the background. In the upper half(especially left arm/shoulder and face/hair) of her body, which is lighter than lower half the white background isn''t pleasing to my eye. 7 - for comp/tecnique/orginality.', '2006-09-11 16:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
