(2824394, 394003, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  This has potential.  I think that washed out sky may have worked better if you had gone B/W with this.  JMO of course.  ;^)</td>', 'Hmmm.  This has potential.  I think that washed out sky may have worked better if you had gone B/W with this.  JMO of course.  ;^)', '2006-09-11 16:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
