(2824397, 391222, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  That''s not a tree!  ;^)  Kinda cool looking.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge and see where this is located.  Good luck!</td>', 'Hey!  That''s not a tree!  ;^)  Kinda cool looking.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge and see where this is located.  Good luck!', '2006-09-11 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824402, 394457, 60779, '<td valign="top">For this challenge, I''m more critical that the foreground (subject) tree is ''swallowed'' by the background in the bottom 1/2 of the pic. Therefor it doesnt'' stand out. It''s actually hard to tell where the branches are and where they end. Unfortunately the scene doesn''t pick up some points here. 4</td>', 'For this challenge, I''m more critical that the foreground (subject) tree is ''swallowed'' by the background in the bottom 1/2 of the pic. Therefor it doesnt'' stand out. It''s actually hard to tell where the branches are and where they end. Unfortunately the scene doesn''t pick up some points here. 4', '2006-09-11 16:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824403, 394388, 30049, '<td valign="top">Classic! I love this.  ;^)  Break the rules I dare ya.  He-he.  It works.  The low angle, the centered composition, the unusual crop, the B/W tones.  Very nice.  Well done.</td>', 'Classic! I love this.  ;^)  Break the rules I dare ya.  He-he.  It works.  The low angle, the centered composition, the unusual crop, the B/W tones.  Very nice.  Well done.', '2006-09-11 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824409, 390692, 60779, '<td valign="top">That''s really hard lighting to shoot dark green with lots of shadows. There''s so much contrast between highlights/shadows. Your subject tree doesn''t stand out enough from the background trees. 4</td>', 'That''s really hard lighting to shoot dark green with lots of shadows. There''s so much contrast between highlights/shadows. Your subject tree doesn''t stand out enough from the background trees. 4', '2006-09-11 16:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
