(2824444, 394373, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Is there something more to the story here?  Anything being implied with the proper case Bush in your title?  Probably just a typo...  ;^)<br/> <br/>Well, it''s an interesting image for color and texture.  A bit hazy in the background (UV filter would help there maybe), unless of course the haze was left intentionally.  The long grass has a nice glow to it.  Not getting the use of a bush however.  Why?  I''m not voting on this challenge, but you''re certainly going to have the DNMC police on your tail for that!  ;^)<br/> <br/>Oh well.  Smile and keep having fun.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Is there something more to the story here?  Anything being implied with the proper case Bush in your title?  Probably just a typo...  ;^) Well, it''s an interesting image for color and texture.  A bit hazy in the background (UV filter would help there maybe), unless of course the haze was left intentionally.  The long grass has a nice glow to it.  Not getting the use of a bush however.  Why?  I''m not voting on this challenge, but you''re certainly going to have the DNMC police on your tail for that!  ;^) Oh well.  Smile and keep having fun.', '2006-09-11 16:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
