(2824448, 394104, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a very strange and unique tree.  Certainly the main subject, although the image IS quite busy and it''s hard to tell where the main tree starts and ends.  Seeing a green haze around the top and can''t tell if it''s something from post-processing or part of the tree(s)?<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a very strange and unique tree.  Certainly the main subject, although the image IS quite busy and it''s hard to tell where the main tree starts and ends.  Seeing a green haze around the top and can''t tell if it''s something from post-processing or part of the tree(s)? Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-09-11 16:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824456, 392613, 31443, '<td valign="top">Great colors, tree looks like a ballerina..</td>', 'Great colors, tree looks like a ballerina..', '2006-09-11 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824457, 394172, 60779, '<td valign="top">Good colors on the ground, and tree. Just a solid picture that fits the challenge well and is pleasing to look at. 7 - for me this about the max for this particular scene.</td>', 'Good colors on the ground, and tree. Just a solid picture that fits the challenge well and is pleasing to look at. 7 - for me this about the max for this particular scene.', '2006-09-11 16:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824460, 394379, 60779, '<td valign="top">Bonus for the title :) Nice capture of the lighted tree. Composition is lacking though. Right in middle is not very interesting. 6</td>', 'Bonus for the title :) Nice capture of the lighted tree. Composition is lacking though. Right in middle is not very interesting. 6', '2006-09-11 16:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824462, 394145, 31443, '<td valign="top">The tree is nice but you''ve made the foreground and sky equal in size, cropping off the foreground would have been much nicer..</td>', 'The tree is nice but you''ve made the foreground and sky equal in size, cropping off the foreground would have been much nicer..', '2006-09-11 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824465, 391670, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting tree and field, which you composed perfectly I must say. Overall I like the processing but would have liked a tad darker blacks and also not have those faint halos in the tree. It''s not really noticable except where it contrasts against the darker elements in the background. Maybe just clone that out. Otherwise, great image with good subtle detail throughout.</td>', 'Very interesting tree and field, which you composed perfectly I must say. Overall I like the processing but would have liked a tad darker blacks and also not have those faint halos in the tree. It''s not really noticable except where it contrasts against the darker elements in the background. Maybe just clone that out. Otherwise, great image with good subtle detail throughout.', '2006-09-11 16:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824473, 392126, 110909, '<td valign="top">I like his expression and your unique choice of placement in this picture.  Unfortunately for me it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'I like his expression and your unique choice of placement in this picture.  Unfortunately for me it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2006-09-11 16:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824481, 391472, 110909, '<td valign="top">I hate saying this but for me this just doesn''t do it.  I feel like you went half way with the PP on this one.  It''s wither too crips or not crisp enough.  I feel like you were going for a more artistic slant on this one and it just didn''t quite get there for me.</td>', 'I hate saying this but for me this just doesn''t do it.  I feel like you went half way with the PP on this one.  It''s wither too crips or not crisp enough.  I feel like you were going for a more artistic slant on this one and it just didn''t quite get there for me.', '2006-09-11 16:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824483, 394330, 41337, '<td valign="top">Strange angle but it seems to work well due to the strong lines in the image and that triangle in the lower right corner, which anchor subject perfectly. I would love to see this angle used with a tree that lean more in one direction which you could further enhance using this technique.</td>', 'Strange angle but it seems to work well due to the strong lines in the image and that triangle in the lower right corner, which anchor subject perfectly. I would love to see this angle used with a tree that lean more in one direction which you could further enhance using this technique.', '2006-09-11 16:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824486, 394215, 110909, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be enough definition between the tree and the rest of the photograph.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be enough definition between the tree and the rest of the photograph.', '2006-09-11 16:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824494, 394269, 16488, '<td valign="top">The subject is a lovely find. I''d like to see as much detail in the tree''s leaves as in the grain in the lower portion of the image. The most distracting element for me, however, is where the horizon line intersects the tree. It would feel less intrusive if it cut through the trunk rather than the branches.</td>', 'The subject is a lovely find. I''d like to see as much detail in the tree''s leaves as in the grain in the lower portion of the image. The most distracting element for me, however, is where the horizon line intersects the tree. It would feel less intrusive if it cut through the trunk rather than the branches.', '2006-09-11 16:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824499, 393508, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great sky. I also like that silhouette although I could do without the person in the shot.</td>', 'Great sky. I also like that silhouette although I could do without the person in the shot.', '2006-09-11 16:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824504, 391457, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely old tree with an appealing shape. The lighting is flat, however...it really needs to stand out from the background. A combination of selective focus and difference in lighting could help achieve separation from the busy background elements.</td>', 'This is a lovely old tree with an appealing shape. The lighting is flat, however...it really needs to stand out from the background. A combination of selective focus and difference in lighting could help achieve separation from the busy background elements.', '2006-09-11 16:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824507, 394510, 110909, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of borders but in this case, it works.  What doesn''t is that the tree is lost in the photo.  Maybe I''d like it more in color.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of borders but in this case, it works.  What doesn''t is that the tree is lost in the photo.  Maybe I''d like it more in color.', '2006-09-11 16:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824512, 392042, 16488, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be on the near middle foreground ripples of water rather than the tree....whatever is in focus will demand to be the "subject" of an image. A little cropping from the right to rid the image of that intrusive second tree would help as well.</td>', 'The focus seems to be on the near middle foreground ripples of water rather than the tree....whatever is in focus will demand to be the "subject" of an image. A little cropping from the right to rid the image of that intrusive second tree would help as well.', '2006-09-11 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824532, 394399, 110909, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the crop on this one.  Seeing the edge of the tree and the edge of the barn in back seem important to me.  I bet it''s great in color, as well.</td>', 'I don''t really like the crop on this one.  Seeing the edge of the tree and the edge of the barn in back seem important to me.  I bet it''s great in color, as well.', '2006-09-11 16:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824536, 393952, 110909, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the choice of color here but it was a good attempt at making the tree in the foreground stand out against the rest of the green.</td>', 'I don''t like the choice of color here but it was a good attempt at making the tree in the foreground stand out against the rest of the green.', '2006-09-11 16:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
