(2824568, 394225, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve filled 2/3 of the frame with texture and 1/3 is smooth...it gives it a nice balance. I think this would be more impressive as "wicked" if the point of view made the tree more imposing...it''s hard to feel threated looking down on something.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve filled 2/3 of the frame with texture and 1/3 is smooth...it gives it a nice balance. I think this would be more impressive as "wicked" if the point of view made the tree more imposing...it''s hard to feel threated looking down on something.', '2006-09-11 16:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824576, 394209, 16488, '<td valign="top">I think the idea of creating a silhouette against the drama of the sky is a good one. The leaves of the trees and the horizon line, however, have some white outlining....I think that makes it feel like a cut-out and not a seemless image.</td>', 'I think the idea of creating a silhouette against the drama of the sky is a good one. The leaves of the trees and the horizon line, however, have some white outlining....I think that makes it feel like a cut-out and not a seemless image.', '2006-09-11 16:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824588, 394225, 60224, '<td valign="top">Cool tree. Would''ve liked to see more of it...and maybe converted to BW since the branches look kinda greyscale already?</td>', 'Cool tree. Would''ve liked to see more of it...and maybe converted to BW since the branches look kinda greyscale already?', '2006-09-11 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824589, 393599, 16488, '<td valign="top">When I look at this my mind says, that''s an image of an interesting old boat. The tree is a very unimportant part of this image to me. On a technical note, you''ve lost your range of contrast....no true blacks in this image and nothing really white....detail like this wants to stand out (yes, even in a sepia-toned image).</td>', 'When I look at this my mind says, that''s an image of an interesting old boat. The tree is a very unimportant part of this image to me. On a technical note, you''ve lost your range of contrast....no true blacks in this image and nothing really white....detail like this wants to stand out (yes, even in a sepia-toned image).', '2006-09-11 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824591, 394330, 44579, '<td valign="top">Oh, beautiful shot. I love this, but this is going to get HAMMERED for being so tilted. Would have done better points wise if the horizon was flat, but, I love this photo.</td>', 'Oh, beautiful shot. I love this, but this is going to get HAMMERED for being so tilted. Would have done better points wise if the horizon was flat, but, I love this photo.', '2006-09-11 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824596, 392899, 60224, '<td valign="top">The whiteish aura around the tree is funky to me. Cool perspective though.</td>', 'The whiteish aura around the tree is funky to me. Cool perspective though.', '2006-09-11 16:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824597, 394129, 60224, '<td valign="top">Wow...great colors.</td>', 'Wow...great colors.', '2006-09-11 16:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824599, 393233, 44579, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the IR! Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Gotta love the IR! Beautiful shot.', '2006-09-11 16:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824602, 393019, 44579, '<td valign="top">Love the wide angle.</td>', 'Love the wide angle.', '2006-09-11 16:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824606, 394253, 60779, '<td valign="top">For this challenge, the pic is hurt because the mass of branches at the bottom center. I can''t tell if it''s the same tree or another. Having said that the colors are great. Nice capture of the moon''s light. 5</td>', 'For this challenge, the pic is hurt because the mass of branches at the bottom center. I can''t tell if it''s the same tree or another. Having said that the colors are great. Nice capture of the moon''s light. 5', '2006-09-11 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824613, 394515, 60779, '<td valign="top">Interesting. makes me think. It''s not my style, but...the center crop seems to work. I don''t like the tree on the pic''s left. Don''t mind the right, though. Overall -6</td>', 'Interesting. makes me think. It''s not my style, but...the center crop seems to work. I don''t like the tree on the pic''s left. Don''t mind the right, though. Overall -6', '2006-09-11 17:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824624, 394489, 60224, '<td valign="top">Very cool....great colors. This one is one of those that''d probably look great in BW or color?</td>', 'Very cool....great colors. This one is one of those that''d probably look great in BW or color?', '2006-09-11 17:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824627, 393641, 60779, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, and you''ve got a few interesting lines - the path and hills. Otherwise, it doesn''t really effect me. 6</td>', 'Fits the challenge, and you''ve got a few interesting lines - the path and hills. Otherwise, it doesn''t really effect me. 6', '2006-09-11 17:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824634, 392651, 60779, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast. Good composition (hey, the rule of thirds!) 7</td>', 'I like the high contrast. Good composition (hey, the rule of thirds!) 7', '2006-09-11 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824636, 393487, 64489, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal.  Love the color, the depth, the texture.  My only wish was that it was night outside - I think that would''ve added a little more to the fantasy element of this photograph and also helped to secure the viewer''s focus completely on the tree.  I don''t like seeing some of the distracting elements outside of the window.  That being said, good use of dodging and burning - that definitely seems to be the style of choice these days (though I like it).  As it stands, this is my favorite entry in the competition.</td>', 'Phenomenal.  Love the color, the depth, the texture.  My only wish was that it was night outside - I think that would''ve added a little more to the fantasy element of this photograph and also helped to secure the viewer''s focus completely on the tree.  I don''t like seeing some of the distracting elements outside of the window.  That being said, good use of dodging and burning - that definitely seems to be the style of choice these days (though I like it).  As it stands, this is my favorite entry in the competition.', '2006-09-11 17:05:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2824642, 391320, 60224, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2006-09-11 17:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824643, 394135, 16488, '<td valign="top">The placement of the horizon is, to me, the first awkward thing about this image. The blah sky, flat lighting and the pixelation of the leaves make me think this could have been taken at a better time of day and/or in different weather. It just doesn''t "say" much.</td>', 'The placement of the horizon is, to me, the first awkward thing about this image. The blah sky, flat lighting and the pixelation of the leaves make me think this could have been taken at a better time of day and/or in different weather. It just doesn''t "say" much.', '2006-09-11 17:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824646, 392125, 60779, '<td valign="top">Wow! Neat capture. the use of b&amp;w doesn''t capture my attention though. 6</td>', 'Wow! Neat capture. the use of b&w doesn''t capture my attention though. 6', '2006-09-11 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824656, 391770, 64489, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot - the composition, color, and sharpness are all spot on, and I like the simplicity of the subject.  I see too many photographs try to cram too much into the frame, and although this is clearly shot in a controlled environment, the elements used are completely appropriate.  The mist adds a great layer to the picture that really makes it so powerful - without it, it would just be a picture of a well lit tree (and there certainly are plenty of those).  There is something about studio shots (call them contrived, perhaps) that makes me feel a little bit removed from the subject - there''s just something about a candid, natural photo that lends itself to greatness - but I have no doubts you will do spectacularly in this competition.  All of the pieces are in the right place, and I really can''t find much to criticize.</td>', 'Really nice shot - the composition, color, and sharpness are all spot on, and I like the simplicity of the subject.  I see too many photographs try to cram too much into the frame, and although this is clearly shot in a controlled environment, the elements used are completely appropriate.  The mist adds a great layer to the picture that really makes it so powerful - without it, it would just be a picture of a well lit tree (and there certainly are plenty of those).  There is something about studio shots (call them contrived, perhaps) that makes me feel a little bit removed from the subject - there''s just something about a candid, natural photo that lends itself to greatness - but I have no doubts you will do spectacularly in this competition.  All of the pieces are in the right place, and I really can''t find much to criticize.', '2006-09-11 17:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824664, 394181, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the low angle of view! Wish the tree were a bit to the left and the background slightly blurred to get greater depth.</td>', 'I like the low angle of view! Wish the tree were a bit to the left and the background slightly blurred to get greater depth.', '2006-09-11 17:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824675, 394088, 60779, '<td valign="top">Initially I really don''t like it, but it''s very interesting and captivating the more you look at it. I like the bark, especially the whites. The main that''s confusing to my eye is the composition. It''s definetly abstract, but for me it''s not pleasing. For me there''s a balance between pros/cons,so a 5.</td>', 'Initially I really don''t like it, but it''s very interesting and captivating the more you look at it. I like the bark, especially the whites. The main that''s confusing to my eye is the composition. It''s definetly abstract, but for me it''s not pleasing. For me there''s a balance between pros/cons,so a 5.', '2006-09-11 17:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824692, 391059, 60779, '<td valign="top">the reason I feel you''re not meeting the challenge here is because there''s a great amount of attention to the ground, yes as well as the tree trunk. you have achieved your aim, though by the illumination. 4</td>', 'the reason I feel you''re not meeting the challenge here is because there''s a great amount of attention to the ground, yes as well as the tree trunk. you have achieved your aim, though by the illumination. 4', '2006-09-11 17:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824697, 393302, 64489, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot, and one of the few pictures of "a simple tree out in nature" that I do enjoy.  Of course, this challenge is flooded with them, so that makes it all the more difficult for photos like this to stand out.  That being said, your composition, awareness of color, and only very subtle apparent post modification help it to remain loking pure and striking.  The sky is great as well - you definitely picked the right time to snap the shutter.  My only real critique would be to try to up the creativity level for next time - it''s obvious you have an eye for a shot, so stretch yourself a little for future challenges.  I do think there''s a fine line between setting up a photo that spells out the challenge theme creatively and just being downright goofy, but as long as you approach it with care you''ll be fine.  This is one of my favorites in the competition.</td>', 'This is a really great shot, and one of the few pictures of "a simple tree out in nature" that I do enjoy.  Of course, this challenge is flooded with them, so that makes it all the more difficult for photos like this to stand out.  That being said, your composition, awareness of color, and only very subtle apparent post modification help it to remain loking pure and striking.  The sky is great as well - you definitely picked the right time to snap the shutter.  My only real critique would be to try to up the creativity level for next time - it''s obvious you have an eye for a shot, so stretch yourself a little for future challenges.  I do think there''s a fine line between setting up a photo that spells out the challenge theme creatively and just being downright goofy, but as long as you approach it with care you''ll be fine.  This is one of my favorites in the competition.', '2006-09-11 17:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824699, 394213, 60779, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity with only 3 elements. Great sky. 8</td>', 'I like the simplicity with only 3 elements. Great sky. 8', '2006-09-11 17:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824709, 393907, 60779, '<td valign="top">My first reaction is to the title. yes alone, but not forgotten because it has a spotlight on it. Anyway, nice picture. Interesting to look at. Nice clean composition. 6</td>', 'My first reaction is to the title. yes alone, but not forgotten because it has a spotlight on it. Anyway, nice picture. Interesting to look at. Nice clean composition. 6', '2006-09-11 17:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824730, 394530, 60779, '<td valign="top">Looks like a really tough angle and time of day to create a great picture. For me the cons outweigh the pros. Like: scene, water, sky. Don''t like: crop of tree, overall lighting, underexposure. For me palms work only in front lit or silhouette against a more sunety sky. 4</td>', 'Looks like a really tough angle and time of day to create a great picture. For me the cons outweigh the pros. Like: scene, water, sky. Don''t like: crop of tree, overall lighting, underexposure. For me palms work only in front lit or silhouette against a more sunety sky. 4', '2006-09-11 17:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824737, 394155, 60779, '<td valign="top">Cool. Great angle. Processing creates the mood but is a little over done for my high score taste. 7</td>', 'Cool. Great angle. Processing creates the mood but is a little over done for my high score taste. 7', '2006-09-11 17:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824739, 394256, 25742, '<td valign="top">beautiful textures. fitting title. good luck</td>', 'beautiful textures. fitting title. good luck', '2006-09-11 17:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824744, 393597, 60779, '<td valign="top">Like: colors on the subject tree against the grass. It does stand out.<br/>Don''t like: branches above left and right and big part of tree on the right side. It''s not in sharp focus and for this scene to work of this tree, it has to be sharper. 4</td>', 'Like: colors on the subject tree against the grass. It does stand out.Don''t like: branches above left and right and big part of tree on the right side. It''s not in sharp focus and for this scene to work of this tree, it has to be sharper. 4', '2006-09-11 17:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824748, 392964, 25742, '<td valign="top">gorgeous backdrop. the couple are hardly visible, so the casual observer misses the point, you probably get punished in voting for that. the tree itself is not terribly interesting, but the photo as a whole has a lot of charm to it, if given more than a cursory glance.</td>', 'gorgeous backdrop. the couple are hardly visible, so the casual observer misses the point, you probably get punished in voting for that. the tree itself is not terribly interesting, but the photo as a whole has a lot of charm to it, if given more than a cursory glance.', '2006-09-11 17:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824750, 394330, 25742, '<td valign="top">a little bit of tilt is annoying, but a real tilt is cool. best of luck with this off-beat image.</td>', 'a little bit of tilt is annoying, but a real tilt is cool. best of luck with this off-beat image.', '2006-09-11 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824753, 393737, 25742, '<td valign="top">a bit more context would give this more meaning.</td>', 'a bit more context would give this more meaning.', '2006-09-11 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824757, 393240, 60779, '<td valign="top">Like: the blue sky and the highlight of the fig tree. <br/>Dont'' like: some sloppy PP work - looks like you brightened the sky next to the branch, near the left center of pic. <br/>5</td>', 'Like: the blue sky and the highlight of the fig tree. Dont'' like: some sloppy PP work - looks like you brightened the sky next to the branch, near the left center of pic. 5', '2006-09-11 17:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824759, 393064, 25742, '<td valign="top">OMG, more than one tree in the photo. you must be MAD! :)<br/>nice fog and atmosphere, but you probably get a lot of complaints about the multitudes of trees from the anal-retentive types.</td>', 'OMG, more than one tree in the photo. you must be MAD! :)nice fog and atmosphere, but you probably get a lot of complaints about the multitudes of trees from the anal-retentive types.', '2006-09-11 17:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824760, 394456, 25742, '<td valign="top">why not do the zoom-trick centered on the tree?</td>', 'why not do the zoom-trick centered on the tree?', '2006-09-11 17:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824764, 394256, 60779, '<td valign="top">the colors give it the feel I think you are looking for. that works. so do the lines of the roots. it''s stretching the challenge a little for me, but the balance of cool artistic photo deserves: 6</td>', 'the colors give it the feel I think you are looking for. that works. so do the lines of the roots. it''s stretching the challenge a little for me, but the balance of cool artistic photo deserves: 6', '2006-09-11 17:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824769, 394338, 25742, '<td valign="top">the buildings in the BG seem to be falling over, and draw all the attention away from that poor tree</td>', 'the buildings in the BG seem to be falling over, and draw all the attention away from that poor tree', '2006-09-11 17:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824772, 392126, 25742, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is all about, but it seems you had a good time doing this. best of luck</td>', 'I have no idea what this is all about, but it seems you had a good time doing this. best of luck', '2006-09-11 17:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824776, 394025, 36619, '<td valign="top">love the dramatic sky and how the tree seems to be it''s audience. 10</td>', 'love the dramatic sky and how the tree seems to be it''s audience. 10', '2006-09-11 17:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824778, 394398, 25742, '<td valign="top">a little bit too green for my tastes, lovely atmosphere though.</td>', 'a little bit too green for my tastes, lovely atmosphere though.', '2006-09-11 17:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824785, 394222, 60779, '<td valign="top">in all honesty, I don''t care about the tree when the background is that interesting to look at. It appears that you are taking your viewer past the tree, which just happens to be in the picture. good colors throughout. the rocks don''t look perfectly processed. 5</td>', 'in all honesty, I don''t care about the tree when the background is that interesting to look at. It appears that you are taking your viewer past the tree, which just happens to be in the picture. good colors throughout. the rocks don''t look perfectly processed. 5', '2006-09-11 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824786, 394322, 25742, '<td valign="top">some strange symbolism there. but I always appreciate a naked beautiful girl, so don''t let me stop you.</td>', 'some strange symbolism there. but I always appreciate a naked beautiful girl, so don''t let me stop you.', '2006-09-11 17:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824787, 391918, 60779, '<td valign="top">good definition and use of b&amp;w. nice find with the interesting features of the tree. 7</td>', 'good definition and use of b&w. nice find with the interesting features of the tree. 7', '2006-09-11 17:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824788, 393905, 36619, '<td valign="top">great eye!!! fantastic shot!</td>', 'great eye!!! fantastic shot!', '2006-09-11 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824793, 394144, 25742, '<td valign="top">not very appealing editing, oversharpened and strange colours. if this is straight from camera, check your settings.</td>', 'not very appealing editing, oversharpened and strange colours. if this is straight from camera, check your settings.', '2006-09-11 17:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824796, 394193, 25742, '<td valign="top">I like those hills</td>', 'I like those hills', '2006-09-11 17:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824797, 394232, 36619, '<td valign="top">beautiful idea.</td>', 'beautiful idea.', '2006-09-11 17:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824801, 394412, 25742, '<td valign="top">cool. this should be in top10</td>', 'cool. this should be in top10', '2006-09-11 17:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824802, 394536, 60779, '<td valign="top">this is too over processed for my taste and still the subject tree is not isolated from the others. there are many dark blothces in the sky. 4</td>', 'this is too over processed for my taste and still the subject tree is not isolated from the others. there are many dark blothces in the sky. 4', '2006-09-11 17:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824804, 394508, 25742, '<td valign="top">irony?</td>', 'irony?', '2006-09-11 17:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824806, 394025, 49930, '<td valign="top">Love your cloud cover here. Very dramatic and creates great drama and mence for the tree. Fantastic composition and exposure.</td>', 'Love your cloud cover here. Very dramatic and creates great drama and mence for the tree. Fantastic composition and exposure.', '2006-09-11 17:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824807, 393696, 60779, '<td valign="top">2 pluses. the challenge and the gree on the leaves. But, the composition, angle and crop weaken the image. 4</td>', '2 pluses. the challenge and the gree on the leaves. But, the composition, angle and crop weaken the image. 4', '2006-09-11 17:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824811, 393656, 25742, '<td valign="top">when Schopenhauer saw a man who had hung himself in a tree, he said: "If every tree bore such a fruit"<br/>just popped into my mind when I was this photo.</td>', 'when Schopenhauer saw a man who had hung himself in a tree, he said: "If every tree bore such a fruit"just popped into my mind when I was this photo.', '2006-09-11 17:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824814, 394411, 25742, '<td valign="top">good comp, except from small flare left of tree. cool silhouette</td>', 'good comp, except from small flare left of tree. cool silhouette', '2006-09-11 17:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824817, 394522, 25742, '<td valign="top">cool reflections<br/>I love this deep shade of blue</td>', 'cool reflectionsI love this deep shade of blue', '2006-09-11 17:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824823, 393973, 60779, '<td valign="top">It''s intersting but busy. I don''t like the DOF. Actually I really can''t tell where your sharpest point is. The texture of the bark adds. 6</td>', 'It''s intersting but busy. I don''t like the DOF. Actually I really can''t tell where your sharpest point is. The texture of the bark adds. 6', '2006-09-11 17:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824824, 394384, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition of triangular form in this image. But, unfortunately, the dominant branch sends my eye flying out of the picture to the left. The color and exposure seem alright...there is, though, some pixelation along the edges of the branch where it meets the sky....just a few things to think about for your next entry.</td>', 'I like the repetition of triangular form in this image. But, unfortunately, the dominant branch sends my eye flying out of the picture to the left. The color and exposure seem alright...there is, though, some pixelation along the edges of the branch where it meets the sky....just a few things to think about for your next entry.', '2006-09-11 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824826, 394492, 60779, '<td valign="top">Good but not great. Hope i''m not being cynical but it seems you might have used b&amp;w because the color version was flat. Nice composition. No way is it a 5, nor is a 7 for me, so: 6</td>', 'Good but not great. Hope i''m not being cynical but it seems you might have used b&w because the color version was flat. Nice composition. No way is it a 5, nor is a 7 for me, so: 6', '2006-09-11 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824836, 394510, 60779, '<td valign="top">For me, the highlights are too ''high''. Interesting composition and choice of subject. Overall it''s a 5 because of two major distracting elements: the twigs going everywhere and the highlights.</td>', 'For me, the highlights are too ''high''. Interesting composition and choice of subject. Overall it''s a 5 because of two major distracting elements: the twigs going everywhere and the highlights.', '2006-09-11 17:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824839, 394168, 61971, '<td valign="top">I have to tell you that this is the most creative shot in the group. And a great photograph to boot. Great detail and color. 10!</td>', 'I have to tell you that this is the most creative shot in the group. And a great photograph to boot. Great detail and color. 10!', '2006-09-11 17:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824842, 393783, 60779, '<td valign="top">Interesting and original for the challenge. I''m not a fan of the sky, but I really like the tree, especially the limbs/bark/trunk. On balance a 6 for me.</td>', 'Interesting and original for the challenge. I''m not a fan of the sky, but I really like the tree, especially the limbs/bark/trunk. On balance a 6 for me.', '2006-09-11 17:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824843, 393018, 61971, '<td valign="top">I really love the highlights on the tree. Good choice for black and white. 10!</td>', 'I really love the highlights on the tree. Good choice for black and white. 10!', '2006-09-11 17:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824845, 394412, 61971, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome picture. I love the stars and the color. 10</td>', 'This is an awesome picture. I love the stars and the color. 10', '2006-09-11 17:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824846, 394458, 60779, '<td valign="top">the darkness on the top left throws the balance of the sky off. for me that''s the only detracting thing. nice comp, use of b&amp;w. 6</td>', 'the darkness on the top left throws the balance of the sky off. for me that''s the only detracting thing. nice comp, use of b&w. 6', '2006-09-11 17:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824850, 392897, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great picture. The fields below are what make it for me. 10</td>', 'Great picture. The fields below are what make it for me. 10', '2006-09-11 17:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824853, 394275, 60779, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the first thing I see is the flare in the tree. The sun is overpowering to make a pleasing image. Yes the challenge is met but two big detracting things. 4.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the first thing I see is the flare in the tree. The sun is overpowering to make a pleasing image. Yes the challenge is met but two big detracting things. 4.', '2006-09-11 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824857, 391320, 61971, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. The color is perfect. Personally I wish the fence were not there. 9</td>', 'Beautiful picture. The color is perfect. Personally I wish the fence were not there. 9', '2006-09-11 17:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2824859, 394062, 60779, '<td valign="top">this is too much of stretch of the challenge. interesting composition and good exposure. 4</td>', 'this is too much of stretch of the challenge. interesting composition and good exposure. 4', '2006-09-11 17:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
