(2825152, 394014, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. Great composition. My only complaint would be there seems to be more than a "single" tree as the focus point.</td>', 'I really like this picture. Great composition. My only complaint would be there seems to be more than a "single" tree as the focus point.', '2006-09-11 19:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825156, 394215, 62318, '<td valign="top">I love the monochromatic color, though maybe a bit more contrast?</td>', 'I love the monochromatic color, though maybe a bit more contrast?', '2006-09-11 19:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825157, 392759, 45360, '<td valign="top">The tree seems a bit lost in this image and I find my eye drawn to the rocks...</td>', 'The tree seems a bit lost in this image and I find my eye drawn to the rocks...', '2006-09-11 19:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825162, 393905, 62318, '<td valign="top">Great out of the box shot.</td>', 'Great out of the box shot.', '2006-09-11 19:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825165, 394456, 60698, '<td valign="top">Might have been better without the burst effect.</td>', 'Might have been better without the burst effect.', '2006-09-11 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825169, 393599, 60698, '<td valign="top">My eye goes to the ship first, then the tree. Nice photo...of a ship! :)</td>', 'My eye goes to the ship first, then the tree. Nice photo...of a ship! :)', '2006-09-11 19:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825172, 393227, 60698, '<td valign="top">Would like to see this without the "Zoom Zoom"</td>', 'Would like to see this without the "Zoom Zoom"', '2006-09-11 19:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825174, 394372, 60698, '<td valign="top">Serene. Nicely done!</td>', 'Serene. Nicely done!', '2006-09-11 19:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825186, 392964, 45360, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this the same tree as in ''Tenacity'' in this challenge?  This has better comosition though I feel.</td>', 'Isn''t this the same tree as in ''Tenacity'' in this challenge?  This has better comosition though I feel.', '2006-09-11 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825189, 394476, 45360, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this the same tree as in ''The Wedding Tree'' in this challenge?</td>', 'Isn''t this the same tree as in ''The Wedding Tree'' in this challenge?', '2006-09-11 19:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825193, 392125, 45360, '<td valign="top">What a great tree   :o)</td>', 'What a great tree   :o)', '2006-09-11 19:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825225, 394043, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice lush bit of nature.  The dead old tree makes it appear even lusher.  Each element in this picture supports the others.</td>', 'That''s a nice lush bit of nature.  The dead old tree makes it appear even lusher.  Each element in this picture supports the others.', '2006-09-11 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825228, 392197, 51538, '<td valign="top">Natural stasis versus manic machinery ;-)  It''s a lively rendition.  I wonder how it might be improved a little?  The idea seems to be worth developing.</td>', 'Natural stasis versus manic machinery ;-)  It''s a lively rendition.  I wonder how it might be improved a little?  The idea seems to be worth developing.', '2006-09-11 20:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825232, 394014, 34595, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful picture. It almost looks like an oil painting on a canvas. I love it!</td>', 'This is a really beautiful picture. It almost looks like an oil painting on a canvas. I love it!', '2006-09-11 20:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825238, 394537, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice if somewhat despondent view.  The grassy, sandy location makes the tree unusual.  Perhaps clone out the tree? peeking into the left side.</td>', 'Nice if somewhat despondent view.  The grassy, sandy location makes the tree unusual.  Perhaps clone out the tree? peeking into the left side.', '2006-09-11 20:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825242, 394358, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s a fine view and must be an interesting location to explore.  I wonder if there is a way to isolate the tree more on the right hand side?</td>', 'It''s a fine view and must be an interesting location to explore.  I wonder if there is a way to isolate the tree more on the right hand side?', '2006-09-11 20:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825244, 394318, 51538, '<td valign="top">Upstanding among its own kind.  The sunset is a little on the bright side to me.  But the location looks interesting.</td>', 'Upstanding among its own kind.  The sunset is a little on the bright side to me.  But the location looks interesting.', '2006-09-11 20:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825246, 394256, 51538, '<td valign="top">Your photo makes me tilt my head to find out more.  I think it is of roots?  I like the general colouring - like a patina.</td>', 'Your photo makes me tilt my head to find out more.  I think it is of roots?  I like the general colouring - like a patina.', '2006-09-11 20:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825247, 393147, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice location.  It looks like the haze was not cooperating with your timing.  I wonder if there might be a way to either boost the colour or reduce it to a sepia tone?</td>', 'Nice location.  It looks like the haze was not cooperating with your timing.  I wonder if there might be a way to either boost the colour or reduce it to a sepia tone?', '2006-09-11 20:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825249, 394364, 61705, '<td valign="top">The composition is solid, but the red vignette isn''t working for me. Too in-your-face. I think decreasing the opacity would have made it more subtle, thereby shifting attention back to the tree.</td>', 'The composition is solid, but the red vignette isn''t working for me. Too in-your-face. I think decreasing the opacity would have made it more subtle, thereby shifting attention back to the tree.', '2006-09-11 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825250, 393641, 51538, '<td valign="top">The pathway inviting the viewer to wander into the picture to the tree is pleasant.  I think that with a little overt processing, some of the colouring could be boosted and a more dramatic effect achieved.</td>', 'The pathway inviting the viewer to wander into the picture to the tree is pleasant.  I think that with a little overt processing, some of the colouring could be boosted and a more dramatic effect achieved.', '2006-09-11 20:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825253, 392421, 45360, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this image, good contrast  7</td>', 'I like the mood of this image, good contrast  7', '2006-09-11 20:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825254, 394317, 51538, '<td valign="top">Looks like a peaceful night too.  The postman always knocks that late? ;-)</td>', 'Looks like a peaceful night too.  The postman always knocks that late? ;-)', '2006-09-11 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825256, 392930, 51538, '<td valign="top">I see what you mean - I think.  A thistle to an ant is in fact as a giant redwood is to a human.  As you say, a matter of who is viewing the image.  How about a little noise reduction?</td>', 'I see what you mean - I think.  A thistle to an ant is in fact as a giant redwood is to a human.  As you say, a matter of who is viewing the image.  How about a little noise reduction?', '2006-09-11 20:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825261, 391320, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. ?kite in the tree? I do wish the crop wasn''t so tight on the right side. Over all good entry.</td>', 'I like this shot. ?kite in the tree? I do wish the crop wasn''t so tight on the right side. Over all good entry.', '2006-09-11 20:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825262, 394506, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a unique find. Good entry!</td>', 'Really a unique find. Good entry!', '2006-09-11 20:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825263, 394213, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely reminds me of California. The grass color. Nice.</td>', 'Lovely reminds me of California. The grass color. Nice.', '2006-09-11 20:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825264, 394262, 51538, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the trees nearest water change colour first.  Yours is an elegant scene.  Now if the sky had been a little richer in hue, life would have been that much better ;-)</td>', 'Sometimes the trees nearest water change colour first.  Yours is an elegant scene.  Now if the sky had been a little richer in hue, life would have been that much better ;-)', '2006-09-11 20:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825265, 394458, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done..good tones.</td>', 'Well done..good tones.', '2006-09-11 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825266, 394233, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  Is it in blossom or is this an infrared rendition?</td>', 'Pretty scene.  Is it in blossom or is this an infrared rendition?', '2006-09-11 20:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825268, 394146, 327, '<td valign="top">Strange and unusual bark. Thanks for this entry, never saw this tree before.</td>', 'Strange and unusual bark. Thanks for this entry, never saw this tree before.', '2006-09-11 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825269, 394458, 51538, '<td valign="top">The fence really boosts this image and the tree hanging silently in the background has a strong presence.  Nice work. 8.</td>', 'The fence really boosts this image and the tree hanging silently in the background has a strong presence.  Nice work. 8.', '2006-09-11 20:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825270, 394388, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice crop or framing or whatever.  It works well for the image.</td>', 'Nice crop or framing or whatever.  It works well for the image.', '2006-09-11 20:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825272, 393508, 45360, '<td valign="top">Great sky, love the colours but would have worked better for me without the person in the image</td>', 'Great sky, love the colours but would have worked better for me without the person in the image', '2006-09-11 20:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825275, 393905, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is a great play on visual words.  Love the b/w rendition too and the tree (date palm?) has a decent amount of character. 8.</td>', 'That is a great play on visual words.  Love the b/w rendition too and the tree (date palm?) has a decent amount of character. 8.', '2006-09-11 20:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825279, 394505, 51538, '<td valign="top">That shaggy tree certainly does make its presence felt.  I bet it''s nice and shady in the daytime.</td>', 'That shaggy tree certainly does make its presence felt.  I bet it''s nice and shady in the daytime.', '2006-09-11 20:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825280, 392451, 45360, '<td valign="top">Love the bold blue against the white trunk</td>', 'Love the bold blue against the white trunk', '2006-09-11 20:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825283, 393656, 14211, '<td valign="top">Perfect in every way...the sky,the way Cassie is standing,the movement of the dress..a definite 10.</td>', 'Perfect in every way...the sky,the way Cassie is standing,the movement of the dress..a definite 10.', '2006-09-11 20:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825289, 393905, 45360, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the road sign</td>', 'Nice use of the road sign', '2006-09-11 20:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825299, 393880, 51538, '<td valign="top">The nearer silhouette, being that much deeper in hue, distracts somewhat.  Overall, though, I like the image.</td>', 'The nearer silhouette, being that much deeper in hue, distracts somewhat.  Overall, though, I like the image.', '2006-09-11 20:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825301, 393508, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely titled and the image really does suggest that time of year.  I like the colours a lot - but the higher sky is a bit odd to me.</td>', 'Nicely titled and the image really does suggest that time of year.  I like the colours a lot - but the higher sky is a bit odd to me.', '2006-09-11 20:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825302, 394179, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures of nature in your photo.  That is a really tree-shaped tree - not that there is such a thing in real life.</td>', 'Lovely textures of nature in your photo.  That is a really tree-shaped tree - not that there is such a thing in real life.', '2006-09-11 20:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825305, 393635, 51538, '<td valign="top">Dendritic or forked is the term, I think.  And, as you say, it does emulate lightening as the branches bifurcate away from the trunk.</td>', 'Dendritic or forked is the term, I think.  And, as you say, it does emulate lightening as the branches bifurcate away from the trunk.', '2006-09-11 20:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825306, 393686, 51538, '<td valign="top">The trunk lacks a little in texture - but the nice green leaves make up for that lack, in part.</td>', 'The trunk lacks a little in texture - but the nice green leaves make up for that lack, in part.', '2006-09-11 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825313, 393656, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely rendered in black and white.  Your choice of depth of field is reveals the intricacies of nature especially in the reaped field.  The white gown is so pure against the rustic setting.  I also like the pose - but the girl''s head is, to me, slightly in an odd position overlapping the tree.  But overall, very nice. 8.</td>', 'Nicely rendered in black and white.  Your choice of depth of field is reveals the intricacies of nature especially in the reaped field.  The white gown is so pure against the rustic setting.  I also like the pose - but the girl''s head is, to me, slightly in an odd position overlapping the tree.  But overall, very nice. 8.', '2006-09-11 20:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825316, 394228, 51538, '<td valign="top">Roots grow in symbiosis with bacteria and fungus.  That''s why they take such a long time to develop and why trees often succumb to root shock when transplanted.  Yours is an interesting botanical photo.</td>', 'Roots grow in symbiosis with bacteria and fungus.  That''s why they take such a long time to develop and why trees often succumb to root shock when transplanted.  Yours is an interesting botanical photo.', '2006-09-11 20:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825318, 393718, 51538, '<td valign="top">Your tree has a lot of suggestive forms in it.  Meet that one on a partially lit, atmospheric night and one might just run... ;-)</td>', 'Your tree has a lot of suggestive forms in it.  Meet that one on a partially lit, atmospheric night and one might just run... ;-)', '2006-09-11 20:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825319, 394514, 51538, '<td valign="top">The life above.  Surreal.</td>', 'The life above.  Surreal.', '2006-09-11 20:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825324, 394304, 36619, '<td valign="top">this is a great composition. i found it humorous too with big clump of dirt&amp; the tiny little tree. 9</td>', 'this is a great composition. i found it humorous too with big clump of dirt& the tiny little tree. 9', '2006-09-11 20:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825325, 394392, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very lovely photo and choice of tones.  The whole composition is great.  I only wish it was a little bit on the brighter side.  I''m viewing this with a superbright laptop monitor and I know that it is way brighter than it should be - yet your photo still comes over as being a little darker than it need be.  8.</td>', 'Very lovely photo and choice of tones.  The whole composition is great.  I only wish it was a little bit on the brighter side.  I''m viewing this with a superbright laptop monitor and I know that it is way brighter than it should be - yet your photo still comes over as being a little darker than it need be.  8.', '2006-09-11 20:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825326, 394247, 36619, '<td valign="top">this is really nice, the whole scene reflects on the title. 9</td>', 'this is really nice, the whole scene reflects on the title. 9', '2006-09-11 20:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825327, 394384, 51538, '<td valign="top">Fallen trees are as dramatic as their standing brothers and sisters.</td>', 'Fallen trees are as dramatic as their standing brothers and sisters.', '2006-09-11 20:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825329, 394515, 36619, '<td valign="top">um kinda scary there. the centering of subject works well in this scene. good job! 9</td>', 'um kinda scary there. the centering of subject works well in this scene. good job! 9', '2006-09-11 20:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825330, 392899, 36619, '<td valign="top">i love this!</td>', 'i love this!', '2006-09-11 20:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825331, 394172, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice to see the farmer has not cut it down - as so many have done to hedgerows and trees.  Farmers are a necessary evil - but they damage the countryside to a degree which is untenable at times. 7.</td>', 'Nice to see the farmer has not cut it down - as so many have done to hedgerows and trees.  Farmers are a necessary evil - but they damage the countryside to a degree which is untenable at times. 7.', '2006-09-11 20:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825332, 391026, 36619, '<td valign="top">very surreal quality about it. it''s a great subject and i think you did it justice here.</td>', 'very surreal quality about it. it''s a great subject and i think you did it justice here.', '2006-09-11 20:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825333, 394387, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is a grand old tree.  The number of times that each branch has divided on its way to becoming the finest twigs is amazing.</td>', 'That is a grand old tree.  The number of times that each branch has divided on its way to becoming the finest twigs is amazing.', '2006-09-11 20:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825334, 394458, 36619, '<td valign="top">i love the desolate feeling to this one. the processing is great as well.</td>', 'i love the desolate feeling to this one. the processing is great as well.', '2006-09-11 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825335, 393064, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  I fear for my camera in such misty moisty mornings.  But I am glad you took the risk.</td>', 'Nice effect.  I fear for my camera in such misty moisty mornings.  But I am glad you took the risk.', '2006-09-11 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825336, 394213, 36619, '<td valign="top">very nice perspective, feels like it could be on the very top of the world.</td>', 'very nice perspective, feels like it could be on the very top of the world.', '2006-09-11 20:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825337, 394536, 51538, '<td valign="top">The tree does stand out as if in an old airbrushed postcard photo.  Interesting view. 7.</td>', 'The tree does stand out as if in an old airbrushed postcard photo.  Interesting view. 7.', '2006-09-11 20:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825338, 394063, 36619, '<td valign="top">i like it, interesting background too.</td>', 'i like it, interesting background too.', '2006-09-11 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825340, 393641, 36619, '<td valign="top">i like the soft magical feel to this one.</td>', 'i like the soft magical feel to this one.', '2006-09-11 20:38:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2825341, 393782, 51538, '<td valign="top">Mine tailings?  Or a stream bleeding red iron oxide?  If the tree was a little bit more pronounced in colour, it would help.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Mine tailings?  Or a stream bleeding red iron oxide?  If the tree was a little bit more pronounced in colour, it would help.  Nice idea.', '2006-09-11 20:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825342, 394489, 36619, '<td valign="top">great colors. interesting tree.</td>', 'great colors. interesting tree.', '2006-09-11 20:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825344, 394440, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice down-home, detailed image.  Quiet, but I like it a lot. 8.</td>', 'Nice down-home, detailed image.  Quiet, but I like it a lot. 8.', '2006-09-11 20:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825345, 394533, 6179, '<td valign="top">Not a tree.</td>', 'Not a tree.', '2006-09-11 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825361, 393233, 51538, '<td valign="top">Hard to resist such images - by that I mean photographing them and viewing them.  But they do get passe, no matter how lovely.  The exagerated form that IR accomplishes works very well here. 8.</td>', 'Hard to resist such images - by that I mean photographing them and viewing them.  But they do get passe, no matter how lovely.  The exagerated form that IR accomplishes works very well here. 8.', '2006-09-11 20:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825377, 392759, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery. The tree gets a bit lost in the side of the cliff but it''s still a great photo.</td>', 'Lovely scenery. The tree gets a bit lost in the side of the cliff but it''s still a great photo.', '2006-09-11 20:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825379, 392899, 64489, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo.  While some might find the immense amount of sky to be somewhat overpowering, I think it gives a good perspective and sense of space.  The colors are great and I appreciate the simplicity.  I do feel that the dodging around the tree detracts from your photo, however; it''s a very obvious spot dab from a brush and lends the photo to have a manipulated feel.  That''s dangerous, because then you lose a notch of authenticity, and in a wonderful photo like this I think you want it to feel as natural as possible.  I like the choice to highlight the tree, but you don''t want it to be obvious what you''ve done.  Perhaps use a slightly larger brush that falls off more slowly, or lower the opacity to a degree.  All that being said, I liked this shot a lot and it was in my group of higher rated photographs.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo.  While some might find the immense amount of sky to be somewhat overpowering, I think it gives a good perspective and sense of space.  The colors are great and I appreciate the simplicity.  I do feel that the dodging around the tree detracts from your photo, however; it''s a very obvious spot dab from a brush and lends the photo to have a manipulated feel.  That''s dangerous, because then you lose a notch of authenticity, and in a wonderful photo like this I think you want it to feel as natural as possible.  I like the choice to highlight the tree, but you don''t want it to be obvious what you''ve done.  Perhaps use a slightly larger brush that falls off more slowly, or lower the opacity to a degree.  All that being said, I liked this shot a lot and it was in my group of higher rated photographs.', '2006-09-11 20:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825380, 394026, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like this. Very clear, not overprocessed and a bit unusual to see a tree in a cornfield (well, for me anyway, we don''t have many cornfields around here).</td>', 'I like this. Very clear, not overprocessed and a bit unusual to see a tree in a cornfield (well, for me anyway, we don''t have many cornfields around here).', '2006-09-11 20:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825415, 392899, 61318, '<td valign="top">this was the very first tree that came to mine when I read the challenge.  I even tried shooting it a couple times, but didn''t get anything worthwhile.<br/> <br/>I like your composition here, although there''s a bit too much blank sky for my tastes.  your dodge work on the tree is fairly obvious, too.  not necessarily a bad thing, but it is noticeable.</td>', 'this was the very first tree that came to mine when I read the challenge.  I even tried shooting it a couple times, but didn''t get anything worthwhile. I like your composition here, although there''s a bit too much blank sky for my tastes.  your dodge work on the tree is fairly obvious, too.  not necessarily a bad thing, but it is noticeable.', '2006-09-11 21:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825423, 393718, 11800, '<td valign="top">really a cool find. Even has a heart shaped belly button!</td>', 'really a cool find. Even has a heart shaped belly button!', '2006-09-11 21:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825428, 394450, 11800, '<td valign="top">nice cloud formation.</td>', 'nice cloud formation.', '2006-09-11 21:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825443, 391026, 45360, '<td valign="top">Great tree and moody sky but a little over processed for perhaps...</td>', 'Great tree and moody sky but a little over processed for perhaps...', '2006-09-11 21:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825468, 392759, 53243, '<td valign="top">my focus is more on the large rock - I had to look for the tree, but it''s a pretty shot.</td>', 'my focus is more on the large rock - I had to look for the tree, but it''s a pretty shot.', '2006-09-11 21:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825469, 394215, 53243, '<td valign="top">due to the colors, the center of my focus is not the tree as it blends into the background</td>', 'due to the colors, the center of my focus is not the tree as it blends into the background', '2006-09-11 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825481, 391026, 57886, '<td valign="top">IMHO a perfect picture - the colors are STUNNING.... the pp is great... - 10 <br/>....second look added to my favs.... :o) personally I think the pp suits perfectly here, maby because it is rather oobvious and I think it goes with the mood of the picture... love it.</td>', 'IMHO a perfect picture - the colors are STUNNING.... the pp is great... - 10 ....second look added to my favs.... :o) personally I think the pp suits perfectly here, maby because it is rather oobvious and I think it goes with the mood of the picture... love it.', '2006-09-11 21:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825483, 394490, 45360, '<td valign="top">Great detail, colours and subject.  I also like the composition.</td>', 'Great detail, colours and subject.  I also like the composition.', '2006-09-11 21:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825486, 394025, 45360, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sky, lots of drama and suits B&amp;W well (not sure about the title thought)   :o)</td>', 'Fantastic sky, lots of drama and suits B&W well (not sure about the title thought)   :o)', '2006-09-11 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825520, 392473, 15711, '<td valign="top">COOL FISHEYE!!!  Almost makes me dizzy.</td>', 'COOL FISHEYE!!!  Almost makes me dizzy.', '2006-09-11 21:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
