(2825577, 394456, 31403, '<td valign="top">I think you had a good thing going before the effect - not real wild about the processing here, but gotta admire you for submitting something outside the "DPC norm".  Thanks for your original take on this challenge.</td>', 'I think you had a good thing going before the effect - not real wild about the processing here, but gotta admire you for submitting something outside the "DPC norm".  Thanks for your original take on this challenge.', '2006-09-11 21:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
