(2825919, 394248, 31399, '<td valign="top">you surely made a ''single tree'' stand out as subject.  If you could do a layer to blur everything other than the front tree and  grass line from the base of that trunk and add tad more "pop" to tree itself you''d have a great shot here.  overall I give this a 8..gl in challenge :-)</td>', 'you surely made a ''single tree'' stand out as subject.  If you could do a layer to blur everything other than the front tree and  grass line from the base of that trunk and add tad more "pop" to tree itself you''d have a great shot here.  overall I give this a 8..gl in challenge :-)', '2006-09-11 22:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825920, 393641, 64489, '<td valign="top">As far as "a single tree" is concerned, I don''t think you can get more spot on than this. :-)  I love the way the valley draws the eye in toward the tree, and the texture and color of the image is nice as well.  It does feel underexposed, however, and I think that ends up hurting the photo overall.  My guess is that a compromise had to be made to preserve the lovely colors of the sunset in the sky, and the foreground ended up looking dull as a result.  The nice thing is that it''s obvious that there is still plenty of detail in the shadows, and those could easily and selectively be brought up in post with a little dodging work.  This photo would look great with some enhancement of the highlights and perhaps even a little extra saturation in the sky.  That being said, it''s a wonderful shot and I think it will do well in the competition.  Good job!</td>', 'As far as "a single tree" is concerned, I don''t think you can get more spot on than this. :-)  I love the way the valley draws the eye in toward the tree, and the texture and color of the image is nice as well.  It does feel underexposed, however, and I think that ends up hurting the photo overall.  My guess is that a compromise had to be made to preserve the lovely colors of the sunset in the sky, and the foreground ended up looking dull as a result.  The nice thing is that it''s obvious that there is still plenty of detail in the shadows, and those could easily and selectively be brought up in post with a little dodging work.  This photo would look great with some enhancement of the highlights and perhaps even a little extra saturation in the sky.  That being said, it''s a wonderful shot and I think it will do well in the competition.  Good job!', '2006-09-11 22:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825921, 394398, 41150, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. This one should do well.</td>', 'Beautiful. This one should do well.', '2006-09-11 22:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825923, 391071, 60779, '<td valign="top">OK looking bonsai, very dull table and background. I see two spots of sensor dust, one on each side of the tree. 4</td>', 'OK looking bonsai, very dull table and background. I see two spots of sensor dust, one on each side of the tree. 4', '2006-09-11 22:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825925, 393018, 31399, '<td valign="top">nice idea here.  just read an article on how to add "punch" or pop to black and white images..but dang if I could tell ya how to do that.  I do know you can add some to this photo and have a really really nice shot...check with one of the PP guru''s on the site?  overall I give this a 7 due to concept and light from right...gl in challenge :-) 7</td>', 'nice idea here.  just read an article on how to add "punch" or pop to black and white images..but dang if I could tell ya how to do that.  I do know you can add some to this photo and have a really really nice shot...check with one of the PP guru''s on the site?  overall I give this a 7 due to concept and light from right...gl in challenge :-) 7', '2006-09-11 22:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825929, 392169, 60779, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the final product. it''s too over processed for me. the subject tree is really underexposed and the background tree is too close for this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t like the final product. it''s too over processed for me. the subject tree is really underexposed and the background tree is too close for this challenge.', '2006-09-11 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825935, 394490, 31399, '<td valign="top">any way to sharpen the top third of this? I do like the bark, mosquite tree??? and the contrast of shapes, twisted limbs, trunk to rounded hills and mountains.  nice colours overall..perhaps shade darker or more saturation on blues and greens? score this an 8 easily and wish you best of luck in challenge :-)</td>', 'any way to sharpen the top third of this? I do like the bark, mosquite tree??? and the contrast of shapes, twisted limbs, trunk to rounded hills and mountains.  nice colours overall..perhaps shade darker or more saturation on blues and greens? score this an 8 easily and wish you best of luck in challenge :-)', '2006-09-11 23:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825941, 393656, 64489, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot, and I appreciate that you took the time not only to find a great location but to set up a subject as well.  It looks great in black and white, and the details like the girl''s white dress and black boots further work to enhance that choice.  I also like the fact that her face is obscured; it adds a sense of mystery and also helps the tree remain a focal point.  I think a little extra dodging and burning may help to add even more punch and definition to the image, but that is just personal choice.  Overall, I think this is a strong image.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot, and I appreciate that you took the time not only to find a great location but to set up a subject as well.  It looks great in black and white, and the details like the girl''s white dress and black boots further work to enhance that choice.  I also like the fact that her face is obscured; it adds a sense of mystery and also helps the tree remain a focal point.  I think a little extra dodging and burning may help to add even more punch and definition to the image, but that is just personal choice.  Overall, I think this is a strong image.', '2006-09-11 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2825943, 394144, 31399, '<td valign="top">lotta red appears in this image on my monitor (however I''m on laptop).  I like the composition. just not sure about the flat pale turquoise of sorts sky, moss green ground with red (think might be dead brown grass?)  gl in challenge :-)</td>', 'lotta red appears in this image on my monitor (however I''m on laptop).  I like the composition. just not sure about the flat pale turquoise of sorts sky, moss green ground with red (think might be dead brown grass?)  gl in challenge :-)', '2006-09-11 23:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
