(2825960, 394365, 31399, '<td valign="top">Burn/darken top 1/2 of this shot and I''d give it a 10.  I really like the lower 1/2 a lot!  overall I give this a 8 :-) gl in challenge</td>', 'Burn/darken top 1/2 of this shot and I''d give it a 10.  I really like the lower 1/2 a lot!  overall I give this a 8 :-) gl in challenge', '2006-09-11 23:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
