(2827202, 394025, 49403, '<td valign="top">great composition.</td>', 'great composition.', '2006-09-12 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827204, 393696, 51538, '<td valign="top">Looks like the base of the tree needs a good clean up there ;-)  I imagine having a tree house gives one a nice place to escape to.</td>', 'Looks like the base of the tree needs a good clean up there ;-)  I imagine having a tree house gives one a nice place to escape to.', '2006-09-12 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827206, 394436, 51538, '<td valign="top">Palms and sun go together well.  Part of the palminess of plams, though, is the slender trunk which bends a little.  Looks like yours is a date palm which has a slightly thicker trunk.  I wish I could see more of it.</td>', 'Palms and sun go together well.  Part of the palminess of plams, though, is the slender trunk which bends a little.  Looks like yours is a date palm which has a slightly thicker trunk.  I wish I could see more of it.', '2006-09-12 11:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827208, 394186, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice fading light and color on the horizon.  The silhouetted tree holds the composition together well.   Great job!</td>', 'Very nice fading light and color on the horizon.  The silhouetted tree holds the composition together well.   Great job!', '2006-09-12 11:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827209, 394186, 51538, '<td valign="top">Trees are useful for partial framing.  The tree in your photo enhances the viewing experience.</td>', 'Trees are useful for partial framing.  The tree in your photo enhances the viewing experience.', '2006-09-12 11:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827212, 394530, 51538, '<td valign="top">A nice breezy day by the looks of the water.  Nice detail in the sky - though dangerously near the sun.</td>', 'A nice breezy day by the looks of the water.  Nice detail in the sky - though dangerously near the sun.', '2006-09-12 11:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827215, 394025, 42100, '<td valign="top">Excellent b&amp;w tones in that awesome sky.  It would nicer if the tree was more in front of the whitest parts of the clouds to be just hair more visible.  Well done!</td>', 'Excellent b&w tones in that awesome sky.  It would nicer if the tree was more in front of the whitest parts of the clouds to be just hair more visible.  Well done!', '2006-09-12 11:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827216, 394389, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and cleanly executed.  The lush (cut) grass rather blocks access to your main feature.  Also, because it is so lush, it obscures the need for the tree''s metaphor of hope.  If the ground was a little more in need of some sort of greenery, your message would have been enhanced, IMO.</td>', 'Nice idea and cleanly executed.  The lush (cut) grass rather blocks access to your main feature.  Also, because it is so lush, it obscures the need for the tree''s metaphor of hope.  If the ground was a little more in need of some sort of greenery, your message would have been enhanced, IMO.', '2006-09-12 11:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827217, 394229, 42100, '<td valign="top">The PP is a little different here, but pretty cool.  Love the composition and subject matter.  Very nice!</td>', 'The PP is a little different here, but pretty cool.  Love the composition and subject matter.  Very nice!', '2006-09-12 11:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827222, 393990, 51538, '<td valign="top">Rather a nice silhouette and grass.  The sky is perfect.  Your little one is indeed cute - but I think the photo would have been better with the tree alone.  Although, I am not sure I could have left out the child if she was mine ;-)</td>', 'Rather a nice silhouette and grass.  The sky is perfect.  Your little one is indeed cute - but I think the photo would have been better with the tree alone.  Although, I am not sure I could have left out the child if she was mine ;-)', '2006-09-12 11:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827226, 394443, 51538, '<td valign="top">Almost picture perfect.  The azure sky and distant (dramatic) mountains make this image stand out.  Nice work.  I would have left out the cowgirl though. 7.</td>', 'Almost picture perfect.  The azure sky and distant (dramatic) mountains make this image stand out.  Nice work.  I would have left out the cowgirl though. 7.', '2006-09-12 11:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827227, 394479, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic PP on the sky for an impactful photo.  Good strong and well balanced composition.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very dramatic PP on the sky for an impactful photo.  Good strong and well balanced composition.  Nicely done!', '2006-09-12 11:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827230, 391249, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky and interestingly devoid terrain.  The tree is barely discernable as a tree - without a scale reference, it might as well be a bush.  Overall, a nice photo in search of a little more subject.</td>', 'Lovely sky and interestingly devoid terrain.  The tree is barely discernable as a tree - without a scale reference, it might as well be a bush.  Overall, a nice photo in search of a little more subject.', '2006-09-12 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827232, 393769, 51538, '<td valign="top">A nice tree there and it must have been a pleasant and memorable evening you spent photographing it.</td>', 'A nice tree there and it must have been a pleasant and memorable evening you spent photographing it.', '2006-09-12 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827235, 393860, 51538, '<td valign="top">Ficus have to grow a little to become trees.  Most often, we see them as house plants.  I like the reflection and isolation. 7.</td>', 'Ficus have to grow a little to become trees.  Most often, we see them as house plants.  I like the reflection and isolation. 7.', '2006-09-12 11:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827236, 394269, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool and ethereal looking scene.  The lighting is wonderful in the background and foreground, but gets a tiny bit harsh in  the leaves  of the tree.  But fortunately not enough to kill the feel and vibe of this photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Very cool and ethereal looking scene.  The lighting is wonderful in the background and foreground, but gets a tiny bit harsh in  the leaves  of the tree.  But fortunately not enough to kill the feel and vibe of this photo.  Great job!', '2006-09-12 11:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827237, 394003, 33672, '<td valign="top">Alot of great texture in this photo. nice tones albiet a little too soft in my humble opinion.</td>', 'Alot of great texture in this photo. nice tones albiet a little too soft in my humble opinion.', '2006-09-12 11:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827238, 394185, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great sky and incredible comp.</td>', 'Great sky and incredible comp.', '2006-09-12 11:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827240, 394232, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice how you were able to carry the selective desat down through the roots.  Well done photo!</td>', 'Very nice how you were able to carry the selective desat down through the roots.  Well done photo!', '2006-09-12 11:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827241, 391941, 51538, '<td valign="top">Now you have captured a very nice simple landscape of the Chinese shan shui (mountain water) painting type - almost.  I like the dull colours - almost lack of colour perhaps.  Possibly a little work on this could make it outstanding.  I imagine it would work in sepia or b/w as well. 8.</td>', 'Now you have captured a very nice simple landscape of the Chinese shan shui (mountain water) painting type - almost.  I like the dull colours - almost lack of colour perhaps.  Possibly a little work on this could make it outstanding.  I imagine it would work in sepia or b/w as well. 8.', '2006-09-12 11:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827242, 392451, 32345, '<td valign="top">Loved the texture of the tree. Colors are really good, well done.</td>', 'Loved the texture of the tree. Colors are really good, well done.', '2006-09-12 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827244, 394440, 32345, '<td valign="top">I love it, having a person in the picture gives it another dimension. Good job.</td>', 'I love it, having a person in the picture gives it another dimension. Good job.', '2006-09-12 11:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827245, 393112, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of the advantages of location.. Great,great photo. Nice comp and tones. frame works well too.</td>', 'One of the advantages of location.. Great,great photo. Nice comp and tones. frame works well too.', '2006-09-12 11:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827246, 393059, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, the perspective works really well here.</td>', 'Great DOF, the perspective works really well here.', '2006-09-12 11:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827248, 394508, 51538, '<td valign="top">I expect they will replant it in times to come, right?  I wish there was more light on the ground so that I could see what the story might be about.</td>', 'I expect they will replant it in times to come, right?  I wish there was more light on the ground so that I could see what the story might be about.', '2006-09-12 11:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827250, 394213, 32345, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in the colors.</td>', 'Nice contrast in the colors.', '2006-09-12 11:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827254, 394222, 32345, '<td valign="top">A very nice point of view.</td>', 'A very nice point of view.', '2006-09-12 11:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827258, 393990, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture but I don''t really undersatnd your titled, but don''t worry I didn''t lower your score because of it. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice picture but I don''t really undersatnd your titled, but don''t worry I didn''t lower your score because of it. Well done.', '2006-09-12 11:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827261, 394457, 51538, '<td valign="top">The Norse Tree of Life and Valhalla.  An interesting juxtaposition.</td>', 'The Norse Tree of Life and Valhalla.  An interesting juxtaposition.', '2006-09-12 11:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827265, 394492, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and the simple image is very effective.  I like the fence line. 7.</td>', 'Nice tones and the simple image is very effective.  I like the fence line. 7.', '2006-09-12 11:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827267, 394398, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great picture, a top ten in my opinion.</td>', 'Great picture, a top ten in my opinion.', '2006-09-12 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827268, 392964, 32345, '<td valign="top">I love it, beautifull.</td>', 'I love it, beautifull.', '2006-09-12 11:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827270, 392140, 32345, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, moody. Well done.</td>', 'Nice colors, moody. Well done.', '2006-09-12 11:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827276, 394364, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lighting, well done.</td>', 'Great colors and lighting, well done.', '2006-09-12 11:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827277, 394533, 51538, '<td valign="top">In lieu of real growing wood, wires hung on a metal tree.  Interesting idea.  Rather noisy though.</td>', 'In lieu of real growing wood, wires hung on a metal tree.  Interesting idea.  Rather noisy though.', '2006-09-12 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827281, 392897, 32345, '<td valign="top">Really good point of vue. Great colors.</td>', 'Really good point of vue. Great colors.', '2006-09-12 11:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827283, 393656, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, I love the mood of it. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice picture, I love the mood of it. Well done.', '2006-09-12 11:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827285, 393657, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and great lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice colors and great lighting. Well done.', '2006-09-12 11:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827290, 391918, 32345, '<td valign="top">Good find.</td>', 'Good find.', '2006-09-12 11:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827297, 393912, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and detail.  Nice choices on the saturation levels.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice lighting and detail.  Nice choices on the saturation levels.  Great job!', '2006-09-12 11:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827301, 393975, 51538, '<td valign="top">An interesting hue of red in the background.  The tree looks a little stumpy.</td>', 'An interesting hue of red in the background.  The tree looks a little stumpy.', '2006-09-12 11:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827303, 394041, 42100, '<td valign="top">Those lines and curves are perfectly placed for a great composition, excellent photographic vision seeing this.  Well done!</td>', 'Those lines and curves are perfectly placed for a great composition, excellent photographic vision seeing this.  Well done!', '2006-09-12 11:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827304, 394479, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice serene view there.  The fence certainly helps this image a lot.  Is it me, or is there some banding in the sky? 7.</td>', 'Nice serene view there.  The fence certainly helps this image a lot.  Is it me, or is there some banding in the sky? 7.', '2006-09-12 11:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827307, 392126, 51538, '<td valign="top">Must be a Canadian thing... never heard of it before.  Nice crisp photo though.</td>', 'Must be a Canadian thing... never heard of it before.  Nice crisp photo though.', '2006-09-12 11:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827308, 393112, 42100, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene with the light on the dead tree and the wildlife in the field.  Very nice!</td>', 'A beautiful scene with the light on the dead tree and the wildlife in the field.  Very nice!', '2006-09-12 11:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827312, 394322, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very stock, but nicely executed.  Playing to the gallery. 7.</td>', 'Very stock, but nicely executed.  Playing to the gallery. 7.', '2006-09-12 11:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827316, 394494, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh there and the composition is pleasant.</td>', 'Nice bokeh there and the composition is pleasant.', '2006-09-12 11:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827319, 393059, 42100, '<td valign="top">Strong foreground element in this photo, but doesn''t compete with or take away from the strength of the tree as a key element.  Nice side light as well.  Great job!</td>', 'Strong foreground element in this photo, but doesn''t compete with or take away from the strength of the tree as a key element.  Nice side light as well.  Great job!', '2006-09-12 11:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827323, 394225, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I might have cloned out the white pile on the left side and made this black and white.  I find the green tone a bit lacking in boosting the image.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I might have cloned out the white pile on the left side and made this black and white.  I find the green tone a bit lacking in boosting the image.', '2006-09-12 11:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827326, 392651, 51538, '<td valign="top">I know that feeling.  I like your choice of tones and the detail and depth of field work well.</td>', 'I know that feeling.  I like your choice of tones and the detail and depth of field work well.', '2006-09-12 11:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827328, 392897, 51538, '<td valign="top">Grand view, lovely lush green sight.  If that wall and bush on the left were cloned out it would be sparkling. 7.</td>', 'Grand view, lovely lush green sight.  If that wall and bush on the left were cloned out it would be sparkling. 7.', '2006-09-12 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827331, 394146, 51538, '<td valign="top">Arbutus are wonderful trees.  Rare to find them.  The texture of this one is very nice.  I wonder if the lighting could be better?</td>', 'Arbutus are wonderful trees.  Rare to find them.  The texture of this one is very nice.  I wonder if the lighting could be better?', '2006-09-12 11:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827335, 394223, 51538, '<td valign="top">At least it has open access to rain water.  When they plant trees in NYC, they surround them with concrete and bricks.  Such ignorance!</td>', 'At least it has open access to rain water.  When they plant trees in NYC, they surround them with concrete and bricks.  Such ignorance!', '2006-09-12 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827338, 393657, 51538, '<td valign="top">A good location to find classic examples of trees.  The lighting is a bit on the harsh side - which obscures the overall ''natural'' soft effect of such gardens.</td>', 'A good location to find classic examples of trees.  The lighting is a bit on the harsh side - which obscures the overall ''natural'' soft effect of such gardens.', '2006-09-12 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2827340, 392899, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and colours.  The clouds cooperated perfectly. 8.</td>', 'Lovely composition and colours.  The clouds cooperated perfectly. 8.', '2006-09-12 11:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827342, 393972, 51538, '<td valign="top">Wonderful treatment of this photo.  It works very well. 8.</td>', 'Wonderful treatment of this photo.  It works very well. 8.', '2006-09-12 11:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827345, 391222, 51538, '<td valign="top">Another environmentally conscious artist at work, I see.  Nice range of steely hues there.</td>', 'Another environmentally conscious artist at work, I see.  Nice range of steely hues there.', '2006-09-12 11:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827349, 394427, 51538, '<td valign="top">That looks like a location for a pleasant walk in the countryside.  Looks a little English to me.  Nice simple composition.</td>', 'That looks like a location for a pleasant walk in the countryside.  Looks a little English to me.  Nice simple composition.', '2006-09-12 11:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827352, 393221, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.  It is a sort of icon.</td>', 'Simple but effective.  It is a sort of icon.', '2006-09-12 11:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827357, 394535, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field here and the overall effect is pleasant.</td>', 'Nice depth of field here and the overall effect is pleasant.', '2006-09-12 11:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827364, 394073, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  The tree is nicely unusual in that it has a door and a window.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  The tree is nicely unusual in that it has a door and a window.', '2006-09-12 11:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827368, 394451, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  The gilded tarmac enhances the image too.  My only wish would be to get rid of those trucks or houses or.. on the horizon line - but that was out of your control ;-)</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  The gilded tarmac enhances the image too.  My only wish would be to get rid of those trucks or houses or.. on the horizon line - but that was out of your control ;-)', '2006-09-12 11:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827370, 394520, 60477, '<td valign="top">I love the idea...but the tree is kind of lost in the intensity of the background</td>', 'I love the idea...but the tree is kind of lost in the intensity of the background', '2006-09-12 11:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827371, 394093, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s bright but somehow this does work.  Is the tree a miniature?</td>', 'It''s bright but somehow this does work.  Is the tree a miniature?', '2006-09-12 11:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827373, 394289, 60477, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot more if the foregroudn wasn''t so fuzzy</td>', 'I like this a lot more if the foregroudn wasn''t so fuzzy', '2006-09-12 11:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827379, 394247, 60477, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see this shot with a more blue sky...it might not work with the title...nonetheless cheers for a great shot!</td>', 'I''d love to see this shot with a more blue sky...it might not work with the title...nonetheless cheers for a great shot!', '2006-09-12 11:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827380, 394449, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice blue (it has artifacts in it though) and the rocks are good.  The light is on the bright side.</td>', 'Nice blue (it has artifacts in it though) and the rocks are good.  The light is on the bright side.', '2006-09-12 11:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827384, 391472, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours and nice symmetry.  The focus seems a little soft.  I may be wrong.</td>', 'Pretty colours and nice symmetry.  The focus seems a little soft.  I may be wrong.', '2006-09-12 11:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827386, 391007, 60477, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit rough on my eyes...not sure what I''d replace it with.</td>', 'The background is a bit rough on my eyes...not sure what I''d replace it with.', '2006-09-12 11:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827387, 393599, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting location.  Pity about the camper and all the modern items lying about... Nice tones too.</td>', 'That''s an interesting location.  Pity about the camper and all the modern items lying about... Nice tones too.', '2006-09-12 11:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827388, 393127, 51538, '<td valign="top">Brighter colours would give me that message a bit better.</td>', 'Brighter colours would give me that message a bit better.', '2006-09-12 11:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827391, 392930, 60477, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a tree like that...I''d need to see the bottom to justify my perspective...I''m suspending reality and giving you a decent score.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a tree like that...I''d need to see the bottom to justify my perspective...I''m suspending reality and giving you a decent score.', '2006-09-12 11:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827394, 394398, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely lush green there.  There are large areas in which nothing much is going on to enhance the overall effect.  I call it diluted.  I wonder if there is a way to counteract that dilution?</td>', 'Lovely lush green there.  There are large areas in which nothing much is going on to enhance the overall effect.  I call it diluted.  I wonder if there is a way to counteract that dilution?', '2006-09-12 11:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827395, 393508, 60477, '<td valign="top">Excellent! A ten in a sea of mediocrity.</td>', 'Excellent! A ten in a sea of mediocrity.', '2006-09-12 11:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827399, 393729, 51538, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you got a clean view of the trunk.  It''s the trunk that makes palms unusual or distinctive.</td>', 'I''m glad you got a clean view of the trunk.  It''s the trunk that makes palms unusual or distinctive.', '2006-09-12 11:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827406, 393783, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice location and interesting tree form.  The natural versus artificial lighting makes for a startling efect.</td>', 'Nice location and interesting tree form.  The natural versus artificial lighting makes for a startling efect.', '2006-09-12 11:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827407, 394489, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the way the clouds feather off into the distance.  The title is great.  Wonderful image all in all. 10.</td>', 'I like the way the clouds feather off into the distance.  The title is great.  Wonderful image all in all. 10.', '2006-09-12 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827409, 394181, 51538, '<td valign="top">And tiny grass-high photographer  ;-)  That''s a pretty piece of countryside.</td>', 'And tiny grass-high photographer  ;-)  That''s a pretty piece of countryside.', '2006-09-12 11:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827412, 394168, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nicely balanced composition, the trunk is very interesting with the eye and the grass grains sneaking into the frame.  The other side with the trail, nicely blurred, has interest as well.  All this interest begins to become dangerously close to being too busy, but fortunately doesn''t cross that line yet.  Of course, the condensing to the 640 pixel real estate doesn''t help that much.  Maybe a bit more of the grassy side to help balance the composition a little more.</td>', 'Very nicely balanced composition, the trunk is very interesting with the eye and the grass grains sneaking into the frame.  The other side with the trail, nicely blurred, has interest as well.  All this interest begins to become dangerously close to being too busy, but fortunately doesn''t cross that line yet.  Of course, the condensing to the 640 pixel real estate doesn''t help that much.  Maybe a bit more of the grassy side to help balance the composition a little more.', '2006-09-12 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827414, 394520, 51538, '<td valign="top">The overall effect is: arid.  Interesting forms.</td>', 'The overall effect is: arid.  Interesting forms.', '2006-09-12 11:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827420, 393302, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty cloud formation and nice location.  The rocks are lovely shapes.  Overall, very pleasing. 8.</td>', 'Pretty cloud formation and nice location.  The rocks are lovely shapes.  Overall, very pleasing. 8.', '2006-09-12 11:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827422, 394338, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humour and neatly photographed composition.</td>', 'Good sense of humour and neatly photographed composition.', '2006-09-12 11:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827431, 393793, 51538, '<td valign="top">Trees develop wondrous shapes when given unfettered access to sunlight.  This specimen is very grand.  The sky is pleasant.  I would have liked more light on the field though.  The tree does not work so well as a silhouette since it is not on a horizon line...</td>', 'Trees develop wondrous shapes when given unfettered access to sunlight.  This specimen is very grand.  The sky is pleasant.  I would have liked more light on the field though.  The tree does not work so well as a silhouette since it is not on a horizon line...', '2006-09-12 12:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827434, 394274, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of the few willows in this challenge.  Nice b/w image.</td>', 'One of the few willows in this challenge.  Nice b/w image.', '2006-09-12 12:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827437, 393962, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice shape in that tree.  A good choice.</td>', 'Nice shape in that tree.  A good choice.', '2006-09-12 12:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827438, 394440, 60477, '<td valign="top">Nice job...</td>', 'Nice job...', '2006-09-12 12:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827439, 391306, 51538, '<td valign="top">The end.  But some trees fall over and grow back up.  So perhaps not (.)</td>', 'The end.  But some trees fall over and grow back up.  So perhaps not (.)', '2006-09-12 12:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827447, 391457, 51538, '<td valign="top">These sights of green around us make life a pleasant coexistence with nature.  You live in a nice location.</td>', 'These sights of green around us make life a pleasant coexistence with nature.  You live in a nice location.', '2006-09-12 12:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827449, 394490, 51538, '<td valign="top">That tree has character and the setting is grand.  Very nice work. 9.</td>', 'That tree has character and the setting is grand.  Very nice work. 9.', '2006-09-12 12:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827452, 394025, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty billowing clouds there.  It''s a little on the dark side down below though.</td>', 'Pretty billowing clouds there.  It''s a little on the dark side down below though.', '2006-09-12 12:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827453, 392714, 51538, '<td valign="top">The overall effect looks highly processed - but it does work and I like the golden field.</td>', 'The overall effect looks highly processed - but it does work and I like the golden field.', '2006-09-12 12:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827455, 394450, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the delicate nature of this photo and the unusual sky enhances the image greatly.  It is all about light.  The tree is merely a supporting reason for being.  Nice work. 8.</td>', 'I like the delicate nature of this photo and the unusual sky enhances the image greatly.  It is all about light.  The tree is merely a supporting reason for being.  Nice work. 8.', '2006-09-12 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827456, 393907, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty but a little hard to discern.</td>', 'Pretty but a little hard to discern.', '2006-09-12 12:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827459, 391026, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely gradations of tone in the sky and all through the photo.  The tree is interesting in form and the whole image has a painterly effect.</td>', 'Lovely gradations of tone in the sky and all through the photo.  The tree is interesting in form and the whole image has a painterly effect.', '2006-09-12 12:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827460, 394213, 51538, '<td valign="top">The hillside has a lovely part of a sphere form.  The shadow on that form and the tree make this outstanding. 8.</td>', 'The hillside has a lovely part of a sphere form.  The shadow on that form and the tree make this outstanding. 8.', '2006-09-12 12:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827461, 394536, 33672, '<td valign="top">A bit too much saturation detracts from an excellent landscape with great comp.</td>', 'A bit too much saturation detracts from an excellent landscape with great comp.', '2006-09-12 12:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827463, 394269, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s super-real yet how can it be?  Lovely grasses - a favourite of mine - and golden light.  All in all, very nice work. 9.</td>', 'It''s super-real yet how can it be?  Lovely grasses - a favourite of mine - and golden light.  All in all, very nice work. 9.', '2006-09-12 12:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827473, 394225, 61495, '<td valign="top">great detail, nice gray values in branches</td>', 'great detail, nice gray values in branches', '2006-09-12 12:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827491, 394331, 51538, '<td valign="top">Something has been snacking on those leafs.  Nice crisp focus where it is needed.  Easy to overlook this image really, but it is quite good and an interesting botanical photo. 7.</td>', 'Something has been snacking on those leafs.  Nice crisp focus where it is needed.  Easy to overlook this image really, but it is quite good and an interesting botanical photo. 7.', '2006-09-12 12:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827493, 394253, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice colours there.  Setting the white balance to tungsten might have given you a darker black sky.</td>', 'Nice colours there.  Setting the white balance to tungsten might have given you a darker black sky.', '2006-09-12 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827494, 394095, 51538, '<td valign="top">The tree has a great form and the overall effect is pleasant.  Nice countryside there.</td>', 'The tree has a great form and the overall effect is pleasant.  Nice countryside there.', '2006-09-12 12:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827497, 394438, 51538, '<td valign="top">A classic shape - but partly obscured by the clouds.  Overall a nice image with potential.</td>', 'A classic shape - but partly obscured by the clouds.  Overall a nice image with potential.', '2006-09-12 12:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827500, 392874, 51538, '<td valign="top">Now what has that lonely tree got to do with those three suspicious characters in the background?  I know, they buried one of their competitors under it a few years back and came to dance on the site to remind them of their victory... ;-)</td>', 'Now what has that lonely tree got to do with those three suspicious characters in the background?  I know, they buried one of their competitors under it a few years back and came to dance on the site to remind them of their victory... ;-)', '2006-09-12 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827501, 393808, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and angle.  Pretty colours too. 9.</td>', 'Lovely composition and angle.  Pretty colours too. 9.', '2006-09-12 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827504, 392880, 51538, '<td valign="top">Classic to the right sunset silhouette image though the sky might have been processed a bit.</td>', 'Classic to the right sunset silhouette image though the sky might have been processed a bit.', '2006-09-12 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827507, 394517, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s an old tree and a pleasant place to sit under.  Nicely composed and photographed.</td>', 'That''s an old tree and a pleasant place to sit under.  Nicely composed and photographed.', '2006-09-12 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827508, 394210, 51538, '<td valign="top">Our appreciation for trees comes from their sheltering shade.  Your image captures and shows that reason very well.  Nice work.</td>', 'Our appreciation for trees comes from their sheltering shade.  Your image captures and shows that reason very well.  Nice work.', '2006-09-12 12:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827515, 394080, 51538, '<td valign="top">Once, back many years, this was surrounded by many of its own kind - then along came the roads, the horses and tractors, the axes and saws... Silent testimony to passive change which is affecting all our lives.</td>', 'Once, back many years, this was surrounded by many of its own kind - then along came the roads, the horses and tractors, the axes and saws... Silent testimony to passive change which is affecting all our lives.', '2006-09-12 12:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827519, 394041, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice geometry there.  As a record of such places, it is a good photo.</td>', 'Nice geometry there.  As a record of such places, it is a good photo.', '2006-09-12 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827521, 394412, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed silhouettes in which the grass enhances the image greatly, as do the stars.  Well done. 9.</td>', 'Nicely detailed silhouettes in which the grass enhances the image greatly, as do the stars.  Well done. 9.', '2006-09-12 12:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827523, 394077, 51538, '<td valign="top">An hour in the morning is worth two in the afternoon... nice work and it was worth it.</td>', 'An hour in the morning is worth two in the afternoon... nice work and it was worth it.', '2006-09-12 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827528, 394358, 42100, '<td valign="top">The composition is very nice and I like how the hills fade away into the distance.  The solar flares while faint are visible enough to distract and do little to enhance the photo.  While hardly noticeable, I would of still have taken advantage of the advanced rule set and cloned out the sensor dust.  I''m not sure if the flares would of fallen under the major element clause or not.</td>', 'The composition is very nice and I like how the hills fade away into the distance.  The solar flares while faint are visible enough to distract and do little to enhance the photo.  While hardly noticeable, I would of still have taken advantage of the advanced rule set and cloned out the sensor dust.  I''m not sure if the flares would of fallen under the major element clause or not.', '2006-09-12 12:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827529, 394205, 51538, '<td valign="top">The geometricity of the foreground creats a great image.  Nice work.</td>', 'The geometricity of the foreground creats a great image.  Nice work.', '2006-09-12 12:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827534, 394522, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty, peaceful, unpretentious image.  Nice work. 8.</td>', 'Pretty, peaceful, unpretentious image.  Nice work. 8.', '2006-09-12 12:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827537, 394009, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice tree shaped tree.  If you switch the camera''s white balance mode to tungsten you would have achieved a blacker, more night-like image.</td>', 'It''s a nice tree shaped tree.  If you switch the camera''s white balance mode to tungsten you would have achieved a blacker, more night-like image.', '2006-09-12 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827538, 394510, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the overall effect of your processing.  The pine cones come over very well with this technique.</td>', 'I like the overall effect of your processing.  The pine cones come over very well with this technique.', '2006-09-12 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827544, 394063, 51538, '<td valign="top">Agriculture has always been a strong reason for deforestation.  Perhaps this is a good example too.  Nice red soil there.</td>', 'Agriculture has always been a strong reason for deforestation.  Perhaps this is a good example too.  Nice red soil there.', '2006-09-12 12:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827545, 394432, 51538, '<td valign="top">Diminutive against such a landscape but solitary, none-the-less.</td>', 'Diminutive against such a landscape but solitary, none-the-less.', '2006-09-12 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827546, 394507, 42100, '<td valign="top">The sky is absolutely beautiful and radiant.  I don''t know what circumstances dictated, but moving closer would of the allowed the tree to take up more of the frame, and the dark bottom less.  After all the sky and tree are the story, they should dominate the frame.</td>', 'The sky is absolutely beautiful and radiant.  I don''t know what circumstances dictated, but moving closer would of the allowed the tree to take up more of the frame, and the dark bottom less.  After all the sky and tree are the story, they should dominate the frame.', '2006-09-12 12:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827552, 394251, 51538, '<td valign="top">And who knows how many Indians were slaughtered there or nearby in past history.  We are surrounded by graveyards.</td>', 'And who knows how many Indians were slaughtered there or nearby in past history.  We are surrounded by graveyards.', '2006-09-12 12:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827555, 393968, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and cloud formation.</td>', 'Lovely colours and cloud formation.', '2006-09-12 12:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827559, 391918, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation.  The black and white rendition works well too.</td>', 'Nice interpretation.  The black and white rendition works well too.', '2006-09-12 12:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827561, 392169, 51538, '<td valign="top">Those flowers are bright.  They sprouted after thr rain?</td>', 'Those flowers are bright.  They sprouted after thr rain?', '2006-09-12 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827564, 392562, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice blue summery haze there.</td>', 'Nice blue summery haze there.', '2006-09-12 12:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827565, 394365, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset and the tree has a nice interesting shape.</td>', 'Pretty sunset and the tree has a nice interesting shape.', '2006-09-12 12:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
