(2827616, 391770, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed photo.  The plant will eventually grow into a tree if you keep on pampering it like that.  In about 5 years time you will be able to enter it into the Sapling I challenge and in, say, 15 years you can enter the A Single Tree XXXV challenge ;-)</td>', 'Nicely detailed photo.  The plant will eventually grow into a tree if you keep on pampering it like that.  In about 5 years time you will be able to enter it into the Sapling I challenge and in, say, 15 years you can enter the A Single Tree XXXV challenge ;-)', '2006-09-12 12:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827619, 390850, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice details and greenery.</td>', 'Nice details and greenery.', '2006-09-12 12:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827622, 394347, 51538, '<td valign="top">I wish there was more detail on the balloon.</td>', 'I wish there was more detail on the balloon.', '2006-09-12 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827625, 392125, 51538, '<td valign="top">Remarkable tree.  Nicely photographed with a good depth of field.  I like the black and white treatment. 8.</td>', 'Remarkable tree.  Nicely photographed with a good depth of field.  I like the black and white treatment. 8.', '2006-09-12 12:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827627, 394027, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice colours.  I wish I could see the stump form more clearly.</td>', 'Good idea and nice colours.  I wish I could see the stump form more clearly.', '2006-09-12 12:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827629, 394104, 51538, '<td valign="top">The trunk does stand out from the vegetation.  Nice intricate textures there.</td>', 'The trunk does stand out from the vegetation.  Nice intricate textures there.', '2006-09-12 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827635, 394232, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment - if cliched. The position of the hand is very good and the form of the sapling nice too. Good work. 7.</td>', 'Nice treatment - if cliched. The position of the hand is very good and the form of the sapling nice too. Good work. 7.', '2006-09-12 12:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
