(2827645, 394135, 51538, '<td valign="top">The names mean nothing to me.  But the location and tree form are good.  I like the water surface texture and colour.  The tree is neither a silhouette nor a well lit form.  I wonder how it could be improved?</td>', 'The names mean nothing to me.  But the location and tree form are good.  I like the water surface texture and colour.  The tree is neither a silhouette nor a well lit form.  I wonder how it could be improved?', '2006-09-12 12:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827648, 394330, 51538, '<td valign="top">The angle works OK to me.  The clouds make the photo even more graphic.</td>', 'The angle works OK to me.  The clouds make the photo even more graphic.', '2006-09-12 12:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827649, 394516, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice forms and colours there.</td>', 'Nice forms and colours there.', '2006-09-12 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827650, 394003, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the tone you chose and the forms.  The rock enhances the overall image.</td>', 'I like the tone you chose and the forms.  The rock enhances the overall image.', '2006-09-12 13:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827654, 392578, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  It is in a hard location to photograph, I think.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  It is in a hard location to photograph, I think.', '2006-09-12 13:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827655, 394002, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and mossy bark there.</td>', 'Nice textures and mossy bark there.', '2006-09-12 13:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827657, 393432, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely overall image.  Nice geometric shapes without being symmetrical.  8.</td>', 'Lovely overall image.  Nice geometric shapes without being symmetrical.  8.', '2006-09-12 13:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827658, 394171, 51538, '<td valign="top">They pop up everywhere...</td>', 'They pop up everywhere...', '2006-09-12 13:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827660, 394385, 51538, '<td valign="top">A wired juniper branch.  It has a long way to go before it becomes a mature bonsai specimen.</td>', 'A wired juniper branch.  It has a long way to go before it becomes a mature bonsai specimen.', '2006-09-12 13:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827662, 394364, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of tones and the location is very nice. 9.</td>', 'Nice choice of tones and the location is very nice. 9.', '2006-09-12 13:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827663, 393818, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice peaceful feeling there.</td>', 'Nice peaceful feeling there.', '2006-09-12 13:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827664, 392451, 51538, '<td valign="top">Gum tree bark is especially smooth and your photo captures that well.  Eucalyptus grows the world over.  When it was planted in the colder parts of Russia, the tree adapted to become deciduous.</td>', 'Gum tree bark is especially smooth and your photo captures that well.  Eucalyptus grows the world over.  When it was planted in the colder parts of Russia, the tree adapted to become deciduous.', '2006-09-12 13:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827669, 391320, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes of the fence and tree.  Overall a very pleasant image recording what must have been a lovely evening. 8.</td>', 'Nice silhouettes of the fence and tree.  Overall a very pleasant image recording what must have been a lovely evening. 8.', '2006-09-12 13:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827670, 393806, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well, if you are going to go for a cliche, do it in style.  You have.  I think it all works well. 7.</td>', 'Well, if you are going to go for a cliche, do it in style.  You have.  I think it all works well. 7.', '2006-09-12 13:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827675, 394372, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Trees grow again from their roots in times of disaster.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Trees grow again from their roots in times of disaster.', '2006-09-12 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827679, 394513, 51538, '<td valign="top">That tree is suffering from a blight unfortunately.  The overall effect is interesting - but noisy.</td>', 'That tree is suffering from a blight unfortunately.  The overall effect is interesting - but noisy.', '2006-09-12 13:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827681, 394442, 51538, '<td valign="top">The blue is a bit on the noisy side but the overal idea is quite good.</td>', 'The blue is a bit on the noisy side but the overal idea is quite good.', '2006-09-12 13:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827682, 394526, 51538, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the grass adds to the photo as does the rainbow.</td>', 'The inclusion of the grass adds to the photo as does the rainbow.', '2006-09-12 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827684, 394373, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty scenery and a nice place for a walk.</td>', 'Pretty scenery and a nice place for a walk.', '2006-09-12 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827691, 394093, 42100, '<td valign="top">Time of day is everything as far as outdoor photography goes, watch and learn when more favorable times are.  For example look for times when harsh shadows aren''t being cast on your subject, the camera just can''t see this scene like your eyes do.</td>', 'Time of day is everything as far as outdoor photography goes, watch and learn when more favorable times are.  For example look for times when harsh shadows aren''t being cast on your subject, the camera just can''t see this scene like your eyes do.', '2006-09-12 13:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827739, 394232, 3942, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and well executed. I would have cropped a little stronger at the right and bottom. But thats only marginal. Good luck for the challenge!</td>', 'Creative idea and well executed. I would have cropped a little stronger at the right and bottom. But thats only marginal. Good luck for the challenge!', '2006-09-12 13:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827743, 393696, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!</td>', 'Great perspective!', '2006-09-12 13:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827745, 394027, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast, but it''s kind of hard to see what you''re looking at.  Maybe dodging the darker parts of the trunk would help bring out textured details.</td>', 'I like the high contrast, but it''s kind of hard to see what you''re looking at.  Maybe dodging the darker parts of the trunk would help bring out textured details.', '2006-09-12 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827746, 394154, 55738, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors!</td>', 'Lovely colors!', '2006-09-12 13:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827747, 394442, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great composition! What a wonderfully shaped tree.  You''ve captured it excellently!</td>', 'Great composition! What a wonderfully shaped tree.  You''ve captured it excellently!', '2006-09-12 13:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827751, 394377, 55738, '<td valign="top">I don''t really feel that a single tree is a solid subject here.  Having one tree and no others in focus helps, but I really feel that the structure on the ground is more the subject.</td>', 'I don''t really feel that a single tree is a solid subject here.  Having one tree and no others in focus helps, but I really feel that the structure on the ground is more the subject.', '2006-09-12 13:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827754, 394256, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract, kind of spooky!  I just find the postprocessing to be a little too sharp and harsh.  The roots are such soft lines I would have like to see that forwarded.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract, kind of spooky!  I just find the postprocessing to be a little too sharp and harsh.  The roots are such soft lines I would have like to see that forwarded.', '2006-09-12 13:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827759, 394458, 55738, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W treatment is perfect here.  I love the lighter area highlighting the tree.  Well done.</td>', 'The B&W treatment is perfect here.  I love the lighter area highlighting the tree.  Well done.', '2006-09-12 13:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827763, 393635, 55738, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!</td>', 'Excellent composition!', '2006-09-12 13:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827767, 394199, 55738, '<td valign="top">I find the tree tough to pick out.  The bright spot at the top is really what draws my eye and so it''s hard to settle on the tree as subject.  I think it meets the challenge, but the tree needs to be brightened up some.</td>', 'I find the tree tough to pick out.  The bright spot at the top is really what draws my eye and so it''s hard to settle on the tree as subject.  I think it meets the challenge, but the tree needs to be brightened up some.', '2006-09-12 13:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827771, 394330, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the color treatment of the sky and the skewed angle is an interesting choice.  I''m curious to see why you chose to do this.  I''m not sure it adds to the photo...</td>', 'I like the color treatment of the sky and the skewed angle is an interesting choice.  I''m curious to see why you chose to do this.  I''m not sure it adds to the photo...', '2006-09-12 13:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827773, 393508, 55738, '<td valign="top">What a dynamic sky!  I hope you tell how you did it in your comments!  If not, will you tell me?!?  :)</td>', 'What a dynamic sky!  I hope you tell how you did it in your comments!  If not, will you tell me?!?  :)', '2006-09-12 13:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827777, 393806, 55738, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the tree is the subject.  I think it meets the challenge pretty well but with the bright reflection of the moon pointing the eye toward the little fisherman guy, I feel that he''s more the subject...</td>', 'I don''t feel that the tree is the subject.  I think it meets the challenge pretty well but with the bright reflection of the moon pointing the eye toward the little fisherman guy, I feel that he''s more the subject...', '2006-09-12 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827782, 394508, 55738, '<td valign="top">This feels underexposed.  I don''t mind a dark feel to it, but this is hard to make out what''s happening in the background.  I can see the one tree-twig there, but I''m curious about the ground around it.  Are those baby trees, burned out stumps?  Knowing that would change the meaning of the sign for me, and really change the feel of the photo depending on which it is.</td>', 'This feels underexposed.  I don''t mind a dark feel to it, but this is hard to make out what''s happening in the background.  I can see the one tree-twig there, but I''m curious about the ground around it.  Are those baby trees, burned out stumps?  Knowing that would change the meaning of the sign for me, and really change the feel of the photo depending on which it is.', '2006-09-12 13:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827786, 394073, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2006-09-12 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827787, 391472, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist nature of this shot.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the minimalist nature of this shot.  Well done!', '2006-09-12 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827788, 393808, 55738, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color and processing on the leaves.  Very well done!</td>', 'Gorgeous color and processing on the leaves.  Very well done!', '2006-09-12 13:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827793, 394398, 55738, '<td valign="top">A very dreamy shot.  I can''t tell if it''s post processing that gives it that quality, or just a long exposure and a little breeze.  Either way it''s really pretty.</td>', 'A very dreamy shot.  I can''t tell if it''s post processing that gives it that quality, or just a long exposure and a little breeze.  Either way it''s really pretty.', '2006-09-12 13:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827799, 392197, 55738, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the the train cars and passing lights add to this shot.  Maybe without those it would be stronger and more focused.  There''s just a little too much going on here.</td>', 'I''m not sure the the train cars and passing lights add to this shot.  Maybe without those it would be stronger and more focused.  There''s just a little too much going on here.', '2006-09-12 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827800, 393233, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice IR shot.  Makes it looks really pretty.</td>', 'Nice IR shot.  Makes it looks really pretty.', '2006-09-12 13:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827801, 394364, 55738, '<td valign="top">The red sky is a bit much for me in this shot.  I know it''s when the sun is going down/up, but it''s just a little too pervasive.</td>', 'The red sky is a bit much for me in this shot.  I know it''s when the sun is going down/up, but it''s just a little too pervasive.', '2006-09-12 13:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827802, 393861, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition.  I like it quite a lot.</td>', 'Nice simple composition.  I like it quite a lot.', '2006-09-12 13:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827804, 394388, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the crop you chose.  It makes this tree really something more intense than it would otherwise.  Excellent.</td>', 'I like the crop you chose.  It makes this tree really something more intense than it would otherwise.  Excellent.', '2006-09-12 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827807, 393787, 55738, '<td valign="top">Pretty processing.  (If you did any!)  :)</td>', 'Pretty processing.  (If you did any!)  :)', '2006-09-12 13:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827808, 394378, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Great tree!  I''d be afraid to get too close!  I love the repetition of pattern here.  It''s fun!</td>', 'Great shot!  Great tree!  I''d be afraid to get too close!  I love the repetition of pattern here.  It''s fun!', '2006-09-12 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827809, 394168, 55738, '<td valign="top">cute and excellent!</td>', 'cute and excellent!', '2006-09-12 13:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827812, 394312, 55738, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m wrong, and forgive if I am, but it looks like you erased things out of the sky or the horizon. It''s really distracting.  Maybe it was just really heavy fog, but I have my doubts about that.  It''s a pretty picture, I just wish it hadn''t been so heavily retouched.</td>', 'Maybe I''m wrong, and forgive if I am, but it looks like you erased things out of the sky or the horizon. It''s really distracting.  Maybe it was just really heavy fog, but I have my doubts about that.  It''s a pretty picture, I just wish it hadn''t been so heavily retouched.', '2006-09-12 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827814, 394088, 55738, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the inversion really helps this shot.  I''m curious as to what motivated you to choose it.</td>', 'I''m not sure the inversion really helps this shot.  I''m curious as to what motivated you to choose it.', '2006-09-12 13:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827815, 394438, 55738, '<td valign="top">Now, this is what I like to see.  A natural colored sky with character and dimension.  Excellent!</td>', 'Now, this is what I like to see.  A natural colored sky with character and dimension.  Excellent!', '2006-09-12 13:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827817, 393221, 55738, '<td valign="top">I really like the long exposure.  It makes for a great effect with the fog.</td>', 'I really like the long exposure.  It makes for a great effect with the fog.', '2006-09-12 13:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827823, 392125, 55738, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective.  It''s almost 3D</td>', 'Wonderful perspective.  It''s almost 3D', '2006-09-12 13:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827827, 394146, 55738, '<td valign="top">You chose a nice time of day to shoot this.  The texture came out quite nicely.</td>', 'You chose a nice time of day to shoot this.  The texture came out quite nicely.', '2006-09-12 13:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827831, 393905, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2006-09-12 13:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827834, 392613, 25742, '<td valign="top">beautiful colours. funky tree. good luck</td>', 'beautiful colours. funky tree. good luck', '2006-09-12 14:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827836, 394025, 55738, '<td valign="top">I wish there was just a bit more detail on the tree - I think.  But it''s a fantastic shot none the less.  It''s so powerful and moving.  Exactly the kind of shot I like to see!</td>', 'I wish there was just a bit more detail on the tree - I think.  But it''s a fantastic shot none the less.  It''s so powerful and moving.  Exactly the kind of shot I like to see!', '2006-09-12 14:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827837, 393573, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Excellent minimal shot.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Excellent minimal shot.', '2006-09-12 14:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827840, 394358, 25742, '<td valign="top">seems a little soft. tack-sharp images tend to do better here.</td>', 'seems a little soft. tack-sharp images tend to do better here.', '2006-09-12 14:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827841, 394506, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on this.  It really makes the shot!</td>', 'I like the processing on this.  It really makes the shot!', '2006-09-12 14:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827842, 391026, 55738, '<td valign="top">Wonderful processing, either that or a fantastically timed shutter.  Excellent shot here.</td>', 'Wonderful processing, either that or a fantastically timed shutter.  Excellent shot here.', '2006-09-12 14:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827850, 393227, 25742, '<td valign="top">cool. I like it, and I hope others do as well. I also hope you did the zoom "in camera" so to speak, so this wont be DQ''d after challenge.<br/>the title is the weak link, but for the life of me I can''t think of a better one. best of luck</td>', 'cool. I like it, and I hope others do as well. I also hope you did the zoom "in camera" so to speak, so this wont be DQ''d after challenge.the title is the weak link, but for the life of me I can''t think of a better one. best of luck', '2006-09-12 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827851, 392899, 55738, '<td valign="top">The lightening of the sky around the tree is just a bit too obvious.  It''s a good idea to do that, but it''s a little heavy handed.  Sorry...</td>', 'The lightening of the sky around the tree is just a bit too obvious.  It''s a good idea to do that, but it''s a little heavy handed.  Sorry...', '2006-09-12 14:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827853, 393487, 25742, '<td valign="top">cool photo, cool title. I like the "dirty" walls</td>', 'cool photo, cool title. I like the "dirty" walls', '2006-09-12 14:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827856, 392140, 25742, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve used the shape of the tree as a major element in this photo. seems a tad oversharpened though. good luck.</td>', 'I like how you''ve used the shape of the tree as a major element in this photo. seems a tad oversharpened though. good luck.', '2006-09-12 14:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827873, 394506, 25742, '<td valign="top">seems somehow absurd. cool photo</td>', 'seems somehow absurd. cool photo', '2006-09-12 14:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827876, 391026, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job, very surreal looking.  I really like the way the clouds look. 8</td>', 'Nice job, very surreal looking.  I really like the way the clouds look. 8', '2006-09-12 14:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827879, 394489, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very post-apocalyptic looking photograph.  What really stands out very nicely to me about this photo is the great highlights on the branches of the trees.  Strong composition as well with just the right amount of negative space.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very post-apocalyptic looking photograph.  What really stands out very nicely to me about this photo is the great highlights on the branches of the trees.  Strong composition as well with just the right amount of negative space.  Nicely done!', '2006-09-12 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827880, 392899, 25742, '<td valign="top">strange halo around the tree</td>', 'strange halo around the tree', '2006-09-12 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827884, 393905, 25742, '<td valign="top">funny, thank you for the smile this brought to my face</td>', 'funny, thank you for the smile this brought to my face', '2006-09-12 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827889, 392421, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very minimalistic photo as far as detail goes, which is what I think makes the mood of the photo all the more dramatic.  Great job!</td>', 'Very minimalistic photo as far as detail goes, which is what I think makes the mood of the photo all the more dramatic.  Great job!', '2006-09-12 14:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827895, 394210, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool color tones and composition.  I wish the steer was emphasized a little more he seems to get lost a little in the shadow, and I think he''s very important to this photo.</td>', 'Very cool color tones and composition.  I wish the steer was emphasized a little more he seems to get lost a little in the shadow, and I think he''s very important to this photo.', '2006-09-12 14:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827901, 391026, 25742, '<td valign="top">too much, or rather, too obvious post-processing. halo around the trunk and discolourations on the sea on both sides of the trunk. nice sky though and creamy sea. the textures of the trunk are also nice. but on the whole it''s too much for me. a more subtle approach might please me more, but in the end this is your photo so do as you please.</td>', 'too much, or rather, too obvious post-processing. halo around the trunk and discolourations on the sea on both sides of the trunk. nice sky though and creamy sea. the textures of the trunk are also nice. but on the whole it''s too much for me. a more subtle approach might please me more, but in the end this is your photo so do as you please.', '2006-09-12 14:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827906, 394347, 31443, '<td valign="top">Centered images don''t look so attractive, the focus is not certain either..</td>', 'Centered images don''t look so attractive, the focus is not certain either..', '2006-09-12 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827911, 394378, 31443, '<td valign="top">Always wondered about the name of this tree, certainly spectacular and you''ve got a very interesting angle here..</td>', 'Always wondered about the name of this tree, certainly spectacular and you''ve got a very interesting angle here..', '2006-09-12 14:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827917, 394533, 64568, '<td valign="top">nice , good idea ;-) like the stars also</td>', 'nice , good idea ;-) like the stars also', '2006-09-12 14:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827932, 394476, 42100, '<td valign="top">Incredible light, creates nice golden tones in the grass.  The composition gets a little busy with the tree placed directly in front of the rock formations.</td>', 'Incredible light, creates nice golden tones in the grass.  The composition gets a little busy with the tree placed directly in front of the rock formations.', '2006-09-12 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827933, 391918, 64568, '<td valign="top">nice shot, a bit too dark though imo, but I like the face ;-)</td>', 'nice shot, a bit too dark though imo, but I like the face ;-)', '2006-09-12 14:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827938, 393059, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, like it lots..</td>', 'Very nicely composed, like it lots..', '2006-09-12 14:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827939, 394218, 30441, '<td valign="top">I love the look of this one, the lighting and processing are very good. It seems as if the figure and the tree are hungering for a single ray of sunshine. What takes away from the image for me is the fact that the tree looks like a ficus and not a true bonsai tree (maybe it is some rare type of bonsai, but it sure looks like a ficus). Also the border on the right is a tad too cluttered. The more I look at it the more it seems like it is more about the guy than the tree. 6.</td>', 'I love the look of this one, the lighting and processing are very good. It seems as if the figure and the tree are hungering for a single ray of sunshine. What takes away from the image for me is the fact that the tree looks like a ficus and not a true bonsai tree (maybe it is some rare type of bonsai, but it sure looks like a ficus). Also the border on the right is a tad too cluttered. The more I look at it the more it seems like it is more about the guy than the tree. 6.', '2006-09-12 14:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827940, 394186, 64568, '<td valign="top">nice shot ;-) great colouring</td>', 'nice shot ;-) great colouring', '2006-09-12 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827944, 394168, 64568, '<td valign="top">big brother ;-) nice shot</td>', 'big brother ;-) nice shot', '2006-09-12 14:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827947, 394519, 30441, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure although at first it looks more like the sun than the moon. I would have liked to see the tree more isolated from the background on the left. 5</td>', 'Nice exposure although at first it looks more like the sun than the moon. I would have liked to see the tree more isolated from the background on the left. 5', '2006-09-12 14:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827950, 394205, 64568, '<td valign="top">my fav upto now-great colouring, love the composition, the framing of the tree is great - 9</td>', 'my fav upto now-great colouring, love the composition, the framing of the tree is great - 9', '2006-09-12 14:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827955, 393508, 64568, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the sky and the figure is a nice touch, 9</td>', 'great shot, love the sky and the figure is a nice touch, 9', '2006-09-12 14:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827958, 393968, 64568, '<td valign="top">great shot, nice shadow ;-)</td>', 'great shot, nice shadow ;-)', '2006-09-12 14:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827965, 394490, 64568, '<td valign="top">great shot, would look great at night- very creepy, ;-)</td>', 'great shot, would look great at night- very creepy, ;-)', '2006-09-12 14:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827966, 394476, 30441, '<td valign="top">The colors are so rich and beautiful, I want to like it more, but there''s something about the composition that is bothering me. I think it is the dark band in the middle. Well-matched to the challenge theme. 6</td>', 'The colors are so rich and beautiful, I want to like it more, but there''s something about the composition that is bothering me. I think it is the dark band in the middle. Well-matched to the challenge theme. 6', '2006-09-12 14:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827972, 394019, 30441, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I would have liked to see the tree itself more isolated from its surroundings. It''s a little dark, although that may be the look you were going for. 5</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I would have liked to see the tree itself more isolated from its surroundings. It''s a little dark, although that may be the look you were going for. 5', '2006-09-12 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827976, 394155, 64568, '<td valign="top">great shot.</td>', 'great shot.', '2006-09-12 14:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827977, 392142, 64568, '<td valign="top">love it ;-)</td>', 'love it ;-)', '2006-09-12 14:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827984, 394104, 30441, '<td valign="top">It certainly meets the challenge, but I think you could have played more with the composition; make it a little less traditional. Maybe looking up from the ground or something would make it more interesting. 4</td>', 'It certainly meets the challenge, but I think you could have played more with the composition; make it a little less traditional. Maybe looking up from the ground or something would make it more interesting. 4', '2006-09-12 14:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828000, 394399, 30441, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the monochromatic color. For some reason I am bugged by the fact that I can''t see the cow''s head / eyes, and that the tree is cut off a little on the right. And that little triangle in the lower right corner could be cropped out. 5</td>', 'I like the idea of the monochromatic color. For some reason I am bugged by the fact that I can''t see the cow''s head / eyes, and that the tree is cut off a little on the right. And that little triangle in the lower right corner could be cropped out. 5', '2006-09-12 14:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828013, 394210, 30441, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure in a difficult situation with all that light colored grass behind the tree. I wonder if the shot had been taken more at eye level with the longhorn would have allowed more of the tree to be included? Maybe a silhouette shot? 4</td>', 'Nice exposure in a difficult situation with all that light colored grass behind the tree. I wonder if the shot had been taken more at eye level with the longhorn would have allowed more of the tree to be included? Maybe a silhouette shot? 4', '2006-09-12 14:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828023, 394164, 30441, '<td valign="top">I like the line of the branches and the way the dead and dying needles are grouped in the center. The title could be better though. 4</td>', 'I like the line of the branches and the way the dead and dying needles are grouped in the center. The title could be better though. 4', '2006-09-12 14:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828024, 392042, 30441, '<td valign="top">Love the title! It''s too bad about the portion of that other tree crowding in on the right though. 5</td>', 'Love the title! It''s too bad about the portion of that other tree crowding in on the right though. 5', '2006-09-12 14:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828030, 394135, 30441, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge theme. I''m bothered by the washed out sky in the background, too bad there wasn''t a great sunset. Good DOF throughout. 5</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge theme. I''m bothered by the washed out sky in the background, too bad there wasn''t a great sunset. Good DOF throughout. 5', '2006-09-12 14:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828033, 393972, 30441, '<td valign="top">I think the overexposed background really detracts from the image. Love the title, and the idea you were going for. 3</td>', 'I think the overexposed background really detracts from the image. Love the title, and the idea you were going for. 3', '2006-09-12 14:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828038, 392714, 30441, '<td valign="top">I like the color and processing. It would have been even better with some black storm clouds in the background. 6</td>', 'I like the color and processing. It would have been even better with some black storm clouds in the background. 6', '2006-09-12 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828041, 392060, 30441, '<td valign="top">I would suggest cropping out the overexposed leaves on the bottom, and maybe trying a different angle to add something different. 4</td>', 'I would suggest cropping out the overexposed leaves on the bottom, and maybe trying a different angle to add something different. 4', '2006-09-12 15:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828043, 394522, 42100, '<td valign="top">Fascinating little tree, good composition with the reflection.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Fascinating little tree, good composition with the reflection.  Nicely done!', '2006-09-12 15:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828044, 394526, 30441, '<td valign="top">Very nice the way you took advantage of the situation. And I like that the composition emphasizes that the tree is the subject. Good compromise on the exposure to keep some detail in the trunk. 7</td>', 'Very nice the way you took advantage of the situation. And I like that the composition emphasizes that the tree is the subject. Good compromise on the exposure to keep some detail in the trunk. 7', '2006-09-12 15:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828048, 393227, 30441, '<td valign="top">Well done! You added some creativity to a more traditional composition and it workd beautifully for me. A more blue sky would have had more impact maybe. 8</td>', 'Well done! You added some creativity to a more traditional composition and it workd beautifully for me. A more blue sky would have had more impact maybe. 8', '2006-09-12 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828051, 392964, 42100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenic photo, the color and exposure is very nice.  The composition is also very good.  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful scenic photo, the color and exposure is very nice.  The composition is also very good.  Well done!', '2006-09-12 15:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828053, 393769, 30441, '<td valign="top">The sunset colors are nice, but the tree seems more incidental than central to the composition. 5</td>', 'The sunset colors are nice, but the tree seems more incidental than central to the composition. 5', '2006-09-12 15:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828060, 394095, 42100, '<td valign="top">An eerily silent photograph, but quite peacful and serene.  Nicely done!</td>', 'An eerily silent photograph, but quite peacful and serene.  Nicely done!', '2006-09-12 15:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828068, 394515, 42100, '<td valign="top">Quite eerie and a bit spooky, but masterfully executed.  The tones are very good.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Quite eerie and a bit spooky, but masterfully executed.  The tones are very good.  Nicely done!', '2006-09-12 15:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828083, 394411, 60779, '<td valign="top">really like the silhouette. the blackness of the ground and non-uniformity of the sky detract a little. On balance a good photo. 6</td>', 'really like the silhouette. the blackness of the ground and non-uniformity of the sky detract a little. On balance a good photo. 6', '2006-09-12 15:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828085, 394027, 60779, '<td valign="top">The processing  works in this pic. The foliage an stuff around the base of the trunk distract a little. 6</td>', 'The processing  works in this pic. The foliage an stuff around the base of the trunk distract a little. 6', '2006-09-12 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828090, 393064, 30441, '<td valign="top">The colors are lovely, but the composition is a little mundane. Maybe a lower angle would have allowed more the main tree to be prominent in the image. 4</td>', 'The colors are lovely, but the composition is a little mundane. Maybe a lower angle would have allowed more the main tree to be prominent in the image. 4', '2006-09-12 15:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828091, 391306, 60779, '<td valign="top">this shot is confusing to me. this could be a large branch that''s been dragged to the hillside, or it could be tree at a crazy angle. But the mood of the sky doesn''t help the story either. the non-sky part of the pic is flat, also not telling anything. 4</td>', 'this shot is confusing to me. this could be a large branch that''s been dragged to the hillside, or it could be tree at a crazy angle. But the mood of the sky doesn''t help the story either. the non-sky part of the pic is flat, also not telling anything. 4', '2006-09-12 15:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828093, 394410, 31443, '<td valign="top">Texture is really well displayed here, like this closeness...</td>', 'Texture is really well displayed here, like this closeness...', '2006-09-12 15:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828095, 394041, 30441, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is compelling and I like the soft focus effect. For some reason I want to see more of the tree, although I realize that probably wasn''t possible. 6</td>', 'I think the composition is compelling and I like the soft focus effect. For some reason I want to see more of the tree, although I realize that probably wasn''t possible. 6', '2006-09-12 15:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828096, 394172, 37320, '<td valign="top">This one makes nice colors, feels like it is taken on the edge of the world. but Ill bet it was a boring walk out to there.</td>', 'This one makes nice colors, feels like it is taken on the edge of the world. but Ill bet it was a boring walk out to there.', '2006-09-12 15:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828097, 393990, 31443, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2006-09-12 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828098, 394218, 64209, '<td valign="top">Original idea! Like it!</td>', 'Original idea! Like it!', '2006-09-12 15:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
