(2828166, 394440, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice location. I think, however, that the composition is lacking. Everything happens in the lower left corner of this image...but without meaning. I''d like to see the rest of the stoop, for example. I don''t understand what the casual stroller (checking his cell messages?) is adding to the image. The tree...well what can one say about dead center? There are lovely, interesting shadows of the tree on the wall and walk to the right...I just wonder what you could have done with them had you re-composed the shot.</td>', 'Nice location. I think, however, that the composition is lacking. Everything happens in the lower left corner of this image...but without meaning. I''d like to see the rest of the stoop, for example. I don''t understand what the casual stroller (checking his cell messages?) is adding to the image. The tree...well what can one say about dead center? There are lovely, interesting shadows of the tree on the wall and walk to the right...I just wonder what you could have done with them had you re-composed the shot.', '2006-09-12 15:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828183, 394262, 64209, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot</td>', 'Lovely shot', '2006-09-12 15:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828184, 393597, 16488, '<td valign="top">Pretty little blue spruce....but it needs it''s own space. The tree on the right is intrusive. The background somewhat distracting. Recomposing this shot would help show off your subject a bit better. Like the title, though.</td>', 'Pretty little blue spruce....but it needs it''s own space. The tree on the right is intrusive. The background somewhat distracting. Recomposing this shot would help show off your subject a bit better. Like the title, though.', '2006-09-12 15:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828190, 392126, 16488, '<td valign="top">Somehow, everytime I look at this I want to rotate 90 degrees to the right. I can see what you were going for, I just don''t think it works. Don''t much care for the heavy processing that muddies the leaves, either...sorry.</td>', 'Somehow, everytime I look at this I want to rotate 90 degrees to the right. I can see what you were going for, I just don''t think it works. Don''t much care for the heavy processing that muddies the leaves, either...sorry.', '2006-09-12 15:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828261, 394210, 60779, '<td valign="top">not a great quality (flat, softness)photo and stretches the challenge, IMO. but I do like the title and scene with the bull?</td>', 'not a great quality (flat, softness)photo and stretches the challenge, IMO. but I do like the title and scene with the bull?', '2006-09-12 16:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828267, 394374, 60779, '<td valign="top">like the processing, tree and rigth side of building. I don''t like seeing the rooftop on the left. I think the comp would be improved if the two vertical pieces were closer together (different POV?) but as it is they look lost with so much space between them.</td>', 'like the processing, tree and rigth side of building. I don''t like seeing the rooftop on the left. I think the comp would be improved if the two vertical pieces were closer together (different POV?) but as it is they look lost with so much space between them.', '2006-09-12 16:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828269, 394168, 61379, '<td valign="top">Great capture for a photograph. Alluring to me. You have my vote---7.</td>', 'Great capture for a photograph. Alluring to me. You have my vote---7.', '2006-09-12 16:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828278, 394262, 60779, '<td valign="top">6 - for me would have been 8 or 9 with two things. if you''d got the whole tree in the reflection and if the water had less stuff in it on the reflection. reflections are spectacular when smooth, ordinary when not (for me at least). nice shades of green and the leaves.</td>', '6 - for me would have been 8 or 9 with two things. if you''d got the whole tree in the reflection and if the water had less stuff in it on the reflection. reflections are spectacular when smooth, ordinary when not (for me at least). nice shades of green and the leaves.', '2006-09-12 16:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828279, 393657, 60779, '<td valign="top">like the lighting and greens you''ve achieved. your subject tree easily stands out from the bushes but not really well to the background.</td>', 'like the lighting and greens you''ve achieved. your subject tree easily stands out from the bushes but not really well to the background.', '2006-09-12 16:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828285, 394001, 60779, '<td valign="top">nice little tree but its really hurt by a lot of other elements. the blownout background, the small trunk in the background right, and the grass. definetly a different time of day would be better.</td>', 'nice little tree but its really hurt by a lot of other elements. the blownout background, the small trunk in the background right, and the grass. definetly a different time of day would be better.', '2006-09-12 16:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
