(2828376, 392197, 60779, '<td valign="top">you''ve tried to get too much here, despite the title. I''m having trouble believing the lights are from the train, when I can see lettering at right. the subject tree is lost among the elements except for the moon.</td>', 'you''ve tried to get too much here, despite the title. I''m having trouble believing the lights are from the train, when I can see lettering at right. the subject tree is lost among the elements except for the moon.', '2006-09-12 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
