(2828387, 393644, 60779, '<td valign="top">OK, you''ve got the tree, but the scene is very flat. the mid day lighting doesn''t help you, nor does the road or power lines. the tree is interesting, so a better time of day and/or different POV would help</td>', 'OK, you''ve got the tree, but the scene is very flat. the mid day lighting doesn''t help you, nor does the road or power lines. the tree is interesting, so a better time of day and/or different POV would help', '2006-09-12 17:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
