(2828609, 394041, 32345, '<td valign="top">I was waiting to find a good tree picture in an urban environement, Here it is! Very nice. Well done.</td>', 'I was waiting to find a good tree picture in an urban environement, Here it is! Very nice. Well done.', '2006-09-12 18:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828610, 394144, 61818, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened is the biggest problem with this photo.  Second to that is the mass of unappealing sky sominating the photo.  I do like the fence posts or whatever they are lining the ridge.  I think this might have worked quite a bit better if either shot closer to the tree or cropped so that the tree is muc larger and the sky is much less prominent.  Something is wrong with the colors here as well.  The composition itself, while as unoriginal as the other photos exactly like this one in the challenge, is technically correct so your eye is working for you in that regard.  Hope these comments are helpful.</td>', 'Oversharpened is the biggest problem with this photo.  Second to that is the mass of unappealing sky sominating the photo.  I do like the fence posts or whatever they are lining the ridge.  I think this might have worked quite a bit better if either shot closer to the tree or cropped so that the tree is muc larger and the sky is much less prominent.  Something is wrong with the colors here as well.  The composition itself, while as unoriginal as the other photos exactly like this one in the challenge, is technically correct so your eye is working for you in that regard.  Hope these comments are helpful.', '2006-09-12 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828611, 392613, 32345, '<td valign="top">Beautifull colors. This should finish in the top ten.</td>', 'Beautifull colors. This should finish in the top ten.', '2006-09-12 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828612, 394336, 32345, '<td valign="top">Different, don''t ask me why.... but I just love it. really well done.</td>', 'Different, don''t ask me why.... but I just love it. really well done.', '2006-09-12 18:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828616, 394232, 61818, '<td valign="top">I guess you either like selective desat or you don''t.  I''m probably in the minority as it doesn''t really float my boat.  That aside, this is a nice photo with an original take on the challenge theme.  The highlights on that hand, particularly on the thumb, are a bit bright but I do like the shadows created by the harsh lighting.  Very good focus and good choice of aperture here.  I''m sure this shot will do well, good job.</td>', 'I guess you either like selective desat or you don''t.  I''m probably in the minority as it doesn''t really float my boat.  That aside, this is a nice photo with an original take on the challenge theme.  The highlights on that hand, particularly on the thumb, are a bit bright but I do like the shadows created by the harsh lighting.  Very good focus and good choice of aperture here.  I''m sure this shot will do well, good job.', '2006-09-12 18:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828618, 391026, 45022, '<td valign="top">i love the sky!</td>', 'i love the sky!', '2006-09-12 18:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828621, 394322, 45022, '<td valign="top">sweet. Pretty model.</td>', 'sweet. Pretty model.', '2006-09-12 18:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828624, 394372, 61818, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting and I like the concept.  I think a bit of a tighter crop would have worked better here, particularly one that lopped off a bit of the growth at the bottom left to give even more attention to the highlighted piece of plant in the center (which the lighting has basically put a spotlight on).  Nice shot, good luck.</td>', 'Like the lighting and I like the concept.  I think a bit of a tighter crop would have worked better here, particularly one that lopped off a bit of the growth at the bottom left to give even more attention to the highlighted piece of plant in the center (which the lighting has basically put a spotlight on).  Nice shot, good luck.', '2006-09-12 18:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828630, 394492, 61818, '<td valign="top">USM halo around the tree is distracting.  Composition is nice, if rather unoriginal and uninspiring.  I do think the BW processing works in this shot, though a stronger touch of contrast might have brought out the fence rails a bit more which would really work well here.  Would also have darkened the shadow beneath the tree which wouldn''t be a bad thing either.  Good luck.</td>', 'USM halo around the tree is distracting.  Composition is nice, if rather unoriginal and uninspiring.  I do think the BW processing works in this shot, though a stronger touch of contrast might have brought out the fence rails a bit more which would really work well here.  Would also have darkened the shadow beneath the tree which wouldn''t be a bad thing either.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828639, 393962, 61818, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit rough here.  One massive tree with a little bit of interesting shoreline tucked away behind it.  Also looks like the tree is a bit out of focus.  The tree itself has some interesting detail, and I think this shot would have worked better if composed more or less along the line of the rule of thirds.  Tree off to the left, a nice clean view of some of the shoreline buildings leading off to the other edge, etc.  Good luck.</td>', 'Composition is a bit rough here.  One massive tree with a little bit of interesting shoreline tucked away behind it.  Also looks like the tree is a bit out of focus.  The tree itself has some interesting detail, and I think this shot would have worked better if composed more or less along the line of the rule of thirds.  Tree off to the left, a nice clean view of some of the shoreline buildings leading off to the other edge, etc.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828643, 394389, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Soft focus glow is alright but I''m not sure what purpose it serves here.  I think a tighter crop would also highlight the girl and her tree and reduce the amount of harsh whightness at the top of the sky.  Also the grass in front of her hands and the tree should have been dealt with so that the true subject of the shot is not obscured.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Soft focus glow is alright but I''m not sure what purpose it serves here.  I think a tighter crop would also highlight the girl and her tree and reduce the amount of harsh whightness at the top of the sky.  Also the grass in front of her hands and the tree should have been dealt with so that the true subject of the shot is not obscured.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828654, 391320, 61818, '<td valign="top">Photo appears tilted to the left.  I think in part that is due to the tilt of the tree and the slope of the ground, but also in part I think it is just tilted to the left.  Lot of your main subject has been cropped out of the photo and I''m not sure why.  This appears to have been taken with a wie angle lense given the amount of distortion that is visible, so it shouldn''t have taken more than a few steps backward to get everything in frame.  Normally I like the inclusion of things like fences in a shot as they provide some added interest, but the height of this broken down fence distracts from the tree and clutters what would have otherwise been a nice sunrise horizon.  Good luck.</td>', 'Photo appears tilted to the left.  I think in part that is due to the tilt of the tree and the slope of the ground, but also in part I think it is just tilted to the left.  Lot of your main subject has been cropped out of the photo and I''m not sure why.  This appears to have been taken with a wie angle lense given the amount of distortion that is visible, so it shouldn''t have taken more than a few steps backward to get everything in frame.  Normally I like the inclusion of things like fences in a shot as they provide some added interest, but the height of this broken down fence distracts from the tree and clutters what would have otherwise been a nice sunrise horizon.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828657, 393641, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I like the bits of wall and rock that break up the photo.  I do think this would have been about 4,000 times more appealing had you arrived earlier or stayed later to get the full effect of that sunrise/sunset that is going on in te background.  Good luck.</td>', 'Not bad.  I like the bits of wall and rock that break up the photo.  I do think this would have been about 4,000 times more appealing had you arrived earlier or stayed later to get the full effect of that sunrise/sunset that is going on in te background.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828660, 391007, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very unappealing lighting.  Your idea here isn''t a bad one, but the fact that the tree doesn''t follow the same angle as the blue and black stripes sort of makes it all fall apart.</td>', 'Very unappealing lighting.  Your idea here isn''t a bad one, but the fact that the tree doesn''t follow the same angle as the blue and black stripes sort of makes it all fall apart.', '2006-09-12 19:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828671, 393657, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of photo I would expect to see in a gardening book or magazine.  ''Here is what a zen garden pine looks like''.  Nothing more, nothing less.  A photo that serves one narrow, informational purpose.  In such a publication, a shot like this has both place and purpose.  Here in a photo challenge, I''m afraid it offers nothing at all and is probably going to score poorly as a result.  Lighting here is a bit rough with some very dark shadows and very bright higlights working against each other.  Bit too much etail left in the background which clutters up the image.  Might try a larger aperture next time and/or crop the photo tighter so that your main subject is more prominent.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is the sort of photo I would expect to see in a gardening book or magazine.  ''Here is what a zen garden pine looks like''.  Nothing more, nothing less.  A photo that serves one narrow, informational purpose.  In such a publication, a shot like this has both place and purpose.  Here in a photo challenge, I''m afraid it offers nothing at all and is probably going to score poorly as a result.  Lighting here is a bit rough with some very dark shadows and very bright higlights working against each other.  Bit too much etail left in the background which clutters up the image.  Might try a larger aperture next time and/or crop the photo tighter so that your main subject is more prominent.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828675, 393793, 61818, '<td valign="top">Too much sky, and some overexposed spots in the sky to boot.  Composition is ok, if uninspired.  Just not much going on here to pull me in.  Good luck.</td>', 'Too much sky, and some overexposed spots in the sky to boot.  Composition is ok, if uninspired.  Just not much going on here to pull me in.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828680, 391941, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and great exposure.  Think you might have been served well by walking away from a strict adherence to the rule of thirds amd pushing the tree over to the left edge so that it looks like it really is being threatened by the incoming storm/wall of clouds.  Nontheless, a nice photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice perspective and great exposure.  Think you might have been served well by walking away from a strict adherence to the rule of thirds amd pushing the tree over to the left edge so that it looks like it really is being threatened by the incoming storm/wall of clouds.  Nontheless, a nice photo.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828687, 394262, 61818, '<td valign="top">The overwhelming amount of white-out sky works against this otherwise colorful and appealing subject.  This would have worked much better cropped closer to the tree, allowing just enough room beneath it for the part of its reflection that is completely undisturbed.  Good luck.</td>', 'The overwhelming amount of white-out sky works against this otherwise colorful and appealing subject.  This would have worked much better cropped closer to the tree, allowing just enough room beneath it for the part of its reflection that is completely undisturbed.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828726, 394164, 23484, '<td valign="top">This just seems kind of plain.</td>', 'This just seems kind of plain.', '2006-09-12 19:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828732, 392964, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great picture.7</td>', 'Great picture.7', '2006-09-12 19:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828738, 394145, 61818, '<td valign="top">The sort of shot that demands you are on site for sunrise or sunset.  Bad time of day here with harsh light washing out the colors and destroying any chance for interesting shadows.</td>', 'The sort of shot that demands you are on site for sunrise or sunset.  Bad time of day here with harsh light washing out the colors and destroying any chance for interesting shadows.', '2006-09-12 19:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828739, 394027, 61818, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting and a bad angle work against this shot.  Might have been better shot from ground level and from a direction that kept those long grass blades out of the way.  Good luck.</td>', 'Harsh lighting and a bad angle work against this shot.  Might have been better shot from ground level and from a direction that kept those long grass blades out of the way.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828743, 394205, 61818, '<td valign="top">Framing would have been even niceer had the shot been taken from an angle that centered the tree between the posts.  Nice exposure, nice colors.  Composition is maybe a bit less than desirable.</td>', 'Framing would have been even niceer had the shot been taken from an angle that centered the tree between the posts.  Nice exposure, nice colors.  Composition is maybe a bit less than desirable.', '2006-09-12 19:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828745, 393769, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky.</td>', 'Very nice sky.', '2006-09-12 19:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828746, 393952, 63384, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why its blue.. but i like it</td>', 'I don''t know why its blue.. but i like it', '2006-09-12 19:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828747, 394093, 61818, '<td valign="top">Is this intentional overexposure, a mistake, or some other effect?  Not sure, but it does not work well.</td>', 'Is this intentional overexposure, a mistake, or some other effect?  Not sure, but it does not work well.', '2006-09-12 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828751, 394438, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The sky is beautiful.</td>', 'Nice shot. The sky is beautiful.', '2006-09-12 19:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828758, 391026, 61818, '<td valign="top">Tuborg?  Another nice piece of eye candy.  The abuse of dodge and burn makes this look completely computer generated though, and for this shot I don''t think it was the way to go.  Of course it will score well, I have no doubt.  I still wonder what exactly nature had offered to my eyes here before photoshop smashed it out of existence.</td>', 'Tuborg?  Another nice piece of eye candy.  The abuse of dodge and burn makes this look completely computer generated though, and for this shot I don''t think it was the way to go.  Of course it will score well, I have no doubt.  I still wonder what exactly nature had offered to my eyes here before photoshop smashed it out of existence.', '2006-09-12 19:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828761, 394215, 61818, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Think in this particular instance, fan though I am of BW photos, this would have worked better in color.  Very nice overall.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Think in this particular instance, fan though I am of BW photos, this would have worked better in color.  Very nice overall.', '2006-09-12 19:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828763, 394269, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like the softness of this picture.</td>', 'I really like the softness of this picture.', '2006-09-12 19:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828766, 394213, 23484, '<td valign="top">Super shot.  I think the simplicity makes it what it is. The color is great. 10</td>', 'Super shot.  I think the simplicity makes it what it is. The color is great. 10', '2006-09-12 19:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828767, 392473, 61818, '<td valign="top">Hmm, fisheye. Sort of cool how the tree is vertical, but then again sort of gimmicky.  Do like how you handled the sun here and very good exposure, keeping the tree from goign completely silhouette.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hmm, fisheye. Sort of cool how the tree is vertical, but then again sort of gimmicky.  Do like how you handled the sun here and very good exposure, keeping the tree from goign completely silhouette.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 19:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828769, 394330, 61818, '<td valign="top">Hey, your horizon isn''t straight.  Heheheh.  Nice colors, not sure if the angle adds anything to the shot.  Might be more dramatic/appealing were the tree lined up on the corner to corner diagonal axis here.  But, it certainly gets a nod for creativity.</td>', 'Hey, your horizon isn''t straight.  Heheheh.  Nice colors, not sure if the angle adds anything to the shot.  Might be more dramatic/appealing were the tree lined up on the corner to corner diagonal axis here.  But, it certainly gets a nod for creativity.', '2006-09-12 19:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828774, 394398, 23484, '<td valign="top">The softness really makes this shot. Just a tad too much saturation. 8</td>', 'The softness really makes this shot. Just a tad too much saturation. 8', '2006-09-12 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828778, 393233, 61818, '<td valign="top">Good to know there will be some trees to look at in Hell.  Boring composition here and the IR thing has reached gimmick status for sure.  If there''s more to IR than just presenting radical colors, I would love to see it.  I wish there were more merits to this photo to speak to.  As it is it is one tree, dead center, nothing else of interest besides the colored sky.  Hopefully you find the comment helpful.  It''s not meant to be harsh, but IR should not be the sole point of the photograph.  It should enhance an already interesting shot.  Good luck, I''m sure it will score well.</td>', 'Good to know there will be some trees to look at in Hell.  Boring composition here and the IR thing has reached gimmick status for sure.  If there''s more to IR than just presenting radical colors, I would love to see it.  I wish there were more merits to this photo to speak to.  As it is it is one tree, dead center, nothing else of interest besides the colored sky.  Hopefully you find the comment helpful.  It''s not meant to be harsh, but IR should not be the sole point of the photograph.  It should enhance an already interesting shot.  Good luck, I''m sure it will score well.', '2006-09-12 20:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828780, 393018, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows.  Good choice for BW processing.  Like the composition and the subject itself offers a lot of interesting shapes to move the eye around.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'Nice shadows.  Good choice for BW processing.  Like the composition and the subject itself offers a lot of interesting shapes to move the eye around.  Good work and good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828785, 394247, 61818, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Love the darkness this photo presents both in theme and tonality.  Good composition, and very original.  Hope it scores well.</td>', 'Excellent.  Love the darkness this photo presents both in theme and tonality.  Good composition, and very original.  Hope it scores well.', '2006-09-12 20:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828788, 393227, 23484, '<td valign="top">The colors are really good. I think this would have been a great shot without the filter. This is hard to look at.</td>', 'The colors are really good. I think this would have been a great shot without the filter. This is hard to look at.', '2006-09-12 20:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828792, 394063, 61818, '<td valign="top">This tree offered you the absolute perfect opportunity to frame that windmill between those curved branches.  Looks like you just had to take two steps to the right to do it.  Close your eyes and picture me kicking you for missing the chance.  Other than that, nice colors.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  That field probably glows at sunset.  Tree itself has an interesting shape, but not a whole lot else going on.  Close your eyes, here it comes again...</td>', 'This tree offered you the absolute perfect opportunity to frame that windmill between those curved branches.  Looks like you just had to take two steps to the right to do it.  Close your eyes and picture me kicking you for missing the chance.  Other than that, nice colors.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  That field probably glows at sunset.  Tree itself has an interesting shape, but not a whole lot else going on.  Close your eyes, here it comes again...', '2006-09-12 20:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828793, 394373, 61818, '<td valign="top">Begging for dnmc votes by calling it a bush?  Is it a bush?  Is a bush a tree?  Oh, the philosophical quandries of voting on dpc.</td>', 'Begging for dnmc votes by calling it a bush?  Is it a bush?  Is a bush a tree?  Oh, the philosophical quandries of voting on dpc.', '2006-09-12 20:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828798, 394347, 23484, '<td valign="top">The foreground seems a little too bright. Almost partially washed out.</td>', 'The foreground seems a little too bright. Almost partially washed out.', '2006-09-12 20:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828799, 394168, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  Something is amiss here though.  I cant tell if things are slightly out of focus on the tree or if the colors have been messed with in a bad way, but something is not very appealing.</td>', 'Very creative!  Something is amiss here though.  I cant tell if things are slightly out of focus on the tree or if the colors have been messed with in a bad way, but something is not very appealing.', '2006-09-12 20:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828803, 394442, 61818, '<td valign="top">Backlighting is very nice here and your exposure is dead on.  The title is pretty lame and ruins an otherwise nice mood this photo creates in the mind.  Unique composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'Backlighting is very nice here and your exposure is dead on.  The title is pretty lame and ruins an otherwise nice mood this photo creates in the mind.  Unique composition.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828805, 394144, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I like the downward slope, but I think there is a little too much saturation.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I like the downward slope, but I think there is a little too much saturation.', '2006-09-12 20:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828806, 391071, 61818, '<td valign="top">Overwhelming amount of white background does nothing to enhance this photo, it just minimizes your subject for no good reason.  Subject itself is off kilter.  Might also work better cropped much tighter so the tree fills the frame and cropped so that the tree''s pot is not visible (or much less prominent).  Good luck.</td>', 'Overwhelming amount of white background does nothing to enhance this photo, it just minimizes your subject for no good reason.  Subject itself is off kilter.  Might also work better cropped much tighter so the tree fills the frame and cropped so that the tree''s pot is not visible (or much less prominent).  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828809, 394172, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job. This is a really nice simple shot.  I like the downward slope also.</td>', 'Nice job. This is a really nice simple shot.  I like the downward slope also.', '2006-09-12 20:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828810, 391770, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and nice capture of the water droplets.  Composition is very nice.  Looks like some flash highlights on the most prominent leaf which are a bit distracting, but otherwise a fine entry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice lighting and nice capture of the water droplets.  Composition is very nice.  Looks like some flash highlights on the most prominent leaf which are a bit distracting, but otherwise a fine entry.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828812, 393059, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice interesting foreground here.  Good lighting as well, kudos to you for waiting till the golden hour.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice interesting foreground here.  Good lighting as well, kudos to you for waiting till the golden hour.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828814, 393825, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 9</td>', 'Very nice. 9', '2006-09-12 20:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828815, 394510, 44882, '<td valign="top">It is all to overexposed in my eyes.</td>', 'It is all to overexposed in my eyes.', '2006-09-12 20:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828816, 394211, 61818, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Composition could use work and the lighting is not the best.  Would look a lot better later in the day when the light is softer.  Might also be more appealing cropped horizontally, assuming what''s out of frame on the right is just more of the line of rubble.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Composition could use work and the lighting is not the best.  Would look a lot better later in the day when the light is softer.  Might also be more appealing cropped horizontally, assuming what''s out of frame on the right is just more of the line of rubble.  Good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828822, 394412, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and a great exposure.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Nicely composed and a great exposure.  Hope it does well.', '2006-09-12 20:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828827, 392142, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice emotive shot.  Would work better cropped with the subject more off to the side.    Lighting is nice, with good play between smoke and shadows.  However, your cheesy title really ruins the mood here.  Otherwise, nice shot and good luck.</td>', 'Nice emotive shot.  Would work better cropped with the subject more off to the side.    Lighting is nice, with good play between smoke and shadows.  However, your cheesy title really ruins the mood here.  Otherwise, nice shot and good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828836, 394213, 17507, '<td valign="top">this looks very California. Nice shot.</td>', 'this looks very California. Nice shot.', '2006-09-12 20:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2828841, 391249, 17507, '<td valign="top">The sky is great and I like the composition. It looks like this has been processed carefully. I wonder what would have happened if you''d walked forward somewhat... I wish the trunk of the tree were visible!</td>', 'The sky is great and I like the composition. It looks like this has been processed carefully. I wonder what would have happened if you''d walked forward somewhat... I wish the trunk of the tree were visible!', '2006-09-12 20:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
