(2828854, 394014, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Think it might be slightly more appealing if cropped so the tree and its reflection are vertically centered in the composition.  Little more sky, little less lake.  You lose the tip of the reflection which is broken up anyway.  Love the processing here, please do post details on how you acheived this.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'Very nice.  Think it might be slightly more appealing if cropped so the tree and its reflection are vertically centered in the composition.  Little more sky, little less lake.  You lose the tip of the reflection which is broken up anyway.  Love the processing here, please do post details on how you acheived this.  Good work and good luck.', '2006-09-12 20:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
