(2828895, 394427, 17507, '<td valign="top">I see neither you nor your shadow in this photograph.<br/> <br/>The placement of the tree seems a bit awkward. With such a simple composition, the rule of thirds is a useful guideline. I think you should have placed the tree somewhat farther to the left.<br/> <br/>The tree itself looks somewhat washed out. A levels adjustment or some burning might have helped.</td>', 'I see neither you nor your shadow in this photograph. The placement of the tree seems a bit awkward. With such a simple composition, the rule of thirds is a useful guideline. I think you should have placed the tree somewhat farther to the left. The tree itself looks somewhat washed out. A levels adjustment or some burning might have helped.', '2006-09-12 20:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
