(2829169, 394222, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ah Capri!  I visited there in 1995.  What a cool place!  I''d love to see those sights again someday.  I can''t remember how to spell the name of the rock formation... the Faragioli, or some such thing.  Anyhow, nice job!</td>', 'Ah Capri!  I visited there in 1995.  What a cool place!  I''d love to see those sights again someday.  I can''t remember how to spell the name of the rock formation... the Faragioli, or some such thing.  Anyhow, nice job!', '2006-09-12 21:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2829181, 394322, 3102, '<td valign="top">Further proof that a hot, naked girl can be an asset to any subject matter! :)  I would not be surprised to see this get a ribbon.  Excellent sharpness and skin -- er bark -- tones.  I wouldn''t mind getting involved in an act of photosynthesis with this subject!</td>', 'Further proof that a hot, naked girl can be an asset to any subject matter! :)  I would not be surprised to see this get a ribbon.  Excellent sharpness and skin -- er bark -- tones.  I wouldn''t mind getting involved in an act of photosynthesis with this subject!', '2006-09-12 22:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
