(2829198, 393952, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can only think of one word about the editing here:  Why??<br/> <br/>I don''t see what the selective desaturation, and the unnatural coloration of the tree add to the shot.  Sorry to be negative here... it''s just that because we have tools to do these sorts of things, doesn''t necessarily mean we should use them.</td>', 'I can only think of one word about the editing here:  Why?? I don''t see what the selective desaturation, and the unnatural coloration of the tree add to the shot.  Sorry to be negative here... it''s just that because we have tools to do these sorts of things, doesn''t necessarily mean we should use them.', '2006-09-12 22:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2829250, 394492, 30441, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this one. I''d love to see this one in color since I suspect that I would like it a little better. But this is a great match to the challenge as is. 7</td>', 'I really like the composition on this one. I''d love to see this one in color since I suspect that I would like it a little better. But this is a great match to the challenge as is. 7', '2006-09-12 22:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
