(2829898, 392899, 57936, '<td valign="top">OK, rule of thirds be damned, this is a cool image. BUT you have a whole bunch-o-sky that is not doin'' jack for it! I would crop it to a pano! Also, I am not sure about the "spotlight" thing on the tree. Looks like it was dodged a bit too much. For this challenge it is ok, but I don''t really like it. For general use of the image, I would use USM on the whole range and present it as a pano. But that is just me...</td>', 'OK, rule of thirds be damned, this is a cool image. BUT you have a whole bunch-o-sky that is not doin'' jack for it! I would crop it to a pano! Also, I am not sure about the "spotlight" thing on the tree. Looks like it was dodged a bit too much. For this challenge it is ok, but I don''t really like it. For general use of the image, I would use USM on the whole range and present it as a pano. But that is just me...', '2006-09-13 01:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
