(2830126, 394155, 64826, '<td valign="top">Great natural outline</td>', 'Great natural outline', '2006-09-13 02:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830207, 394317, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here and thought it was actually a living person.  Your picture has a smalltown persona and it makes me want to see what else is going on.  The moon is a nice touch.<br/> <br/>The first thing that captures my attention here is the postman - your main subject should be the tree.  Perhaps another angle (if possible) would help.  The light on the postman is a bit overposed and it stands out against a black background.  The green in the house in background also stands out; I would reduce your F-stop as much as you can to blur the background.  Since this was advanced editing you could do that in PS or another  program.</td>', 'I like the idea here and thought it was actually a living person.  Your picture has a smalltown persona and it makes me want to see what else is going on.  The moon is a nice touch. The first thing that captures my attention here is the postman - your main subject should be the tree.  Perhaps another angle (if possible) would help.  The light on the postman is a bit overposed and it stands out against a black background.  The green in the house in background also stands out; I would reduce your F-stop as much as you can to blur the background.  Since this was advanced editing you could do that in PS or another  program.', '2006-09-13 02:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830218, 393808, 65516, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sugar maple</td>', 'Beautiful sugar maple', '2006-09-13 02:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
