(2830322, 393783, 43281, '<td valign="top">not sure that i like the background,but it seems to work to bring out the tree</td>', 'not sure that i like the background,but it seems to work to bring out the tree', '2006-09-13 03:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830340, 394225, 16004, '<td valign="top">i love the tree itself, i think it''s wonderful tolkien-esque with all the spindly branches and the super stumpy trunk. i also really like how the tree is solidly branching out beyond the frame, filling out the top corners so well. <br/> <br/>however, i don''t think that the selective desat does your photo any favours whatsoever; the b&amp;w tree works, but the odd and unattractive mustardy green grass at the bottom just makes it look weird, and not in a particularly funky stylistic way.  if you editted the greens to be less satuated and lighter so more white and pale, i think the shot would feel more balanced and dynamic.  composition + technical 2/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1/2, ooooh factor 2/4 = 6</td>', 'i love the tree itself, i think it''s wonderful tolkien-esque with all the spindly branches and the super stumpy trunk. i also really like how the tree is solidly branching out beyond the frame, filling out the top corners so well.  however, i don''t think that the selective desat does your photo any favours whatsoever; the b&w tree works, but the odd and unattractive mustardy green grass at the bottom just makes it look weird, and not in a particularly funky stylistic way.  if you editted the greens to be less satuated and lighter so more white and pale, i think the shot would feel more balanced and dynamic.  composition + technical 2/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1/2, ooooh factor 2/4 = 6', '2006-09-13 03:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830345, 394392, 43281, '<td valign="top">I gree that to find a single tree is HARD. Not keen on the sepia clour here,for my two bobs worth black and white would have been better.</td>', 'I gree that to find a single tree is HARD. Not keen on the sepia clour here,for my two bobs worth black and white would have been better.', '2006-09-13 03:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
