(2830740, 394171, 31403, '<td valign="top">if this were a visual scavenger hunt this would definately meet the challenge - but in a photography contest this looks like a quick snapshot trying to compete with  - <br/> <br/>So if this is your tree, show me from a different angle than I would see it normally, different lighting, so me the irony of a tree juxtaposed against all that commercialism, something that feels creative<br/> <br/>Or use your creativity in the post processing - dodge and burn, selectively desat everything but the green in the tree, use the processing to show me what you found interesting about this particular tree - just slapping a sepia on it does nothing to communicate what you felt about this scene.<br/> <br/>One of my more direct comments - sorry my diplomatic button broke on this one - but I wanted to let you know why I''m giving this a low score in hopes that it helps you in future challenges</td>', 'if this were a visual scavenger hunt this would definately meet the challenge - but in a photography contest this looks like a quick snapshot trying to compete with  -  So if this is your tree, show me from a different angle than I would see it normally, different lighting, so me the irony of a tree juxtaposed against all that commercialism, something that feels creative Or use your creativity in the post processing - dodge and burn, selectively desat everything but the green in the tree, use the processing to show me what you found interesting about this particular tree - just slapping a sepia on it does nothing to communicate what you felt about this scene. One of my more direct comments - sorry my diplomatic button broke on this one - but I wanted to let you know why I''m giving this a low score in hopes that it helps you in future challenges', '2006-09-13 08:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
