(2830794, 394247, 38234, '<td valign="top">beautifully done - kinda has a biblical feel to it with that person dressed as they are!  gorgeous light!</td>', 'beautifully done - kinda has a biblical feel to it with that person dressed as they are!  gorgeous light!', '2006-09-13 09:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830810, 394225, 35602, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous contrasts.</td>', 'Gorgeous contrasts.', '2006-09-13 09:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830812, 394079, 35602, '<td valign="top">It seems oversharpened, leaving a lot of white pixel specs throughout the image.</td>', 'It seems oversharpened, leaving a lot of white pixel specs throughout the image.', '2006-09-13 09:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830817, 394503, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think this was taken at too high an aperture.  It appears you may have been compensating a dark image by trying to lighten it.  Left signature artifacts.  Compensating exposure by a few stops down, and using a tripod for slower shutter speed would have given a cleaner image.</td>', 'I think this was taken at too high an aperture.  It appears you may have been compensating a dark image by trying to lighten it.  Left signature artifacts.  Compensating exposure by a few stops down, and using a tripod for slower shutter speed would have given a cleaner image.', '2006-09-13 09:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830820, 393059, 35602, '<td valign="top">Lovely leading lines.  Foreground offers a nice impact for the tree.</td>', 'Lovely leading lines.  Foreground offers a nice impact for the tree.', '2006-09-13 09:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830823, 391059, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very soft, but not soft enough to give it a nice fantasy look.  If you tried to adjust focus to make clearer, that takes away the soft effect.</td>', 'Very soft, but not soft enough to give it a nice fantasy look.  If you tried to adjust focus to make clearer, that takes away the soft effect.', '2006-09-13 09:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830828, 394336, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think I might have liked it better if the distant tree were in focus.  Obviously you meant to do this, and that is the reason why you left the foreground branches in, but it doesn''t work for my compositional aesthetics.  Anyway, the colors surrounding the tree look very nice, and there are some defined lines, but the blur just detracts from the image.</td>', 'I think I might have liked it better if the distant tree were in focus.  Obviously you meant to do this, and that is the reason why you left the foreground branches in, but it doesn''t work for my compositional aesthetics.  Anyway, the colors surrounding the tree look very nice, and there are some defined lines, but the blur just detracts from the image.', '2006-09-13 09:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830847, 394489, 27524, '<td valign="top">Simple but real nice effect on the sky. Maybe could capture with that thing in water on right side.</td>', 'Simple but real nice effect on the sky. Maybe could capture with that thing in water on right side.', '2006-09-13 09:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830852, 394041, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its very nice approach...lovely curves and guy on stears add some extra interest. Blured effect works well too.</td>', 'Its very nice approach...lovely curves and guy on stears add some extra interest. Blured effect works well too.', '2006-09-13 09:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830860, 394520, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its nice and dramatic colors. I like the contrast between tree and dark background just focus feels a little soft.</td>', 'Its nice and dramatic colors. I like the contrast between tree and dark background just focus feels a little soft.', '2006-09-13 09:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830865, 394492, 27524, '<td valign="top">Real nice duo...great composition but something feels wrong with three itself. Not enogh focus or oversharpended.</td>', 'Real nice duo...great composition but something feels wrong with three itself. Not enogh focus or oversharpended.', '2006-09-13 09:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830875, 393487, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice and artistic...great textures on the walls.</td>', 'Nice and artistic...great textures on the walls.', '2006-09-13 09:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830909, 393432, 27524, '<td valign="top">Lovely...the water and fog makes it rich. Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Lovely...the water and fog makes it rich. Beautiful composition.', '2006-09-13 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830915, 394458, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;w...like your composition with fence.</td>', 'Nice b&w...like your composition with fence.', '2006-09-13 10:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830919, 391320, 27524, '<td valign="top">Lovley...great composition with silhuettes.</td>', 'Lovley...great composition with silhuettes.', '2006-09-13 10:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830931, 394508, 27524, '<td valign="top">Thats clearly out of the box... I like it but maybe would do few things different. Would prefer composition when the tree is in more on side of sign then behind. Also would crop off the part of fence post on left side. Anyway nice to see creative photo.</td>', 'Thats clearly out of the box... I like it but maybe would do few things different. Would prefer composition when the tree is in more on side of sign then behind. Also would crop off the part of fence post on left side. Anyway nice to see creative photo.', '2006-09-13 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830937, 393018, 27524, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b&amp;w... really love the light and shade on tree.</td>', 'Beautiful b&w... really love the light and shade on tree.', '2006-09-13 10:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830946, 394210, 27524, '<td valign="top">Cute...looks very natural with cow and that broken branches.</td>', 'Cute...looks very natural with cow and that broken branches.', '2006-09-13 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830951, 394330, 45360, '<td valign="top">Love this image, very fresh, great sky, framing and angle.<br/>Bumping this up to a 9 (and a Fav)...<br/>Great shot, should be well into the top five I feel.<br/>:o)</td>', 'Love this image, very fresh, great sky, framing and angle.Bumping this up to a 9 (and a Fav)...Great shot, should be well into the top five I feel.:o)', '2006-09-13 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
