(2830975, 394372, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice but too much negative space. It does serve to focus on the subject of the image, but it is just too black!</td>', 'Nice but too much negative space. It does serve to focus on the subject of the image, but it is just too black!', '2006-09-13 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
