(2830980, 392897, 57936, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! The only nit-pick is the tree looks a bit soft on my monitor, but that is not effecting the score because this is a wonderful shot and it is most likely from resizing if it isn''t just my monitor (or my morning blurry eyes!!! MORE COFFEE!!!! LOL) a 10!</td>', 'Wonderful! The only nit-pick is the tree looks a bit soft on my monitor, but that is not effecting the score because this is a wonderful shot and it is most likely from resizing if it isn''t just my monitor (or my morning blurry eyes!!! MORE COFFEE!!!! LOL) a 10!', '2006-09-13 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830986, 393712, 57936, '<td valign="top">I would like it better with the tree offset to the right, a bit more detail in the forground, and less flat grey cloud above. But a very pretty shot.</td>', 'I would like it better with the tree offset to the right, a bit more detail in the forground, and less flat grey cloud above. But a very pretty shot.', '2006-09-13 10:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830991, 394513, 57936, '<td valign="top">Great composition and the title is very apt! The tree is a bit blurry on the right side and looks a bit over sharppened (or you used too much dodge on it). There are also major JPEG artifacts in the sky. The clouds are primo and the stark beauty of the scene sublime! :)</td>', 'Great composition and the title is very apt! The tree is a bit blurry on the right side and looks a bit over sharppened (or you used too much dodge on it). There are also major JPEG artifacts in the sky. The clouds are primo and the stark beauty of the scene sublime! :)', '2006-09-13 10:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831003, 393806, 57936, '<td valign="top">The tree is too dark.</td>', 'The tree is too dark.', '2006-09-13 10:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831005, 393635, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, but I would like it better if more of the tree were in the frame.</td>', 'Nice abstract, but I would like it better if more of the tree were in the frame.', '2006-09-13 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831008, 394336, 57936, '<td valign="top">Hard to say which single tree is the subject here. The branch in focus or the blurry one is the field...</td>', 'Hard to say which single tree is the subject here. The branch in focus or the blurry one is the field...', '2006-09-13 10:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831009, 393599, 57936, '<td valign="top">I am hard pressed to call the tree the subject of this image. Great ship though!!!</td>', 'I am hard pressed to call the tree the subject of this image. Great ship though!!!', '2006-09-13 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831016, 394387, 57936, '<td valign="top">Looks like you used a bit too much USM. The halos around the branches are a distraction. I would also prefer to have the whole tree in the shot.</td>', 'Looks like you used a bit too much USM. The halos around the branches are a distraction. I would also prefer to have the whole tree in the shot.', '2006-09-13 10:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831019, 394533, 57936, '<td valign="top">I have never heard these referred to as trees. Must be some regional slang or something. Also, the shot is too noisy and the focus on the "tree" is a bit soft.</td>', 'I have never heard these referred to as trees. Must be some regional slang or something. Also, the shot is too noisy and the focus on the "tree" is a bit soft.', '2006-09-13 10:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831020, 394001, 57936, '<td valign="top">A bit soft and lacking in contrast to stand out from the bright green background.</td>', 'A bit soft and lacking in contrast to stand out from the bright green background.', '2006-09-13 10:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831024, 394392, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice, but just a tad too dark. As for the title, are they all dating or married? LOL! :)</td>', 'Nice, but just a tad too dark. As for the title, are they all dating or married? LOL! :)', '2006-09-13 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831133, 394312, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling to this one.  If you ever watched the movie Land Before Time, this image reminds me of when the earth began to split and divided the dinos from their herds.  Very nice mood.</td>', 'Nice feeling to this one.  If you ever watched the movie Land Before Time, this image reminds me of when the earth began to split and divided the dinos from their herds.  Very nice mood.', '2006-09-13 11:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831140, 393584, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic style.  Very smooth and contrasty.</td>', 'Nice graphic style.  Very smooth and contrasty.', '2006-09-13 11:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831184, 391249, 65518, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but I should like it more when I saw more of the tree :)</td>', 'Nice colours, but I should like it more when I saw more of the tree :)', '2006-09-13 11:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831301, 394003, 60779, '<td valign="top">I see 3 dominant features: tree, rock and white space. To me, the white dominates and its not appealing to look at. The composition of the rock and tree don''t seem to work togehter.</td>', 'I see 3 dominant features: tree, rock and white space. To me, the white dominates and its not appealing to look at. The composition of the rock and tree don''t seem to work togehter.', '2006-09-13 11:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831310, 394181, 60779, '<td valign="top">for me the DOF, POV, green and blue colors work well. I like the bits of tall grass standing out. great picture for a mediocre scene. 7</td>', 'for me the DOF, POV, green and blue colors work well. I like the bits of tall grass standing out. great picture for a mediocre scene. 7', '2006-09-13 11:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831316, 392042, 60779, '<td valign="top">two things detract from a very high score...the tree on the right and the ''muddy'' or ''flat'' b&amp;w...6</td>', 'two things detract from a very high score...the tree on the right and the ''muddy'' or ''flat'' b&w...6', '2006-09-13 11:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831325, 394384, 60779, '<td valign="top">the leading branch looks oversharpened. I see jagged edges on my LCD. This looks more like a jumbled pile of branches than a tree that''s fallen. I like your score and OOF background.</td>', 'the leading branch looks oversharpened. I see jagged edges on my LCD. This looks more like a jumbled pile of branches than a tree that''s fallen. I like your score and OOF background.', '2006-09-13 11:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831347, 394079, 60779, '<td valign="top">I think a different time of day might have given you more helpful light. the bark and dying leaves don''t look great with the bright light. I''d alos like to see this whole scene in focus. the outside of the picture looks OOF at points.</td>', 'I think a different time of day might have given you more helpful light. the bark and dying leaves don''t look great with the bright light. I''d alos like to see this whole scene in focus. the outside of the picture looks OOF at points.', '2006-09-13 11:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831368, 394009, 60779, '<td valign="top">composition: unfortunately, it''s just a tree in a carpar with some buildings in the background. it''s boring to look at. everything around the tree takes away from the picture. <br/>Lighting: the sky isn''t adding to the photo and it''s hard to tell what the lights in the tree are.</td>', 'composition: unfortunately, it''s just a tree in a carpar with some buildings in the background. it''s boring to look at. everything around the tree takes away from the picture. Lighting: the sky isn''t adding to the photo and it''s hard to tell what the lights in the tree are.', '2006-09-13 11:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831373, 393682, 60779, '<td valign="top">nice silhouette at sunset.</td>', 'nice silhouette at sunset.', '2006-09-13 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831382, 392562, 60779, '<td valign="top">you could''ve cropped top right and not lost anything in the scene. tough time of day to get interesting detail of background or tree.</td>', 'you could''ve cropped top right and not lost anything in the scene. tough time of day to get interesting detail of background or tree.', '2006-09-13 11:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831427, 394338, 60779, '<td valign="top">the lighting hurts the pic. the tree looks overexposed, so it doesn''t contrast well against the sky, building.</td>', 'the lighting hurts the pic. the tree looks overexposed, so it doesn''t contrast well against the sky, building.', '2006-09-13 12:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831450, 393599, 60779, '<td valign="top">nice use of color. the boat, water, and tree are fine, everything is isn''t - RV, light pole, electric wire...</td>', 'nice use of color. the boat, water, and tree are fine, everything is isn''t - RV, light pole, electric wire...', '2006-09-13 12:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831456, 394508, 60779, '<td valign="top">nice find. different - which is good.</td>', 'nice find. different - which is good.', '2006-09-13 12:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831465, 393147, 60779, '<td valign="top">nice scene, the light kills it though. very flat in the background.</td>', 'nice scene, the light kills it though. very flat in the background.', '2006-09-13 12:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831469, 393302, 60779, '<td valign="top">POV, lighting, sky all work. nice photo. 7</td>', 'POV, lighting, sky all work. nice photo. 7', '2006-09-13 12:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831476, 394476, 60779, '<td valign="top">my first thought re: the dark grass is that it looks burned. it doesn''t fit with the rest of the photo, which is really good.</td>', 'my first thought re: the dark grass is that it looks burned. it doesn''t fit with the rest of the photo, which is really good.', '2006-09-13 12:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831482, 394164, 60779, '<td valign="top">I like the framing you''ve chosen. could be sharper throughout. the picture itself is memorable.</td>', 'I like the framing you''ve chosen. could be sharper throughout. the picture itself is memorable.', '2006-09-13 12:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831549, 393508, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great tones and sky.</td>', 'Great tones and sky.', '2006-09-13 12:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831561, 394225, 60779, '<td valign="top">interesting for the challenge. trunk looks slightly off center (picky - I know). grass doesn''t do much for you. on balance though 6</td>', 'interesting for the challenge. trunk looks slightly off center (picky - I know). grass doesn''t do much for you. on balance though 6', '2006-09-13 12:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831595, 394135, 60779, '<td valign="top">good all around. two points: just a little less tight crop against sides, and different time of day - would be great! the sky doesn''t help you.</td>', 'good all around. two points: just a little less tight crop against sides, and different time of day - would be great! the sky doesn''t help you.', '2006-09-13 12:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831599, 394336, 60779, '<td valign="top">like it because it''s different, clever. nice sharp on the foreground leaves. hope you''re not killed by the DNMC people. 7 for me.</td>', 'like it because it''s different, clever. nice sharp on the foreground leaves. hope you''re not killed by the DNMC people. 7 for me.', '2006-09-13 12:53:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2831602, 393127, 60779, '<td valign="top">the lighting really hurts this picture. it''s a really drab sky. it does''t accentuate the leaves turning colors.</td>', 'the lighting really hurts this picture. it''s a really drab sky. it does''t accentuate the leaves turning colors.', '2006-09-13 12:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831620, 394144, 60779, '<td valign="top">this looks over sharpened and theres some haloing on the tree. nice simple scene. while looking at the lines, I notice that the hill is falling towards the viewer, but the fence is going away. to me the scene looks like it should be levelled but I think it''s only because of those crossing lines.</td>', 'this looks over sharpened and theres some haloing on the tree. nice simple scene. while looking at the lines, I notice that the hill is falling towards the viewer, but the fence is going away. to me the scene looks like it should be levelled but I think it''s only because of those crossing lines.', '2006-09-13 12:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831627, 394505, 60779, '<td valign="top">the lack of defintion in the tree''s branches is distracting. it''s just a big blob of black in the middle. I like your sky colors and susnet capture.</td>', 'the lack of defintion in the tree''s branches is distracting. it''s just a big blob of black in the middle. I like your sky colors and susnet capture.', '2006-09-13 12:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831629, 392759, 60779, '<td valign="top">really would work better if you were down closer to the tree.... j/k...nice capture and composition. Good exposure, this time flat light helps the picture. a little deduction because the scene is way more interesting than the tree. 6</td>', 'really would work better if you were down closer to the tree.... j/k...nice capture and composition. Good exposure, this time flat light helps the picture. a little deduction because the scene is way more interesting than the tree. 6', '2006-09-13 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831636, 394398, 60779, '<td valign="top">the only part I don''t like is the water. I happen to like smooth reflections. It looks processed. I like the greens on the tree and bottom left. for "moonlight" in title I''d like to see more evidence of the moon. this could have been 8 am.</td>', 'the only part I don''t like is the water. I happen to like smooth reflections. It looks processed. I like the greens on the tree and bottom left. for "moonlight" in title I''d like to see more evidence of the moon. this could have been 8 am.', '2006-09-13 13:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831640, 393769, 60779, '<td valign="top">great sky, and you can see the trunk. nice job. not sure why, but the POV is throwing me off.</td>', 'great sky, and you can see the trunk. nice job. not sure why, but the POV is throwing me off.', '2006-09-13 13:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831648, 394019, 60779, '<td valign="top">interesting tree to look at. I don''t like the processing...but at least it''s well done (compared) with others.</td>', 'interesting tree to look at. I don''t like the processing...but at least it''s well done (compared) with others.', '2006-09-13 13:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831650, 394388, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the crop and the over all feeling really fits the challenge-to me.Well done.</td>', 'Love the crop and the over all feeling really fits the challenge-to me.Well done.', '2006-09-13 13:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831653, 393487, 60779, '<td valign="top">is that a branch poking through a window? i like the walls and detail on the window. for me a stretch in the challenge.</td>', 'is that a branch poking through a window? i like the walls and detail on the window. for me a stretch in the challenge.', '2006-09-13 13:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831657, 394514, 60779, '<td valign="top">don''t like the crop. Unfortunately, the picture doesn''t grab my attention.</td>', 'don''t like the crop. Unfortunately, the picture doesn''t grab my attention.', '2006-09-13 13:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831688, 392714, 60779, '<td valign="top">really like the colors of the grass, don''t like the sky. on balance it''s just OK for me.</td>', 'really like the colors of the grass, don''t like the sky. on balance it''s just OK for me.', '2006-09-13 13:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831690, 394438, 60779, '<td valign="top">cool sky. nice to get the lines over the tree.</td>', 'cool sky. nice to get the lines over the tree.', '2006-09-13 13:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831692, 394185, 60779, '<td valign="top">really good one. great colors and you''ve got some definition in the foregroudn. nice photo.</td>', 'really good one. great colors and you''ve got some definition in the foregroudn. nice photo.', '2006-09-13 13:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831700, 394427, 60779, '<td valign="top">There''s not a lot going for the scene. It''s just a picture of a tree in field.</td>', 'There''s not a lot going for the scene. It''s just a picture of a tree in field.', '2006-09-13 13:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831706, 394479, 60779, '<td valign="top">Mars? Great silhouette and POV, I''m not a fan of the sky. But the clouds are cool.</td>', 'Mars? Great silhouette and POV, I''m not a fan of the sky. But the clouds are cool.', '2006-09-13 13:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
