(2832593, 394392, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like you found one well enough! if you think it''s hard to find a single tree where you are, try finding one in vermont!<br/> <br/>this photo has several strong elements. the tree is an interesting subject, and you''ve composed it well - it''s quite prominent, but not so big that the image feels crowded.<br/> <br/>the major crit i have is that the sky is so grey. there''s not enough contrast between the tree and the sky. a bit of levels adjustments might have helped; also, some careful burning on the tree &amp; dodging of the sky (especially near the horizon) would have added some drama.</td>', 'looks like you found one well enough! if you think it''s hard to find a single tree where you are, try finding one in vermont! this photo has several strong elements. the tree is an interesting subject, and you''ve composed it well - it''s quite prominent, but not so big that the image feels crowded. the major crit i have is that the sky is so grey. there''s not enough contrast between the tree and the sky. a bit of levels adjustments might have helped; also, some careful burning on the tree & dodging of the sky (especially near the horizon) would have added some drama.', '2006-09-13 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2832594, 393487, 17507, '<td valign="top">this is my 89th image to vote on - and it''s the only one of the ''branch'' images that works for me so far.</td>', 'this is my 89th image to vote on - and it''s the only one of the ''branch'' images that works for me so far.', '2006-09-13 17:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
