(2832600, 392880, 17507, '<td valign="top">good choice of subject - nice colors too.<br/> <br/>criticism:<br/>-tree takes up slightly too little space for my tastes. cropping a bit from the top and left would have been okay.<br/>-black border creates a very high-contrast area on the edges of the photo. this is bad, because contrast draws the eye, and so i find myself looking more to the edge than to the tree. notice that the magenta/black in the upper left has higher contrast than the lavender/black around the tree.</td>', 'good choice of subject - nice colors too. criticism:-tree takes up slightly too little space for my tastes. cropping a bit from the top and left would have been okay.-black border creates a very high-contrast area on the edges of the photo. this is bad, because contrast draws the eye, and so i find myself looking more to the edge than to the tree. notice that the magenta/black in the upper left has higher contrast than the lavender/black around the tree.', '2006-09-13 17:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
