(2833749, 393962, 42495, '<td valign="top">The first thing that grabs my attention here is the green color on top that closely matches that in the grass.  The choice of tree works for me.  The choice to almost center the picture may be holding it back a bit.  It''s not quite centered; not quite on a third.  IMO, the picture is a bit unbalanced with more tree and city on the right and less on the left. A crop on the left may help; also getting some more color out of the sky may add a bit of punch to the photo.  If I were voting, I''d give it a 6.  Good luck.</td>', 'The first thing that grabs my attention here is the green color on top that closely matches that in the grass.  The choice of tree works for me.  The choice to almost center the picture may be holding it back a bit.  It''s not quite centered; not quite on a third.  IMO, the picture is a bit unbalanced with more tree and city on the right and less on the left. A crop on the left may help; also getting some more color out of the sky may add a bit of punch to the photo.  If I were voting, I''d give it a 6.  Good luck.', '2006-09-14 00:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
