(2833938, 394269, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and well presented.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very pretty and well presented.  Good luck!', '2006-09-14 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833939, 391026, 15407, '<td valign="top">I like the composure here and the way the tones and lighting frame the subject tree.  I am also captivated by the likelihood that this tree grew at that location...  It looks to me as though some extraordinary forces planted a very large piece of driftwood for us to marvel over.  The post processing of the photo isn''t quite as subtle as I prefer yet I suspect that it takes harshness out of the scene which would likely be more distracting.</td>', 'I like the composure here and the way the tones and lighting frame the subject tree.  I am also captivated by the likelihood that this tree grew at that location...  It looks to me as though some extraordinary forces planted a very large piece of driftwood for us to marvel over.  The post processing of the photo isn''t quite as subtle as I prefer yet I suspect that it takes harshness out of the scene which would likely be more distracting.', '2006-09-14 02:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833940, 394014, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and reminds me of the Lake of the Woods.  I really like this shot and would score it higher had there ben one single tree.  Either way, 6.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is beautiful and reminds me of the Lake of the Woods.  I really like this shot and would score it higher had there ben one single tree.  Either way, 6.  Good luck!', '2006-09-14 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
