(2833948, 394388, 22537, '<td valign="top">I think this is very cool and I like the size of the frame though I think the voting Nazis will shoot you down for thinking out of the box.  Too bad but good luck! 6</td>', 'I think this is very cool and I like the size of the frame though I think the voting Nazis will shoot you down for thinking out of the box.  Too bad but good luck! 6', '2006-09-14 02:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
