(2833952, 394232, 22537, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Must bump to a 7.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent.  Must bump to a 7.  Good luck!', '2006-09-14 02:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833953, 394185, 22537, '<td valign="top">Really nice and great colors.  Good luck!</td>', 'Really nice and great colors.  Good luck!', '2006-09-14 02:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833961, 392897, 15407, '<td valign="top">What a day (and place) for a daydream! I like the tones and colors. It looks as though you may have used a polarizing filter without overdoing the effect, I wonder if you could possible tone that effect down slightly and add a slightly warmer feel to photo. I''ll be interested to see your shooting data on this. This is the type of scene that makes me want to take the innards out of my D1x and put it in one of my antique ''view'' cameras with the f128 apature.</td>', 'What a day (and place) for a daydream! I like the tones and colors. It looks as though you may have used a polarizing filter without overdoing the effect, I wonder if you could possible tone that effect down slightly and add a slightly warmer feel to photo. I''ll be interested to see your shooting data on this. This is the type of scene that makes me want to take the innards out of my D1x and put it in one of my antique ''view'' cameras with the f128 apature.', '2006-09-14 02:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833963, 392125, 15407, '<td valign="top">Where is this?  I''d like to see this in person.  There was a tree in Chico California that used to be similar to this but it gave up the fight!  In fact I just thought that this would make a great prop for Gary &amp; his brothers to make another appearance!  WOW!</td>', 'Where is this?  I''d like to see this in person.  There was a tree in Chico California that used to be similar to this but it gave up the fight!  In fact I just thought that this would make a great prop for Gary & his brothers to make another appearance!  WOW!', '2006-09-14 02:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833968, 393059, 15407, '<td valign="top">Stunning... there is a bit of a fight here between the foreground and the tree as the subject. I imagine you may have tried to lower the camera angle slightly to try &amp; get a little more light under the lower right branches of the tree,  yet it seems that the hill behind it wasn''t going to go away. On the other hand it may have toned down the competition between the foreground and the subject... In any event it is a very nice photo.</td>', 'Stunning... there is a bit of a fight here between the foreground and the tree as the subject. I imagine you may have tried to lower the camera angle slightly to try & get a little more light under the lower right branches of the tree,  yet it seems that the hill behind it wasn''t going to go away. On the other hand it may have toned down the competition between the foreground and the subject... In any event it is a very nice photo.', '2006-09-14 02:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833971, 394025, 15407, '<td valign="top">Coming or going this is very nice! My preferance for this picture would have it with a 10% shift lighter in gamma and a leveling of the horizon</td>', 'Coming or going this is very nice! My preferance for this picture would have it with a 10% shift lighter in gamma and a leveling of the horizon', '2006-09-14 02:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833972, 394179, 46601, '<td valign="top">like the composition here and the green on the trees ... though maybe it''s just my monitor but the sky seems sort of green ...</td>', 'like the composition here and the green on the trees ... though maybe it''s just my monitor but the sky seems sort of green ...', '2006-09-14 02:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833973, 394520, 46601, '<td valign="top">great idea ... though really hard to see the tree .. perhaps pulling a little closer to the subject and getting a slightly different angle might have worked better</td>', 'great idea ... though really hard to see the tree .. perhaps pulling a little closer to the subject and getting a slightly different angle might have worked better', '2006-09-14 02:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833974, 393302, 46601, '<td valign="top">very well done .. love the texture in the clouds ...</td>', 'very well done .. love the texture in the clouds ...', '2006-09-14 02:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833975, 394154, 46601, '<td valign="top">love the colours here ... very well done</td>', 'love the colours here ... very well done', '2006-09-14 02:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833976, 394330, 46601, '<td valign="top">ha ha ... great angle ... colours are wonderfull as well ... though not too sure how the dpc''ers might take this one ... 9</td>', 'ha ha ... great angle ... colours are wonderfull as well ... though not too sure how the dpc''ers might take this one ... 9', '2006-09-14 02:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833978, 393787, 15407, '<td valign="top">Great subject, scene &amp; lighting. I''m wondering if some of the post processing may have softened the foreground to the point where it didn''t distract from the tree yet left it (the tree)lacking for a sharper focus. It''s real hard to second guess that sort of thing. I like the composure and the colors ... very nice.</td>', 'Great subject, scene & lighting. I''m wondering if some of the post processing may have softened the foreground to the point where it didn''t distract from the tree yet left it (the tree)lacking for a sharper focus. It''s real hard to second guess that sort of thing. I like the composure and the colors ... very nice.', '2006-09-14 02:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2833979, 393657, 46601, '<td valign="top">great colours and composition .. though a little too busy</td>', 'great colours and composition .. though a little too busy', '2006-09-14 02:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
