(2835209, 392790, 41554, '<td valign="top">The tree looks almost surreal. I think the setting is lovely and has a lot of potential, maybe not totally fulfilled in this shot, but you can''t control the weather! There is some hallowing around the upper trunks against the sky, maybe an artifact of a bit too much of unsharp mask.<br/>Very nice overall, this hold your attention...</td>', 'The tree looks almost surreal. I think the setting is lovely and has a lot of potential, maybe not totally fulfilled in this shot, but you can''t control the weather! There is some hallowing around the upper trunks against the sky, maybe an artifact of a bit too much of unsharp mask.Very nice overall, this hold your attention...', '2006-09-14 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2835211, 391670, 41554, '<td valign="top">Great. Only thing that would make this pop a lot more was a bluer sky...</td>', 'Great. Only thing that would make this pop a lot more was a bluer sky...', '2006-09-14 16:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
