(2835220, 394358, 41554, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot this would be if those bushes on the right weren''t there!! As it is it is still very nice, giving a great sense of freedom and space. Good job, and I think it works weel in BW.</td>', 'What a fantastic shot this would be if those bushes on the right weren''t there!! As it is it is still very nice, giving a great sense of freedom and space. Good job, and I think it works weel in BW.', '2006-09-14 16:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
