(2835805, 394389, 17507, '<td valign="top">great idea - definitely has a dramatic feel and a strong emotive element.<br/> <br/>couple of crits-<br/>1. there''s a lot of empty space at the top. this makes the image feel a bit bottom-heavy and weakens the focal point of the image.<br/>2. the faded gaussian blur has created a noticeable halo, especially around the girl. going back over the edges with the history brush, or masking out the edges, would have dealt with this distracting element. i think you could have gotten away with just a quick run of the brush around the edges of the girl - a fifteen or thirty second fix.</td>', 'great idea - definitely has a dramatic feel and a strong emotive element. couple of crits-1. there''s a lot of empty space at the top. this makes the image feel a bit bottom-heavy and weakens the focal point of the image.2. the faded gaussian blur has created a noticeable halo, especially around the girl. going back over the edges with the history brush, or masking out the edges, would have dealt with this distracting element. i think you could have gotten away with just a quick run of the brush around the edges of the girl - a fifteen or thirty second fix.', '2006-09-14 20:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
