(2836164, 394213, 61379, '<td valign="top">I really like your photograph. First, I like the slope of the horizon. Second, I like the simplicity of three colors. Third, the shape of the tree follows the horizon nicely. Lastly, the shadow of the tree onto the field adds a final touch of grace and tranquility. The huge foreground makes this photograph even more interesting and eye-catching. Great job! I give it a 7.</td>', 'I really like your photograph. First, I like the slope of the horizon. Second, I like the simplicity of three colors. Third, the shape of the tree follows the horizon nicely. Lastly, the shadow of the tree onto the field adds a final touch of grace and tranquility. The huge foreground makes this photograph even more interesting and eye-catching. Great job! I give it a 7.', '2006-09-14 22:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
