(2837335, 394322, 57421, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The colors are great making the green tree really pop out. The lighting is obviously excellent too. And also definitely a sense of message. Why do I get the feeling I recognize the author (if not the model?)</td>', 'Very nice! The colors are great making the green tree really pop out. The lighting is obviously excellent too. And also definitely a sense of message. Why do I get the feeling I recognize the author (if not the model?)', '2006-09-15 04:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837337, 394218, 57421, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and color. The tree really pops out of the muted background. Very well mastered and composed. Clearly one of the best shots in the challenge IMHO.</td>', 'Very nice light and color. The tree really pops out of the muted background. Very well mastered and composed. Clearly one of the best shots in the challenge IMHO.', '2006-09-15 04:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837375, 394515, 57936, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, what is the subject here... Tree, or WOMAN IN THE TREE TRUNK???? Sorry for the flippant response, but I am finding a lot of images that just don''t seem to meet this challenge! If there weren''t a woman in a night gown in the middle of the tree, it would be ok.</td>', 'Hmmm, what is the subject here... Tree, or WOMAN IN THE TREE TRUNK???? Sorry for the flippant response, but I am finding a lot of images that just don''t seem to meet this challenge! If there weren''t a woman in a night gown in the middle of the tree, it would be ok.', '2006-09-15 05:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837378, 392880, 57936, '<td valign="top">A bit over sharp around the tree.</td>', 'A bit over sharp around the tree.', '2006-09-15 05:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837382, 394322, 57936, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm what is the subject here... itty bitty tree, or BIG NUDE WOMAN???? (Not that the woman is big, just in comparison to the little tree she is holding.) Sorry, but I just don''t find the MAIN subject of this image to be the cute little tree. Other than that, great image! And a stunning model, too!</td>', 'Hmmmm what is the subject here... itty bitty tree, or BIG NUDE WOMAN???? (Not that the woman is big, just in comparison to the little tree she is holding.) Sorry, but I just don''t find the MAIN subject of this image to be the cute little tree. Other than that, great image! And a stunning model, too!', '2006-09-15 05:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837388, 393240, 57936, '<td valign="top">Wow, I hate to nitpick, but the challenge is "A Single Tree"... LOL! The title list two! Neat shot, but the lighting is too harsh.</td>', 'Wow, I hate to nitpick, but the challenge is "A Single Tree"... LOL! The title list two! Neat shot, but the lighting is too harsh.', '2006-09-15 05:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837392, 394215, 57936, '<td valign="top">WOW, nothing screams "pastoral scene" like a bajillion sheep! Great pastoral scene! LOL! Love the tones and the composition.</td>', 'WOW, nothing screams "pastoral scene" like a bajillion sheep! Great pastoral scene! LOL! Love the tones and the composition.', '2006-09-15 05:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837528, 393782, 35602, '<td valign="top">Hey, its the Charlie Brown Christmas tree.  Love the background colors.  Nice detail overall.</td>', 'Hey, its the Charlie Brown Christmas tree.  Love the background colors.  Nice detail overall.', '2006-09-15 08:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837538, 394372, 35602, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity and strong lighting of this one.  Really good job.  Leaf is wonderfully apparent.  Nice job.</td>', 'I love the simplicity and strong lighting of this one.  Really good job.  Leaf is wonderfully apparent.  Nice job.', '2006-09-15 08:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
