(2837979, 394222, 30441, '<td valign="top">Nicely saturated colors and good framing of the ocean rocks. The extra foliage sticking in on the right is a little distracting however. 6</td>', 'Nicely saturated colors and good framing of the ocean rocks. The extra foliage sticking in on the right is a little distracting however. 6', '2006-09-15 11:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837992, 394520, 30441, '<td valign="top">I definitely like the idea here for matching the theme. I lose the bottom of the tree though in the bottom. I wonder if a different angle would have helped to isolate the tree more, while still showing the burnt out area. There''s also something sticking in the upper left corner which probably should be cropped out. 5</td>', 'I definitely like the idea here for matching the theme. I lose the bottom of the tree though in the bottom. I wonder if a different angle would have helped to isolate the tree more, while still showing the burnt out area. There''s also something sticking in the upper left corner which probably should be cropped out. 5', '2006-09-15 11:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837998, 394479, 30441, '<td valign="top">Very nice, processing and composition. 8</td>', 'Very nice, processing and composition. 8', '2006-09-15 11:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2838012, 393696, 2612, '<td valign="top">cool perspective</td>', 'cool perspective', '2006-09-15 12:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
