(2838175, 393227, 57936, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if this is a in camera zooming shot or a motion filter, but it doesn''t really help the image. And the horizon is titled.</td>', 'Don''t know if this is a in camera zooming shot or a motion filter, but it doesn''t really help the image. And the horizon is titled.', '2006-09-15 12:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
