(2840244, 392824, 33361, '<td valign="top">beautifully done, sun is in the perfect spot, colors nice- not too saturated or flat, composition is right on, and love the silhouette of the tree -</td>', 'beautifully done, sun is in the perfect spot, colors nice- not too saturated or flat, composition is right on, and love the silhouette of the tree -', '2006-09-16 09:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
