(2840505, 394492, 59740, '<td valign="top">Potential for greatness. My problem with it is that that there is not quite enough contrast between the tree and the rest of it. I would like to see the fore and backgrounds very high key.</td>', 'Potential for greatness. My problem with it is that that there is not quite enough contrast between the tree and the rest of it. I would like to see the fore and backgrounds very high key.', '2006-09-16 12:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840507, 393584, 59740, '<td valign="top">Terrific.</td>', 'Terrific.', '2006-09-16 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840508, 393806, 59740, '<td valign="top">Very clever. How did you put it all together?</td>', 'Very clever. How did you put it all together?', '2006-09-16 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840515, 394227, 59740, '<td valign="top">Would have been better without the goal. I keep being drawn away from the tree to the goal.</td>', 'Would have been better without the goal. I keep being drawn away from the tree to the goal.', '2006-09-16 12:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840518, 394210, 59740, '<td valign="top">Terrific.</td>', 'Terrific.', '2006-09-16 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840523, 394154, 59740, '<td valign="top">I wish you had climbed a ladder and lopped off the extra branches on top!! I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I wish you had climbed a ladder and lopped off the extra branches on top!! I gave it an 8.', '2006-09-16 12:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840528, 394213, 59740, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Good composition and color. I really like it.</td>', 'Excellent. Good composition and color. I really like it.', '2006-09-16 12:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840532, 393487, 59740, '<td valign="top">I love photos like this where the viewer has to work a little. Most of the tree being hidden behind the wall is a great idea.</td>', 'I love photos like this where the viewer has to work a little. Most of the tree being hidden behind the wall is a great idea.', '2006-09-16 12:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840539, 393227, 59740, '<td valign="top">The zoom implies movement while a tree usually says stability. I don''t get the use of this technique for a tree picture.</td>', 'The zoom implies movement while a tree usually says stability. I don''t get the use of this technique for a tree picture.', '2006-09-16 12:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840547, 392874, 59740, '<td valign="top">Too much green saturation. Doesn''t look real.</td>', 'Too much green saturation. Doesn''t look real.', '2006-09-16 12:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840548, 394205, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing.</td>', 'Nice use of framing.', '2006-09-16 12:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840552, 394317, 59740, '<td valign="top">Highlights are washed out and the tree is blurred.</td>', 'Highlights are washed out and the tree is blurred.', '2006-09-16 12:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840556, 394129, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and color.</td>', 'Nice silhouette and color.', '2006-09-16 12:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840559, 394458, 59740, '<td valign="top">Very good picture.</td>', 'Very good picture.', '2006-09-16 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840671, 393787, 16106, '<td valign="top">a bit too soft, but a great mood is set by the tones and the diagonal framing.</td>', 'a bit too soft, but a great mood is set by the tones and the diagonal framing.', '2006-09-16 14:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840677, 393783, 16106, '<td valign="top">great colors, and the fill lighting is very well handled but the framing seems akward, with all the visual intrest in the bottom half of the frame.</td>', 'great colors, and the fill lighting is very well handled but the framing seems akward, with all the visual intrest in the bottom half of the frame.', '2006-09-16 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840704, 394479, 16106, '<td valign="top">Other than the slightly odd angles of the tree and horizon line, (that I assume comes from either a very wide angle lens , or an attempt to square up a slanted horizon) this is my favoites shot so far. Pretty radical editing, but you made it work for your subject matter.</td>', 'Other than the slightly odd angles of the tree and horizon line, (that I assume comes from either a very wide angle lens , or an attempt to square up a slanted horizon) this is my favoites shot so far. Pretty radical editing, but you made it work for your subject matter.', '2006-09-16 14:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840728, 394063, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good colors and subject, but I think the framing would have been better if you had gotten a bit lower and brought the horizon on the third line and made the tree stand out out clearer agains the sky, and thereby gotten the building into a less clutered area of the frame.</td>', 'Good colors and subject, but I think the framing would have been better if you had gotten a bit lower and brought the horizon on the third line and made the tree stand out out clearer agains the sky, and thereby gotten the building into a less clutered area of the frame.', '2006-09-16 14:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840730, 394526, 16106, '<td valign="top">good shot, a bit of fill lighting into the crown of the tree would have put this in ribbon territory.</td>', 'good shot, a bit of fill lighting into the crown of the tree would have put this in ribbon territory.', '2006-09-16 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840733, 394358, 16106, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, my only crit is that it isnt terribly sharp in the details. never the less great subject and perfect framing.</td>', 'very nice shot, my only crit is that it isnt terribly sharp in the details. never the less great subject and perfect framing.', '2006-09-16 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840736, 391026, 16106, '<td valign="top">the doging at the water where it meets the wood is pretty sloppy. It really hurts an otherwise very nice composition. Given that this is advanced editing carefull reworking with layers could get rid of that issue as well as bringing up more detail in the wood grain.</td>', 'the doging at the water where it meets the wood is pretty sloppy. It really hurts an otherwise very nice composition. Given that this is advanced editing carefull reworking with layers could get rid of that issue as well as bringing up more detail in the wood grain.', '2006-09-16 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840745, 394489, 16106, '<td valign="top">sometimes too much is just right. another radial edit that works well. great find, well composed and a really weird edit, but it works.</td>', 'sometimes too much is just right. another radial edit that works well. great find, well composed and a really weird edit, but it works.', '2006-09-16 15:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840747, 394536, 16106, '<td valign="top">The tree belnds intot the backround a bit too much and the focus is a bit soft, but nice composition, and lovely colors</td>', 'The tree belnds intot the backround a bit too much and the focus is a bit soft, but nice composition, and lovely colors', '2006-09-16 15:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840753, 394144, 16106, '<td valign="top">like my image, with such sparse details it is easy to go overboard on the USM and get haloing at the skyline. A bit of dodging in the sky would have lent more interest to the pure tone of the sky.</td>', 'like my image, with such sparse details it is easy to go overboard on the USM and get haloing at the skyline. A bit of dodging in the sky would have lent more interest to the pure tone of the sky.', '2006-09-16 15:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840846, 394043, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice scene and a good job making it a nice photograph. Your processing is good IMO, not over or under done. Colors a great in the foreground and sky and the tree does pop out. Wish you well in the challenge. bump 10</td>', 'Nice scene and a good job making it a nice photograph. Your processing is good IMO, not over or under done. Colors a great in the foreground and sky and the tree does pop out. Wish you well in the challenge. bump 10', '2006-09-16 16:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840858, 394312, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice leading lines up to the tree. Nice exposure and use of surroundings. Bump 8</td>', 'Very nice leading lines up to the tree. Nice exposure and use of surroundings. Bump 8', '2006-09-16 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840882, 391249, 16106, '<td valign="top">I l everything about thish shot but the tree. The colors and the play of light on the clouds and the grass are first rate, but the tree is so small in the frame that its form needs to be iconic, very tree like, with a trunk holding the crown into the sky. The tree here, could be a shrub since all we see is a blob of green, and it makes the scale uncertain. It may be a personal prefrence, but for me it knocks this fine shot out of ribbon teritory.</td>', 'I l everything about thish shot but the tree. The colors and the play of light on the clouds and the grass are first rate, but the tree is so small in the frame that its form needs to be iconic, very tree like, with a trunk holding the crown into the sky. The tree here, could be a shrub since all we see is a blob of green, and it makes the scale uncertain. It may be a personal prefrence, but for me it knocks this fine shot out of ribbon teritory.', '2006-09-16 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2840887, 393508, 16106, '<td valign="top">a very intersting editing job, which works well. The rotation of the canvas to get the horizon line to work might be OK because the tree could have grown sideways but in combination with the figure, at the same odd angle it hurts the image. I do like the weird sky you got in the partial de-sat.</td>', 'a very intersting editing job, which works well. The rotation of the canvas to get the horizon line to work might be OK because the tree could have grown sideways but in combination with the figure, at the same odd angle it hurts the image. I do like the weird sky you got in the partial de-sat.', '2006-09-16 16:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
