(2842191, 394247, 15711, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of TUBORG''s work. I like the slight desaturation of it. Beautiful with the hillside rising up behind the tree. Great vista with that added appeal of the human form.</td>', 'This makes me think of TUBORG''s work. I like the slight desaturation of it. Beautiful with the hillside rising up behind the tree. Great vista with that added appeal of the human form.', '2006-09-17 09:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842224, 394218, 25355, '<td valign="top">He has clippers to clip, but there''s nothing that has been clipped. ;&gt;þ<br/>And then, some people may hold the theory that it isn''t really a bonsi at all, but a branch held in a tray with sand in it... ;&gt;þ<br/>  Is that someone''s brother? ;&gt;þ</td>', 'He has clippers to clip, but there''s nothing that has been clipped. ;>þAnd then, some people may hold the theory that it isn''t really a bonsi at all, but a branch held in a tray with sand in it... ;>þ  Is that someone''s brother? ;>þ', '2006-09-17 10:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842243, 393780, 25355, '<td valign="top">From Lessons of the Burmis Tree: "The Burmis Tree is the most photographed tree in the world. It was sentenced to perch on a ridge along Highway 3, in Southern Alberta, Canada, in the foothills of the Rocky Mountains, for over 740 years. "<br/>  Well, it''s the first time I''ve heard of it. That''s a very hard to prove claim in the first sentence. London has more visitors than Alberta, and one tree I can name from there off the top of my head is the Elfin Oak.<br/>   So, about your photo. I like the negative space the tree gives to the sky. Maybe a tad over-sharpened. Nice composition overall.</td>', 'From Lessons of the Burmis Tree: "The Burmis Tree is the most photographed tree in the world. It was sentenced to perch on a ridge along Highway 3, in Southern Alberta, Canada, in the foothills of the Rocky Mountains, for over 740 years. "  Well, it''s the first time I''ve heard of it. That''s a very hard to prove claim in the first sentence. London has more visitors than Alberta, and one tree I can name from there off the top of my head is the Elfin Oak.   So, about your photo. I like the negative space the tree gives to the sky. Maybe a tad over-sharpened. Nice composition overall.', '2006-09-17 10:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842248, 392964, 25355, '<td valign="top">Oregon! Bear! Music! (The first is a certainty) ;&gt;þ</td>', 'Oregon! Bear! Music! (The first is a certainty) ;>þ', '2006-09-17 10:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842375, 391306, 2612, '<td valign="top">the color/tone of this image gives it a very artistic feel. Thanks for contributing something other than the standard tree on a hil with super saturated colors.</td>', 'the color/tone of this image gives it a very artistic feel. Thanks for contributing something other than the standard tree on a hil with super saturated colors.', '2006-09-17 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842379, 394506, 2612, '<td valign="top">very unique in a challenge with many similar images!</td>', 'very unique in a challenge with many similar images!', '2006-09-17 12:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842395, 393912, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and interesting take on the challenge. The negative space at the bottom is a nice addition. Two things distract me, 1. the negative space at the bottom I believe would of looked better uniformed (constant black), 2. the band on the wrist. Other than that a great picture. 7</td>', 'Nice composition and interesting take on the challenge. The negative space at the bottom is a nice addition. Two things distract me, 1. the negative space at the bottom I believe would of looked better uniformed (constant black), 2. the band on the wrist. Other than that a great picture. 7', '2006-09-17 12:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842398, 391222, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice find and exposed well. Great capture 7</td>', 'Nice find and exposed well. Great capture 7', '2006-09-17 12:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842401, 394205, 22970, '<td valign="top">The framing of your subject and the sky makes your photograph have some pop to it. Great exposer on the sky. <strike>7</strike> second round bump to 8.</td>', 'The framing of your subject and the sky makes your photograph have some pop to it. Great exposer on the sky. 7 second round bump to 8.', '2006-09-17 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842402, 394522, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colors and reflections. Calming feel to your photograph. Nice processing. Bump 8</td>', 'Nice use of colors and reflections. Calming feel to your photograph. Nice processing. Bump 8', '2006-09-17 12:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842418, 391770, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Good lighting and composition.</td>', 'Nice work. Good lighting and composition.', '2006-09-17 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842419, 394412, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view. The stars add to the picture.</td>', 'Nice point of view. The stars add to the picture.', '2006-09-17 12:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842421, 394222, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice prospective and use of the tree as a frame. Vibrant colors are nice. Bump 8</td>', 'Nice prospective and use of the tree as a frame. Vibrant colors are nice. Bump 8', '2006-09-17 12:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842426, 393059, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the composition how the rocks lead my eyes to the three. Very nice capture and processing. Bump <strike>9</strike> second round bump 10. Nice work!</td>', 'I like the composition how the rocks lead my eyes to the three. Very nice capture and processing. Bump 9 second round bump 10. Nice work!', '2006-09-17 12:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842429, 394537, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think this would of been a great picture. But I feel the processing on the top of the image takes away from the picture. 6</td>', 'I think this would of been a great picture. But I feel the processing on the top of the image takes away from the picture. 6', '2006-09-17 12:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842430, 394211, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph great detail and colors. Lighting good. The only thing that distracts me is the red wire, rope, ?? on the left. I think it would of been  better if you would of desaturated the reds in that area. Still a good shot. bump 7</td>', 'Nice photograph great detail and colors. Lighting good. The only thing that distracts me is the red wire, rope, ?? on the left. I think it would of been  better if you would of desaturated the reds in that area. Still a good shot. bump 7', '2006-09-17 12:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842439, 394247, 53278, '<td valign="top">WOW, GREAT SHOT! i was just browsing through the images and i saw this one, it immediatly captured my attention.<br/> <br/>Great Job! 10</td>', 'WOW, GREAT SHOT! i was just browsing through the images and i saw this one, it immediatly captured my attention. Great Job! 10', '2006-09-17 12:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
