(2843784, 394506, 53147, '<td valign="top">THese were the type of shots I was hoping to see more of and figured would do the best. A single tree out of place. The selective desat works well although the editing is a bit sloppy. Still gave you an 8 for a great find.</td>', 'THese were the type of shots I was hoping to see more of and figured would do the best. A single tree out of place. The selective desat works well although the editing is a bit sloppy. Still gave you an 8 for a great find.', '2006-09-17 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2843791, 392897, 53147, '<td valign="top">Strong composition. What sets this one apart from so many that have a similar layout is the vastness and hieght to the shot overall. Beautiful editing, beautiful clouds and the depth/height felt from the land so far below is excellent. Bumping this up one to a 9. Great work.</td>', 'Strong composition. What sets this one apart from so many that have a similar layout is the vastness and hieght to the shot overall. Beautiful editing, beautiful clouds and the depth/height felt from the land so far below is excellent. Bumping this up one to a 9. Great work.', '2006-09-17 23:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2843794, 394041, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Trees standing out in cityscape sceneries work well. THe colors and layout work really well here but the intense blur scattered around is a bit distracting. Still gave this an 8.</td>', 'Nice capture. Trees standing out in cityscape sceneries work well. THe colors and layout work really well here but the intense blur scattered around is a bit distracting. Still gave this an 8.', '2006-09-17 23:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2843796, 394372, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice - the black space all around works great in bringing the focus to the small tree. Cloning out the green items by the foot of the tree might have helped make the focus there even stronger. Still - I really like this shot and gave it an 8 overall.</td>', 'Nice - the black space all around works great in bringing the focus to the small tree. Cloning out the green items by the foot of the tree might have helped make the focus there even stronger. Still - I really like this shot and gave it an 8 overall.', '2006-09-18 00:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2843804, 392473, 53147, '<td valign="top">Funky use of fisheye. While it might not be the best pic inthe challenge it surely was something pleasantly different. 7</td>', 'Funky use of fisheye. While it might not be the best pic inthe challenge it surely was something pleasantly different. 7', '2006-09-18 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
