(2844056, 394041, 28710, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the odd blurring. It adds a little business to the picture, although I''m not sure I like it 100%. The addition of the reading man really makes the picture.<br/> <br/>Nice use of the curve in the stairs too.</td>', 'Interesting use of the odd blurring. It adds a little business to the picture, although I''m not sure I like it 100%. The addition of the reading man really makes the picture. Nice use of the curve in the stairs too.', '2006-09-18 01:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844058, 394205, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I can''t guess exactly where this is. Your title makes me think it''s the train station at Svågertorp, but I don''t recognize the structure. It was so clever to frame the tree with this! Also, as mentioned below, the colors are fantastic. Congratulations on 10th place!</td>', 'Beautiful! I can''t guess exactly where this is. Your title makes me think it''s the train station at Svågertorp, but I don''t recognize the structure. It was so clever to frame the tree with this! Also, as mentioned below, the colors are fantastic. Congratulations on 10th place!', '2006-09-18 01:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844071, 394330, 28710, '<td valign="top">This image really stood out to me during voting. I didn''t have enough time to finish voting, but it would have pulled a 9 from me.<br/> <br/>Oddly, it''s an image that I like more than others that I would have voted 10 on.<br/> <br/>I have a strong feeling that the things I don''t like about the DPC presentation of this pic are inherent to the DPC presentation only. I would imagine that they are not present in the original.<br/> <br/>Very nicely spotted and pulled off.</td>', 'This image really stood out to me during voting. I didn''t have enough time to finish voting, but it would have pulled a 9 from me. Oddly, it''s an image that I like more than others that I would have voted 10 on. I have a strong feeling that the things I don''t like about the DPC presentation of this pic are inherent to the DPC presentation only. I would imagine that they are not present in the original. Very nicely spotted and pulled off.', '2006-09-18 01:49:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844077, 394534, 28710, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. I suspect it''s a tiny bit oversharpened, but I think that is probably due to using the wrong sharpening settings for 640x480. Pics are a lot more sensitive to sharpening at this resolution.<br/> <br/>One thing that I find helps prevent the data loss and subsequent need for strong sharpening in small sizes is using multiple steps for reducing size. I don''t know if you did this or not, but if you didn''t, you might want to look into it.</td>', 'Nice pic. I suspect it''s a tiny bit oversharpened, but I think that is probably due to using the wrong sharpening settings for 640x480. Pics are a lot more sensitive to sharpening at this resolution. One thing that I find helps prevent the data loss and subsequent need for strong sharpening in small sizes is using multiple steps for reducing size. I don''t know if you did this or not, but if you didn''t, you might want to look into it.', '2006-09-18 01:52:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844083, 391670, 36619, '<td valign="top">nice shot!</td>', 'nice shot!', '2006-09-18 01:53:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844084, 392964, 12253, '<td valign="top">What gorgeous tones and a beautiful scene.  I''m a bit surprised this didn''t finish even higher.  Even the trolls couldn''t poo poo it!<br/> <br/>Congrats on 15th though!</td>', 'What gorgeous tones and a beautiful scene.  I''m a bit surprised this didn''t finish even higher.  Even the trolls couldn''t poo poo it! Congrats on 15th though!', '2006-09-18 01:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844100, 391026, 25952, '<td valign="top">well this is a nice image but to me it lacks much photographic quality and has been treated to the point of being more representative of painting or digital art. <br/> <br/>I do like this as an image, I do not see it as a photograph. There is a complete lack of detail and what looks to be sloppy editing. <br/> <br/>I really can''t believe this placed. Nice seeing on your part, just think the editing is, well...it makes it not a photograph.</td>', 'well this is a nice image but to me it lacks much photographic quality and has been treated to the point of being more representative of painting or digital art.  I do like this as an image, I do not see it as a photograph. There is a complete lack of detail and what looks to be sloppy editing.  I really can''t believe this placed. Nice seeing on your part, just think the editing is, well...it makes it not a photograph.', '2006-09-18 01:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844119, 394490, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is very lovely.</td>', 'This is very lovely.', '2006-09-18 02:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
