(2844254, 391026, 64489, '<td valign="top">I must say, I have to agree with petrakka - but it just goes to show that you never know what the rest of the world is going to think of your art.  Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'I must say, I have to agree with petrakka - but it just goes to show that you never know what the rest of the world is going to think of your art.  Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2006-09-18 03:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
