(2844287, 392897, 62095, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote much on this challenge, missed this one, which is a shame. I would have had this in first place. Very impressive. If I can get a single shot like this from my copy of the 10-22 then that would be fantastic.</td>', 'I didn''t vote much on this challenge, missed this one, which is a shame. I would have had this in first place. Very impressive. If I can get a single shot like this from my copy of the 10-22 then that would be fantastic.', '2006-09-18 03:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844297, 392125, 13749, '<td valign="top">reminds me slightly of a shot i took awhile back, <a href="//www.funktifeye.com/plog/index.php?showimage=101" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>.  but your picture is much better :p</td>', 'reminds me slightly of a shot i took awhile back, here.  but your picture is much better :p', '2006-09-18 03:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
