(2844320, 392964, 23458, '<td valign="top">I much prefer the processing on this to some of your recent submissions. Well composed, and possibly deserved an even higher score. <br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'I much prefer the processing on this to some of your recent submissions. Well composed, and possibly deserved an even higher score.  Well done.', '2006-09-18 03:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844327, 394218, 57421, '<td valign="top">can''t agree more with jutilda.... this was an excellent shot.<br/> <br/>same comment for the other man/woman-and-bonzai picture, from larus, ranked even lower...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-18 03:02:40.</i></td>', 'can''t agree more with jutilda.... this was an excellent shot. same comment for the other man/woman-and-bonzai picture, from larus, ranked even lower...', '2006-09-18 03:50:22.000000', '2006-09-18 04:02:40.000000', 0),
(2844334, 391026, 23458, '<td valign="top">The processing here is incredibly heavy-handed, it''s a well composed image, but the excessive neat-image and haphazard dodge &amp; burn (or whatever you''ve done to it) really detract from the end product. <br/> <br/>Clearly the majority disagree with me, but I think the sentiments of Petrakka and Haakon certainly warrant an echo. <br/> <br/>All the best with your future submissions.</td>', 'The processing here is incredibly heavy-handed, it''s a well composed image, but the excessive neat-image and haphazard dodge & burn (or whatever you''ve done to it) really detract from the end product.  Clearly the majority disagree with me, but I think the sentiments of Petrakka and Haakon certainly warrant an echo.  All the best with your future submissions.', '2006-09-18 03:52:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2844347, 394322, 57421, '<td valign="top">Well as they say around here, the voters are kings. But as we do here in France, a good revolution to change kings from time to time is good too ;). This score is a shame! Like the excellent shot by tuborg ranked very low, it is really disapointing to see so low a reward is given to more original interpretations of the subject. <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work and original approach. This was a great shot!</td>', 'Well as they say around here, the voters are kings. But as we do here in France, a good revolution to change kings from time to time is good too ;). This score is a shame! Like the excellent shot by tuborg ranked very low, it is really disapointing to see so low a reward is given to more original interpretations of the subject.  Keep up the good work and original approach. This was a great shot!', '2006-09-18 04:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
