(2844523, 394168, 61191, '<td valign="top">avg. 5.4229? 136th place? Seems that many people don''t took the time that was needed to understand your shot. I expected this to be a top 20 entry. I just can''t understand why so many people always prefer the "standard cliché shot" over someting like this. Keep up your great work!</td>', 'avg. 5.4229? 136th place? Seems that many people don''t took the time that was needed to understand your shot. I expected this to be a top 20 entry. I just can''t understand why so many people always prefer the "standard cliché shot" over someting like this. Keep up your great work!', '2006-09-18 06:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
