(2845488, 394247, 27482, '<td valign="top">Aw give me a break!  I was thinking of the same friggin tree for this challenge but didn´t bother with the driving, just didn´t have time...  Damn DPC and their week submission time, I would have gotten a yellow ribbon if only I had the time, hehe :)<br/> <br/>Just kidding!  But seriously, just ask Steinar and Andri, my fellow WPL teammates, I was seriously thinking about driving out to this specific tree, I remember the shot Sigurgeir took of it in the "Lost in Iceland" book, awesome!<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon :)</td>', 'Aw give me a break!  I was thinking of the same friggin tree for this challenge but didn´t bother with the driving, just didn´t have time...  Damn DPC and their week submission time, I would have gotten a yellow ribbon if only I had the time, hehe :) Just kidding!  But seriously, just ask Steinar and Andri, my fellow WPL teammates, I was seriously thinking about driving out to this specific tree, I remember the shot Sigurgeir took of it in the "Lost in Iceland" book, awesome! Congrats on the ribbon :)', '2006-09-18 16:45:12.000000', NULL, 0),
