(2845863, 393990, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hrm.  When I first looked at this shot I gave it a 6, and kind of guessed that was where it would stay as I went through and bumped up votes.  But every time I came to it, there was just something unique about it that I liked.  The soft colors, the little puffs of clouds that mimic the bunches of pine needles, the unbalanced feel of it all... somehow it all worked for me.  I didn''t really get the title, and that bothered me... like I was missing something, but in the end, I ended up giving this shot the only 10 it received.  Not quite where I was expecting to see this one finish, but I still think it''s a fantastic shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Hrm.  When I first looked at this shot I gave it a 6, and kind of guessed that was where it would stay as I went through and bumped up votes.  But every time I came to it, there was just something unique about it that I liked.  The soft colors, the little puffs of clouds that mimic the bunches of pine needles, the unbalanced feel of it all... somehow it all worked for me.  I didn''t really get the title, and that bothered me... like I was missing something, but in the end, I ended up giving this shot the only 10 it received.  Not quite where I was expecting to see this one finish, but I still think it''s a fantastic shot.  Well done!', '2006-09-18 20:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2845868, 393808, 47852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  This was one of my top picks in the challenge.  I love the colors, and how fortunate that you found a tree with such vivid colors in time for the challenge!  Well done and congrats on your 4th highest score and 11th place!</td>', 'Beautiful!  This was one of my top picks in the challenge.  I love the colors, and how fortunate that you found a tree with such vivid colors in time for the challenge!  Well done and congrats on your 4th highest score and 11th place!', '2006-09-18 20:04:58.000000', NULL, 0),
