(2846802, 394322, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay first of WOW! What an awesome picture, idea and model! I can''t believe all the low scores this got...have people lost their minds?!?!?!?<br/> <br/>Second, I guess people can''t see the beauty in the human form. I didn''t vote on this challenge Larus, but if I had, this would have gotten high marks from me for perfect lighting (as usual) and a creative take on this challenge. This is in NO way tastless IMHO. Congrats to you and the beautiful model for this stunning work.</td>', 'Okay first of WOW! What an awesome picture, idea and model! I can''t believe all the low scores this got...have people lost their minds?!?!?!? Second, I guess people can''t see the beauty in the human form. I didn''t vote on this challenge Larus, but if I had, this would have gotten high marks from me for perfect lighting (as usual) and a creative take on this challenge. This is in NO way tastless IMHO. Congrats to you and the beautiful model for this stunning work.', '2006-09-19 02:24:10.000000', NULL, 0),
