(2847100, 393860, 48456, '<td valign="top">I like it <br/>don''t know what it would look like had you kept a water line, like the equivalent of a horizon, try it who knows, though i guess you were aiming for something disappearing in darkness. Though perhaps if you <i>had</i> a water line it wouldnt have the feel of being so dark that you have the false impression its not as sharp as it really is (cf. comment below)<br/>just a thought.</td>', 'I like it don''t know what it would look like had you kept a water line, like the equivalent of a horizon, try it who knows, though i guess you were aiming for something disappearing in darkness. Though perhaps if you had a water line it wouldnt have the feel of being so dark that you have the false impression its not as sharp as it really is (cf. comment below)just a thought.', '2006-09-19 09:28:28.000000', NULL, 0),
