(2847234, 393905, 35545, '<td valign="top">This was certainly one of the most creative shots in the challenge.  IMNSHO there could have been a tad more contrast between the tree and the wall to make the tree stand out.  Brilliant composition.</td>', 'This was certainly one of the most creative shots in the challenge.  IMNSHO there could have been a tad more contrast between the tree and the wall to make the tree stand out.  Brilliant composition.', '2006-09-19 10:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2847285, 393701, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Very lovely colors in the sky. The upper clouds in the top right seem more like noise though. I know it''s not, but the other clouds seem smooth and flowing. I might have cloned them out. The tree could have used some more definition. It is a nice silhouette though. I guess in a nice way I''m trying to say, it''s not a bad shot, but it''s not really up to the standards you''ve been setting for yourself. I gave it a 5 in voting.</td>', 'Trading post...   Very lovely colors in the sky. The upper clouds in the top right seem more like noise though. I know it''s not, but the other clouds seem smooth and flowing. I might have cloned them out. The tree could have used some more definition. It is a nice silhouette though. I guess in a nice way I''m trying to say, it''s not a bad shot, but it''s not really up to the standards you''ve been setting for yourself. I gave it a 5 in voting.', '2006-09-19 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 0),
