(2847338, 394530, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Very lovely photo. I gave this a 7 in voting. It seemed to stand out a bit with the beautiful waves and the far off mountains. Very nice on the tree. The overall photo probably should have been a bit lighter. I love the child fishing. With just a little more editing, I would have given this a 10.</td>', 'Trading post...   Very lovely photo. I gave this a 7 in voting. It seemed to stand out a bit with the beautiful waves and the far off mountains. Very nice on the tree. The overall photo probably should have been a bit lighter. I love the child fishing. With just a little more editing, I would have given this a 10.', '2006-09-19 11:40:50.000000', NULL, 0),
