(2853011, 394336, 17507, '<td valign="top">you were punished by the conservative voting crowd here. this image is better than the score it got, both in general and with specific reference to this challenge. i think it should have scored in the range of 6, myself.</td>', 'you were punished by the conservative voting crowd here. this image is better than the score it got, both in general and with specific reference to this challenge. i think it should have scored in the range of 6, myself.', '2006-09-21 01:34:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2853629, 394218, 22689, '<td valign="top"><b>From the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>Hi Arnthor !<br/> <br/>I''m far from being an expert , so don''t expect precise technical comments , only my sincere opinion.<br/> <br/>What I think is very good in your photo is the contrast between the subjects and the background , I mean this is not the place where a bonsai I expected to be found (lol).The desaturation works great , it accentuates even more those different "worlds" , as if in a greyish world the unique beauty was the tree.I really don''t care if it''s a real bonsai or not , it looks like a bonsai and that''s enough for me !<br/> <br/>The face is very funny but maybe too appealing , this has surely made some viewers to vote a bit lower because the challenge was <i>Take a photo where a single tree is the <b>main</b> subject.</i> .<br/> <br/>The composition and execution are excellent , a very interesting photo that maybe didn''t meet exactly the challenge.<br/> <br/>Please feel free to email me about this critique , keep in mind that this is only my opinion.<br/> <br/></td>', 'From the Critique Club  Hi Arnthor ! I''m far from being an expert , so don''t expect precise technical comments , only my sincere opinion. What I think is very good in your photo is the contrast between the subjects and the background , I mean this is not the place where a bonsai I expected to be found (lol).The desaturation works great , it accentuates even more those different "worlds" , as if in a greyish world the unique beauty was the tree.I really don''t care if it''s a real bonsai or not , it looks like a bonsai and that''s enough for me ! The face is very funny but maybe too appealing , this has surely made some viewers to vote a bit lower because the challenge was Take a photo where a single tree is the main subject. . The composition and execution are excellent , a very interesting photo that maybe didn''t meet exactly the challenge. Please feel free to email me about this critique , keep in mind that this is only my opinion. ', '2006-09-21 11:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2853643, 391026, 54778, '<td valign="top">It''s such a memorable, different and dramatic pic that it deserved to ribbon. I actually like the whole smooth finish. The neatness gives it  surreality ..Congrats on the Ribbon.</td>', 'It''s such a memorable, different and dramatic pic that it deserved to ribbon. I actually like the whole smooth finish. The neatness gives it  surreality ..Congrats on the Ribbon.', '2006-09-21 11:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
