(2854598, 394155, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great shot Bragi. Congrats on your top 20 finish!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-21 16:29:39.</i></td>', 'Great shot Bragi. Congrats on your top 20 finish!', '2006-09-21 17:29:03.000000', '2006-09-21 17:29:39.000000', 0),
(2854641, 392125, 64571, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!!  I''m glad you got to shoot this - it was the first thing I thought of when I read the challenge.  I''m living in the Charleston area now and have heard about the tree but have never been.  Will you please send me a PM and give me directions.<br/> <br/>Thanks and congrats on the great finish!!!!!!</td>', 'Great shot!!!!  I''m glad you got to shoot this - it was the first thing I thought of when I read the challenge.  I''m living in the Charleston area now and have heard about the tree but have never been.  Will you please send me a PM and give me directions. Thanks and congrats on the great finish!!!!!!', '2006-09-21 17:44:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2855036, 391222, 20882, '<td valign="top">I love it.  The point of view is perfect.  Cropping is nice.  The saturation is good.  I wish the sky were a little more dramatic.  But the silver on gray is an interesting combination.  Maybe a night shot lit from below would be worthwhile.  Very cool image.</td>', 'I love it.  The point of view is perfect.  Cropping is nice.  The saturation is good.  I wish the sky were a little more dramatic.  But the silver on gray is an interesting combination.  Maybe a night shot lit from below would be worthwhile.  Very cool image.', '2006-09-21 21:02:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2855102, 394412, 8367, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on another ribbon with this excellent shot! You make it look so easy. ;)</td>', 'Congratulations on another ribbon with this excellent shot! You make it look so easy. ;)', '2006-09-21 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2855247, 393584, 3936, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Very interesting photo.<br/> <br/>Color saturation and hue are very good.  Brightness and contrast are good overall.  A couple of teh highlights on the "fronds" of the "tree" are washed out and very close to burn out.  Still acceptable though.<br/> <br/>Very nice blue on the sky.  Cloud pattern isn''t the best, but I''m not sure how to get clouds to do what the photographer wants.  ;-)<br/> <br/>I would agree with other comments that cropping the bottom to hid the mesh would result in a cleaner, less distracting picture.<br/> <br/>Overall I like this picture, and with the suggested crop I would have given it a 7 or 8.  Without, about a 6.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Very interesting photo. Color saturation and hue are very good.  Brightness and contrast are good overall.  A couple of teh highlights on the "fronds" of the "tree" are washed out and very close to burn out.  Still acceptable though. Very nice blue on the sky.  Cloud pattern isn''t the best, but I''m not sure how to get clouds to do what the photographer wants.  ;-) I would agree with other comments that cropping the bottom to hid the mesh would result in a cleaner, less distracting picture. Overall I like this picture, and with the suggested crop I would have given it a 7 or 8.  Without, about a 6.', '2006-09-21 22:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2855255, 392880, 31637, '<td valign="top">great score but this should of got a higher placing. I really think this offset composition and sillouette of tree make a nice addition to that rich sky. Nice job and im sorry the DPC mafia did not lobby for you here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-21 21:34:21.</i></td>', 'great score but this should of got a higher placing. I really think this offset composition and sillouette of tree make a nice addition to that rich sky. Nice job and im sorry the DPC mafia did not lobby for you here.', '2006-09-21 22:33:36.000000', '2006-09-21 22:34:21.000000', 0),
(2855320, 394389, 25150, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club! <br/> <br/>Well, where to begin...<br/>The first thing that comes to mind when I look at this image is: Why is it blurred? It''s a strong image that has the potential to really POP out at you, and the blur takes away so much of the potential. <br/> <br/>You following me?<br/> <br/>I tend to ramble when I comment, so please bear with me!<br/> <br/>Also, it seems WAY way way over-processed. I know that skin isn''t really that smooth... the use on NI seems to have taken away the realism of the shot. Almost plastic like texture to it.<br/> <br/>I''m also not really getting the crop. Well, maybe... but I''m leaning towards the feeling that if your gonna shoot with a crop like this, then i think it could almost be OVER exaturated, with even more sky on the top.<br/> <br/>Also, a little fill flash would have done wonders for the shadows/darkness of the girls face, or even just using a reflector (or if you don''t own a reflector, a stiff white board works perfectly)<br/> <br/>It''s a great concept for the challenge, and you really put a lot of thought into it, kudos to you! But I really think you could have been in the top 20 it if wasn''t blurred. IMO, most photos do not need much work, and many times, to much post production often degrades from a perfectly good image.<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/>E</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club!  Well, where to begin...The first thing that comes to mind when I look at this image is: Why is it blurred? It''s a strong image that has the potential to really POP out at you, and the blur takes away so much of the potential.  You following me? I tend to ramble when I comment, so please bear with me! Also, it seems WAY way way over-processed. I know that skin isn''t really that smooth... the use on NI seems to have taken away the realism of the shot. Almost plastic like texture to it. I''m also not really getting the crop. Well, maybe... but I''m leaning towards the feeling that if your gonna shoot with a crop like this, then i think it could almost be OVER exaturated, with even more sky on the top. Also, a little fill flash would have done wonders for the shadows/darkness of the girls face, or even just using a reflector (or if you don''t own a reflector, a stiff white board works perfectly) It''s a great concept for the challenge, and you really put a lot of thought into it, kudos to you! But I really think you could have been in the top 20 it if wasn''t blurred. IMO, most photos do not need much work, and many times, to much post production often degrades from a perfectly good image. Cheers!E', '2006-09-21 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2855897, 393905, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The Moire artefacts on the brick wall are distracting, though.</td>', 'Great composition.  The Moire artefacts on the brick wall are distracting, though.', '2006-09-22 02:50:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856407, 394489, 54778, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and colour.This is a good dramatic shot..my only concern is that the details of the upper half of the tree''s ends get lost in the colour..</td>', 'Lovely composition and colour.This is a good dramatic shot..my only concern is that the details of the upper half of the tree''s ends get lost in the colour..', '2006-09-22 10:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856459, 392880, 54778, '<td valign="top">Ouch.. this deserved so much more.. Probably the pp that got in the way.. very stunning colours..</td>', 'Ouch.. this deserved so much more.. Probably the pp that got in the way.. very stunning colours..', '2006-09-22 11:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856466, 394458, 54778, '<td valign="top">I actually think the tilt brings a lot more to the pic.. It would have been boring and average without the fence or the tilt..</td>', 'I actually think the tilt brings a lot more to the pic.. It would have been boring and average without the fence or the tilt..', '2006-09-22 11:03:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856489, 394247, 3942, '<td valign="top">800km? What an effort. Congrats on the ribbon and the wonderful shot!</td>', '800km? What an effort. Congrats on the ribbon and the wonderful shot!', '2006-09-22 11:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856597, 394247, 60899, '<td valign="top">Seriously you drove 800km to get the shot??????????????????</td>', 'Seriously you drove 800km to get the shot??????????????????', '2006-09-22 12:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
