(2877258, 392126, 31403, '<td valign="top">214? The textures alone in this make it worthy of at least 200!<br/> <br/>Haha?  Just kidding - I had it in the top 10% of the challenge - sorry, it usually is bad news for a photo if I love it cause I took time to look at it.<br/> <br/>The processing here is so cool.  I''d love a PM with more detail on how you do that.  The textures totally made this for me, although I admit I didn''t "get" what you were doing until just this very viewing.<br/> <br/>Hey, wait until YOU''RE this old - you''ll see how it is.<br/> <br/>Great work, looks like you had fun.  Love the creativity here.  Sorry others didn''t.</td>', '214? The textures alone in this make it worthy of at least 200! Haha?  Just kidding - I had it in the top 10% of the challenge - sorry, it usually is bad news for a photo if I love it cause I took time to look at it. The processing here is so cool.  I''d love a PM with more detail on how you do that.  The textures totally made this for me, although I admit I didn''t "get" what you were doing until just this very viewing. Hey, wait until YOU''RE this old - you''ll see how it is. Great work, looks like you had fun.  Love the creativity here.  Sorry others didn''t.', '2006-09-30 03:04:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2878267, 394247, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful shot.<br/>The mood &amp; tones are superb - well done and congrats on the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif"/></td>', 'This is such a beautiful shot.The mood & tones are superb - well done and congrats on the ', '2006-09-30 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 0),
