(2883446, 394269, 53572, '<td valign="top">stunning.</td>', 'stunning.', '2006-10-01 17:55:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2888498, 394256, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is pretty darn cool.  I suspect for the challenge (in which I neither entered or voted) some may not have seen a "tree" but if you ask me, the roots are kind of a giveaway.  I love the color - nearly "acid processed" - and I like the light/shadow play a lot.  I don''t at all mind the small sections that are "blown" - I don''t mind "blown" and in fact often think it adds to the shot.  Definitely NOT below a 5 in my book - in fact, should have been upper 5''s at a minimum.  Nice creative and different take on the challenge!</td>', 'This is pretty darn cool.  I suspect for the challenge (in which I neither entered or voted) some may not have seen a "tree" but if you ask me, the roots are kind of a giveaway.  I love the color - nearly "acid processed" - and I like the light/shadow play a lot.  I don''t at all mind the small sections that are "blown" - I don''t mind "blown" and in fact often think it adds to the shot.  Definitely NOT below a 5 in my book - in fact, should have been upper 5''s at a minimum.  Nice creative and different take on the challenge!', '2006-10-02 19:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2892340, 394530, 30982, '<td valign="top">A perfect kind of shot for this challenge - meets the description but has interest - something more than just a tree.  May be a tad on the darkish side.  A quick check in Photoshop shows you could add a little using levels and/or curves to bring out the colors/detail more.  Excellent composition overall.</td>', 'A perfect kind of shot for this challenge - meets the description but has interest - something more than just a tree.  May be a tad on the darkish side.  A quick check in Photoshop shows you could add a little using levels and/or curves to bring out the colors/detail more.  Excellent composition overall.', '2006-10-03 19:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2892378, 394450, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hey, you entered a challenge!  :-)  I''m trying to think of the artist/print this reminds me of, but I''ll never come up with it.  But whatever it is, it really reminds me of that.  I very much like this and cannot think of a single thing I''d want changed.  Tones, composition, exposure are all dead on.  Very nicely done, and underrated.</td>', 'Hey, you entered a challenge!  :-)  I''m trying to think of the artist/print this reminds me of, but I''ll never come up with it.  But whatever it is, it really reminds me of that.  I very much like this and cannot think of a single thing I''d want changed.  Tones, composition, exposure are all dead on.  Very nicely done, and underrated.', '2006-10-03 19:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2892396, 394184, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great title for this, and might I add incredibly underrated.  Sadly, I''m sure this suffered from the "DPC says it gotta be purty" factor.  This says a whole helluva lot, way more than a shot of a purty tree in a field.  And I love the symmetry of a car going each way on each side.  Well seen!</td>', 'Great title for this, and might I add incredibly underrated.  Sadly, I''m sure this suffered from the "DPC says it gotta be purty" factor.  This says a whole helluva lot, way more than a shot of a purty tree in a field.  And I love the symmetry of a car going each way on each side.  Well seen!', '2006-10-03 19:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903571, 394184, 24212, '<td valign="top">For me, this shot would have been an absolute knockout had the tree been in sharp focus. As it is, the tree looks a little soft, so much of the potential impact of this is lost and that''s a pity, as the idea behind it is so very good.</td>', 'For me, this shot would have been an absolute knockout had the tree been in sharp focus. As it is, the tree looks a little soft, so much of the potential impact of this is lost and that''s a pity, as the idea behind it is so very good.', '2006-10-06 16:10:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2904391, 394269, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-10-06 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2906514, 394210, 55838, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I remember voting on this one.  I voted 6 BTW.  This pic is beautifully composed!  Personally I think it would have scored better had it been edited a bit differently.  If you care for details read on -possible centering the tree truck by cropping slightly differently (if your pic allowed for this).  I think burning &amp; dodging and selective saturation in the tree leaves and on the steer (?) would have made this shot really pop and gained you several tenths (at least).  A little sharpening &amp; neat image might have worked too.  I might have even checked with SC to see if cloning out the two sticks to the right of the tree trunk would be OK too as they are a little distracting.  Once again you demonstrate great eye for composing animal shots.<br/> <br/>Sorry - I think I might have been having a Critique Club moment here!</td>', 'Hey!  I remember voting on this one.  I voted 6 BTW.  This pic is beautifully composed!  Personally I think it would have scored better had it been edited a bit differently.  If you care for details read on -possible centering the tree truck by cropping slightly differently (if your pic allowed for this).  I think burning & dodging and selective saturation in the tree leaves and on the steer (?) would have made this shot really pop and gained you several tenths (at least).  A little sharpening & neat image might have worked too.  I might have even checked with SC to see if cloning out the two sticks to the right of the tree trunk would be OK too as they are a little distracting.  Once again you demonstrate great eye for composing animal shots. Sorry - I think I might have been having a Critique Club moment here!', '2006-10-07 21:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2906678, 394210, 31399, '<td valign="top">aimee I love ya girl ;-)  the shot is not cropped at all.  not a great deal of PP.  I''ll have to redo it with your suggestions.  Making my images "pop" is one thing I REALLY need to improve on.  Also, I don''t know WHY I do better at animal shots...guess it''s cause I love em?shrugs.<br/> <br/>This shot was taken from a moving trolly attached to a trailer, hand-held 100/400.  I LOVED the steer and the shelter provided by the tree.</td>', 'aimee I love ya girl ;-)  the shot is not cropped at all.  not a great deal of PP.  I''ll have to redo it with your suggestions.  Making my images "pop" is one thing I REALLY need to improve on.  Also, I don''t know WHY I do better at animal shots...guess it''s cause I love em?shrugs. This shot was taken from a moving trolly attached to a trailer, hand-held 100/400.  I LOVED the steer and the shelter provided by the tree.', '2006-10-07 22:48:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908275, 394185, 55838, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful and a great score to boot.  Perfectly lovely golden tones in the sky with such a pleasing gradient.  So well done!</td>', 'Just beautiful and a great score to boot.  Perfectly lovely golden tones in the sky with such a pleasing gradient.  So well done!', '2006-10-08 14:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2909299, 391026, 66818, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, .. and since I too have a Rebel XT, It''s good to know that the 28-135mm lens will work on it, .. and it obviously does a great job.</td>', 'Beautiful, .. and since I too have a Rebel XT, It''s good to know that the 28-135mm lens will work on it, .. and it obviously does a great job.', '2006-10-08 23:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2911168, 393808, 10413, '<td valign="top">Hi Judith  So glad to see you back here entering. This is beautiful.  Such brilliant colors. I have hardly had time to pick up my camera lately. We are in the process of opening a computer store here and I have gotten back into doing webdesigning.  I am going to start making time, I really miss shooting.</td>', 'Hi Judith  So glad to see you back here entering. This is beautiful.  Such brilliant colors. I have hardly had time to pick up my camera lately. We are in the process of opening a computer store here and I have gotten back into doing webdesigning.  I am going to start making time, I really miss shooting.', '2006-10-09 12:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
