(2918969, 393508, 64175, '<td valign="top">This challenge was before I joined, but had I gotten to vote then, it would be a 9 with the 10 pending if the person under the tree was out of the photo (would like to see just the tree).<br/> <br/>Great Shot!</td>', 'This challenge was before I joined, but had I gotten to vote then, it would be a 9 with the 10 pending if the person under the tree was out of the photo (would like to see just the tree). Great Shot!', '2006-10-11 15:57:17.000000', NULL, 0),
